With TDI diesels, ask when the timing belt and the dual-mass flywheel were replaced and whether the particulate filter is still in place. Test a DSG gearbox when pulling away and in slow traffic, and ask for proof that its oil has been changed. Check an imported car by its chassis number, because clocked mileage is most common on popular models. Used parts for repairs are in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'volkswagen' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Škoda je čest izbor vozača koji mnogo prelaze: Octavia kao limuzina i karavan, manja Fabia, prostrani Superb i SUV modeli Yeti, Karoq i Kodiaq. Motori i menjači su isti kao kod marke [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen), pa majstora i delove nalazite bez muke.

Mnogo ovih automobila je služilo kao službeno ili taksi vozilo, pa stanje sedišta, volana i pedala uporedite sa prikazanom kilometražom. Tražite servisnu knjižicu sa pečatima i račune, a karavan pregledajte i u prtljažniku, gde se vidi koliko je tereta vozio. Kada prodajete, navedite motor, paket opreme i poslednji veliki servis. Za zimu i leto pogledajte ponudu u rubrici [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).', text_en = 'A used Škoda is a common choice for drivers who cover long distances: the Octavia as a saloon and an estate, the smaller Fabia, the roomy Superb and the SUVs Yeti, Karoq and Kodiaq. Engines and gearboxes are the same as in a [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen), so mechanics and parts are easy to find.

Many of these cars served as company cars or taxis, so compare the wear of the seats, steering wheel and pedals with the mileage shown. Ask for a stamped service book and invoices, and look inside the boot of an estate, where you can see how much cargo it carried. When selling, state the engine, the trim level and the last major service. For winter and summer, see what is on offer in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'skoda' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Audi traže kupci koji žele više opreme i udobnosti: A3 i A4 su najbrojniji, A6 je putnički automobil za duge relacije, a Q3, Q5 i Q7 pokrivaju SUV klasu. Mnogi modeli imaju pogon na sva četiri točka quattro i automatski menjač. Slične automobile nude [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) i [Mercedes-Benz](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mercedes).

Održavanje je skuplje nego kod običnih marki, pa je uredna servisna istorija važnija od niske cene. Proverite rad svih elektronskih sistema, od klime do parking senzora, i poslušajte menjač i prednji trap na lošem putu. Kod jačih dizela pitajte za dizne i lanac razvoda. Ako vam treba majstor koji poznaje marku, potražite ga među oglasima za [auto servise](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).', text_en = 'A used Audi attracts buyers who want more equipment and comfort: the A3 and A4 are the most numerous, the A6 is a car for long journeys, and the Q3, Q5 and Q7 cover the SUV class. Many models have quattro all-wheel drive and an automatic gearbox. Similar cars come from [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) and [Mercedes-Benz](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mercedes).

Maintenance costs more than with mainstream makes, so a tidy service history matters more than a low price. Check that all the electronics work, from the air conditioning to the parking sensors, and listen to the gearbox and front suspension on a rough road. With the stronger diesels, ask about the injectors and the timing chain. If you need a mechanic who knows the make, look among the ads for [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'audi' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Fiat je pristupačan gradski automobil sa jeftinim održavanjem: Punto, Panda, mali 500, porodični 500L koji se proizvodio u Kragujevcu, zatim Stilo, Tipo i Doblo. Zato je ponuda posebno bogata među oglasima za [automobile u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac).

Benzinski motori ovih modela dobro podnose ugradnju gasa, a pojedine verzije imaju fabrički metan: tražite atest za plinski uređaj i proverite da li je upisan u saobraćajnu dozvolu. Pogledajte pragove i ivice blatobrana zbog korozije i probajte servo volan i kvačilo. Starije domaće modele sa mehanikom ove marke naći ćete pod markom [Zastava](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/zastava), a potrošne i limarijske delove u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).', text_en = 'A used Fiat is an affordable city car that is cheap to maintain: the Punto, the Panda, the small 500, the family 500L that was built in Kragujevac, then the Stilo, Tipo and Doblo. That is why the offer is especially rich among the ads for [cars in Kragujevac](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac).

