UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Peugeot je na našim putevima godinama: mali 206, 207 i 208, kompaktni 307 i 308, limuzina 508 i SUV modeli 2008 i 3008. Kupci ga biraju zbog udobnog oslanjanja i štedljivih HDi dizela. Srodnu tehniku ima [Citroën](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/citroen), a u istoj klasi je i [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault).

Kod modela 206 poslušajte zadnju osovinu: ako su zadnji točkovi nakrivljeni ili se čuje lupanje, sledi skupa popravka. Kod dizela pitajte za turbinu, dizne i filter čestica, a robotizovani menjač probajte u gradskoj vožnji. Elektroniku proverite redom, od stakala do centralne brave. U oglasu napišite koji je motor, da li je vozilo prvi vlasnik i šta je rađeno na poslednjem servisu.', text_en = 'A used Peugeot has been on Serbian roads for years: the small 206, 207 and 208, the compact 307 and 308, the 508 saloon and the SUVs 2008 and 3008. Buyers choose it for the comfortable suspension and frugal HDi diesels. [Citroën](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/citroen) uses related technology, and [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault) is in the same class.

On the 206, listen to the rear axle: if the rear wheels lean inwards or you hear knocking, an expensive repair is coming. With diesels, ask about the turbo, the injectors and the particulate filter, and test a robotised gearbox in city driving. Go through the electronics one by one, from the windows to the central locking. In your ad, say which engine it has, whether the car has had one owner and what was done at the last service.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'peugeot' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Renault pokriva sve potrebe: Clio i Twingo za grad, Megane i Scenic za porodicu, Laguna za put, Captur i Kadjar za one koji vole višu poziciju sedenja, a Kangoo za majstore i dostavu. Jednostavniju i jeftiniju verziju iste tehnike nudi [Dacia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/dacia).

Kod dCi dizela pitajte za dizne, turbinu i redovnu zamenu ulja, jer ovi motori ne praštaju odlaganje servisa. Proverite karticu za startovanje i rezervnu karticu, električne podizače i rad klime. Na modelu Megane pogledajte i prednji trap. Kada postavljate oglas, navedite generaciju modela, snagu motora i da li je menjan zupčasti kaiš. Ako tražite pre svega radno vozilo, pogledajte i [kombije i kamione](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji).', text_en = 'A used Renault covers every need: the Clio and Twingo for the city, the Megane and Scenic for families, the Laguna for the road, the Captur and Kadjar for those who like a higher seating position, and the Kangoo for tradesmen and deliveries. [Dacia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/dacia) offers a simpler and cheaper version of the same technology.

With dCi diesels, ask about the injectors, the turbo and regular oil changes, because these engines do not forgive a postponed service. Check the start card and the spare card, the electric windows and the air conditioning. On the Megane, look at the front suspension as well. When you post an ad, state the generation of the model, the engine power and whether the timing belt has been replaced. If you mainly need a work vehicle, see [vans and trucks](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji) too.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'renault' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Toyota važi za automobil koji se retko kvari: Yaris za grad, Corolla i Auris u kompaktnoj klasi, Avensis za porodicu, RAV4 i C-HR među SUV modelima. Sve više je i hibrida, koji u gradskoj vožnji troše malo. Zbog takvog glasa ovi automobili sporije gube vrednost, pa cene uporedite sa ponudom marki [Honda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/honda) i [Mazda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mazda).

Kod hibrida tražite izveštaj o stanju pogonske baterije iz ovlašćenog servisa i proverite da li su obavljene sve servisne akcije proizvođača. Kod starijih dizela pitajte za potrošnju ulja i stanje dizni. Pouzdanost ne zamenjuje pregled: tražite servisnu knjižicu i odvezite automobil kod svog majstora. Prodavcima savetujemo da u oglasu navedu poreklo vozila i broj vlasnika.', text_en = 'A used Toyota has a reputation as a car that rarely breaks down: the Yaris for the city, the Corolla and Auris in the compact class, the Avensis for families, the RAV4 and C-HR among SUVs. There are more and more hybrids too, which use little fuel in city driving. Because of that reputation these cars lose value slowly, so compare prices with what [Honda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/honda) and [Mazda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mazda) offer.

With a hybrid, ask for a report on the traction battery from an authorised workshop and check that all the manufacturer''s recalls have been done. With older diesels, ask about oil consumption and the state of the injectors. Reliability does not replace an inspection: ask for the service book and take the car to your own mechanic. We advise sellers to state the origin of the car and the number of owners in the ad.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'toyota' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Ford nudi dobru vožnju za umeren novac: Fiesta u gradu, Focus kao hečbek i karavan, Mondeo i S-Max za put i porodicu, C-Max i Kuga za one kojima treba više mesta. Po ceni i opremi najbliži mu je [Opel](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/opel), pa vredi uporediti obe ponude.

