UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Mercedes-Benz je simbol udobnosti i trajnosti: A i B klasa za grad, C klasa kao najtraženija limuzina i karavan, E klasa za duga putovanja, zatim GLA, GLC i ML među SUV modelima. Stariji dizeli su poznati po velikim pređenim kilometražama.

Kod primeraka sa početka dvehiljaditih pogledajte lukove blatobrana, vrata i poklopac prtljažnika zbog korozije. Ako automobil ima vazdušno oslanjanje, proverite da li stoji ravno posle noći na parkingu. Automatski menjač treba da menja brzine glatko, a ulje u njemu se menja iako se često tvrdi suprotno. Tražite istoriju servisa po broju šasije. Slične automobile nude [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) i [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi), a majstore za ovu marku naći ćete među oglasima za [auto servise](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).', text_en = 'A used Mercedes-Benz stands for comfort and durability: the A-Class and B-Class for the city, the C-Class as the most wanted saloon and estate, the E-Class for long journeys, then the GLA, GLC and ML among SUVs. The older diesels are known for covering very high mileages.

On cars from the early 2000s, look at the wheel arches, doors and boot lid for rust. If the car has air suspension, check that it sits level after a night parked. An automatic gearbox should change gear smoothly, and its oil does need changing, although the opposite is often claimed. Ask for the service history by chassis number. [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) and [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi) offer similar cars, and mechanics for this make are among the ads for [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'mercedes' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Zastava je i dalje najjeftiniji put do sopstvenog automobila: Jugo, Zastava 101 i Skala, Florida, noviji model Zastava 10, ali i legendarni Fića, koji danas kupuju ljubitelji oldtajmera. Mehanika je jednostavna, pa mnoge popravke vlasnici rade sami.

Najveći neprijatelj ovih automobila je rđa: pregledajte pod, pragove, nosače i dno vrata, najbolje na kanalu. Pitajte da li je automobil garažiran, koliko dugo je stajao i da li je registrovan. Kod oldtajmera vrednost dižu originalni delovi, očuvan enterijer i uredni papiri. Delovi se lako nalaze u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a mnogo ponuda stiže iz grada u kom su ovi automobili pravljeni: pogledajte [automobile u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac). Noviju tehniku istog porekla ima [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat).', text_en = 'A used Zastava is still the cheapest way to a car of your own: the Yugo, the Zastava 101 and Skala, the Florida, the newer Zastava 10, and also the legendary Fića, which is bought by classic-car fans today. The mechanics are simple, so owners do many repairs themselves.

The worst enemy of these cars is rust: inspect the floor, sills, chassis members and door bottoms, ideally over a pit. Ask whether the car was garaged, how long it stood unused and whether it is registered. With classics, original parts, a preserved interior and tidy papers raise the value. Parts are easy to find in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and many offers come from the city where these cars were made: see [cars in Kragujevac](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac). [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat) has newer technology of the same origin.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'zastava' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Hyundai nudi mnogo opreme za svoju cenu: i10 i i20 za grad, i30 u kompaktnoj klasi, Tucson i ix35 među SUV modelima, a od starijih Getz i Accent. Mnogi primerci su kupljeni novi u Srbiji, pa imaju poznatu istoriju i domaću servisnu knjižicu.

Proverite da li je automobil redovno servisiran u ovlašćenom servisu, jer od toga zavisi fabrička garancija kod mlađih vozila. Kod dizela pitajte za dizne i filter čestica, a kod benzinaca sa gasom za atest. Probajte kvačilo, klimu i sve prekidače u kabini. Tehnički veoma sličan je automobil marke [Kia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kia), pa uporedite cene istog godišta. Ponudu možete suziti na svoj grad, na primer na [automobile u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).', text_en = 'A used Hyundai offers a lot of equipment for its price: the i10 and i20 for the city, the i30 in the compact class, the Tucson and ix35 among SUVs, and the older Getz and Accent. Many were bought new in Serbia, so they have a known history and a local service book.

Check that the car was serviced regularly at an authorised workshop, because the factory warranty of younger cars depends on it. With diesels, ask about the injectors and the particulate filter, and with petrol cars on gas ask for the certificate. Test the clutch, the air conditioning and every switch in the cabin. A [Kia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kia) is technically very similar, so compare prices for the same year. You can narrow the offer to your city, for example to [cars in Novi Sad](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'hyundai' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Dacia je automobil bez suvišnih dodataka i sa niskim troškovima: Sandero i Logan kao osnovni prevoz, Logan MCV i Lodgy za veću porodicu, Dokker za posao i Duster, jedan od najpovoljnijih SUV modela, koji postoji i sa pogonom na sva četiri točka. Motori i delovi potiču od marke [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault).

Jednostavna tehnika znači manje kvarova, ali pregled je i dalje obavezan. Proverite zaštitu od korozije na pragovima i ivicama vrata, stanje kvačila i trapa, a kod verzija sa fabričkim gasom datum važenja rezervoara. Pitajte da li je vozilo služilo kao taksi ili u auto-školi, jer takvi primerci prelaze mnogo više od proseka. U oglasu navedite nivo opreme i da li automobil ima klimu.', text_en = 'A used Dacia is a car without frills and with low running costs: the Sandero and Logan as basic transport, the Logan MCV and Lodgy for a bigger family, the Dokker for work and the Duster, one of the most affordable SUVs, which is also available with all-wheel drive. Engines and parts come from [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault).

Simple technology means fewer faults, but an inspection is still a must. Check the rust protection on the sills and door edges, the state of the clutch and suspension, and on versions with factory-fitted LPG the expiry date of the tank. Ask whether the car served as a taxi or in a driving school, because such cars cover far more than the average. In your ad, state the trim level and whether the car has air conditioning.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'dacia' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Mini je mali automobil sa mnogo karaktera: klasični hečbek sa troja ili petora vrata u verziji Cooper i jačim sportskim izvedbama, duži Clubman, kabriolet i veći Countryman, koji postoji i sa pogonom na sva četiri točka. Od 2001. godine razvija ga [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw), pa su i tehnika i cene održavanja bliže premijum klasi.

Kod benzinskih motora starijih generacija poslušajte lanac razvoda pri hladnom startu i proverite nivo ulja. Pogledajte panoramski krov i gumene dihtunge zbog prodora vode i probajte kvačilo. Trap je tvrd, pa niskoprofilne gume i felne često stradaju: pregledajte ih pažljivo. Mnogo primeraka ima posebnu opremu i boje, zato u oglasu nabrojte pakete. Ako želite jeftinije održavanje u sličnoj veličini, pogledajte [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat).', text_en = 'A used Mini is a small car with a lot of character: the classic hatchback with three or five doors as the Cooper and its sportier versions, the longer Clubman, the convertible and the bigger Countryman, which is also available with all-wheel drive. Since 2001 it has been developed by [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw), so both the technology and the maintenance costs are closer to the premium class.

On petrol engines of the older generations, listen to the timing chain on a cold start and check the oil level. Look at the panoramic roof and rubber seals for water leaks and test the clutch. The suspension is firm, so low-profile tyres and alloys often suffer: inspect them carefully. Many cars have special equipment and colours, so list the packs in your ad. If you want cheaper maintenance in a similar size, see [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'mini' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Honda je na ceni zbog izdržljivih benzinskih motora: Civic kao sportski nastrojen kompakt, Jazz sa izuzetno praktičnim zadnjim sedištima, Accord za put, CR-V i HR-V među SUV modelima. Ponuda je manja nego kod evropskih marki, pa dobri primerci brzo nađu kupca.

Benzinski motori vole redovnu zamenu ulja i podešavanje ventila, pa pitajte kada je to rađeno. Kod starijih modela pogledajte zadnje lukove blatobrana zbog rđe. Pojedini delovi su skuplji i čekaju se, zato pre kupovine proverite cene kod svog majstora. Sačuvajte pretragu i uključite obaveštenja e-poštom da vam novi oglas ne promakne. Sličnu pouzdanost nudi [Toyota](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/toyota), a istu marku naći ćete i među [motociklima](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli).', text_en = 'A used Honda is valued for its durable petrol engines: the Civic as a sporty compact, the Jazz with its remarkably practical rear seats, the Accord for the road, the CR-V and HR-V among SUVs. The offer is smaller than with European makes, so good cars find a buyer quickly.

The petrol engines like regular oil changes and valve adjustment, so ask when that was done. On older models, look at the rear wheel arches for rust. Some parts cost more and take time to arrive, so check prices with your mechanic before buying. Save the search and switch on email alerts so that a new ad does not slip past you. [Toyota](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/toyota) offers similar reliability, and you will find the same make among [motorcycles](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli) too.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'honda' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Mitsubishi je poznat po terencima i pogonu na sva četiri točka: Pajero i pikap L200 za teren i posao, Outlander i ASX za porodicu, a Colt i Lancer za svakodnevnu vožnju. Outlander postoji i kao hibrid koji se puni iz utičnice i kraće relacije prelazi na struju.

Kod terenaca pogledajte donji deo vozila: tragovi udaraca, korozija na šasiji i curenje iz diferencijala pokazuju kako je automobil vožen. Uključite pogon 4x4 i reduktor i proverite da li se lampice na tabli gase. Kod takvog hibrida tražite izveštaj o stanju baterije i proverite kabl za punjenje. Terenske gume potražite u rubrici [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a za poređenje pogledajte marke [Nissan](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nissan) i [Suzuki](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/suzuki).', text_en = 'A used Mitsubishi is known for off-roaders and all-wheel drive: the Pajero and the L200 pickup for rough ground and work, the Outlander and ASX for families, and the Colt and Lancer for everyday driving. The Outlander also exists as a plug-in hybrid, which covers short distances on electricity.

With off-roaders, look underneath: marks from impacts, rust on the chassis and leaks from the differential show how the car was driven. Engage 4x4 and low range and check that the warning lights on the dashboard go out. With a plug-in hybrid, ask for a battery report and check the charging cable. Look for off-road tyres in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and for comparison see [Nissan](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nissan) and [Suzuki](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/suzuki).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'mitsubishi' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Nissan je najtraženiji u klasi krosovera: Qashqai je model koji je tu klasu učinio popularnom, Juke je manji i upadljivijeg izgleda, a X-Trail veći i ozbiljniji na lošem putu. Tu su i Micra i Note za grad, kao i pikap Navara. Dizel motore mnogi modeli dele sa markom [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault).

Automatski menjač sa kontinualnom promenom prenosa probajte pažljivo: zavijanje, trzaji ili kašnjenje pri ubrzanju znače skupu popravku. Kod dizela pitajte za dizne i lanac razvoda. Pogledajte zadnji trap i amortizere, a kod modela sa panoramskim krovom i tragove vlage. Prodavci neka napišu da li automobil ima pogon na prednje ili na sva četiri točka. U istoj klasi je i [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi).', text_en = 'A used Nissan is most in demand in the crossover class: the Qashqai is the model that made the class popular, the Juke is smaller and more striking, and the X-Trail bigger and more capable on bad roads. There are also the Micra and Note for the city and the Navara pickup. Many models share their diesel engines with [Renault](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/renault).

Test a continuously variable automatic carefully: whining, jerks or a delay when accelerating mean an expensive repair. With diesels, ask about the injectors and the timing chain. Look at the rear suspension and the shock absorbers, and on models with a panoramic roof look for traces of damp. Sellers should say whether the car has front-wheel or all-wheel drive. [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi) is in the same class.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'nissan' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Kia je poslednjih godina sve prisutnija: Picanto i Rio za grad, Ceed kao hečbek i karavan, Sportage kao jedan od najprodavanijih SUV modela, i veći Sorento. Dizajn i oprema novijih generacija privlače kupce koji su ranije gledali samo nemačke marke.

Mlađa vozila mogu još biti pod fabričkom garancijom, ali samo ako je servisna knjižica uredno popunjena: tražite je na uvid. Kod dizela proverite dizne i filter čestica, kod automatika glatko menjanje brzina. Pregledajte lak, jer je na pojedinim modelima tanak i osetljiv na kamenčiće. Platforme i motore ova marka deli sa markom [Hyundai](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/hyundai). Ako kupujete uz kredit ili lizing, u filteru izdvojite ponude na rate.', text_en = 'A used Kia has become more and more common in recent years: the Picanto and Rio for the city, the Ceed as a hatchback and an estate, the Sportage as one of the best-selling SUVs, and the bigger Sorento. The design and equipment of the newer generations attract buyers who used to look only at German makes.

Younger cars may still be under factory warranty, but only if the service book is properly filled in: ask to see it. With diesels, check the injectors and the particulate filter; with automatics, smooth gear changes. Inspect the paint, because on some models it is thin and prone to stone chips. This make shares platforms and engines with [Hyundai](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/hyundai). If you are buying with a loan or leasing, single out the instalment offers in the filter.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'kia' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Mazda je izbor vozača koji žele pouzdan automobil sa preciznim upravljanjem: Mazda 2 za grad, Mazda 3 u kompaktnoj klasi, Mazda 6 kao limuzina i karavan, CX-3 i CX-5 među SUV modelima i dvosed MX-5 sa platnenim krovom za uživanje. Noviji benzinski motori bez turbine cenjeni su zbog jednostavnosti.

Slaba tačka starijih generacija je korozija: pregledajte zadnje blatobrane, pragove i pod prtljažnika. Kod dizela pitajte za filter čestica i nivo ulja, jer on kod pojedinih motora ume da raste. Kod modela MX-5 proverite da li krov prokišnjava i da li su odvodi vode prohodni. U oglasu istaknite da li je limarija sanirana i kada. Za poređenje pogledajte ponudu marki [Toyota](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/toyota) i [Honda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/honda), a ponude iz prestonice među [automobilima u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).', text_en = 'A used Mazda is the choice of drivers who want a reliable car with precise steering: the Mazda 2 for the city, the Mazda 3 in the compact class, the Mazda 6 as a saloon and an estate, the CX-3 and CX-5 among SUVs and the MX-5 roadster for fun. The newer non-turbo petrol engines are valued for their simplicity.

The weak point of the older generations is rust: inspect the rear wheel arches, sills and boot floor. With diesels, ask about the particulate filter and the oil level, which can rise on some engines. On an MX-5, check whether the roof leaks and whether the water drains are clear. In your ad, point out whether the bodywork has been repaired and when. For comparison see what [Toyota](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/toyota) and [Honda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/honda) offer, and offers from the capital among [cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'mazda' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Suzuki je mali, lagan i štedljiv automobil: Swift i Ignis za grad, SX4 i S-Cross kao kompaktni krosoveri, Vitara u više generacija i Jimny, mali terenac koji prolazi tamo gde veći ne mogu. Mnogi modeli imaju pogon na sva četiri točka, što ih čini traženim u brdskim krajevima.

Kod modela sa pogonom 4x4 proverite da li se pogon uključuje bez buke i vibracija. Jimny i starija Vitara imaju šasiju sa ramom: pogledajte je odozdo zbog korozije, posebno ako je vozilo išlo u lov ili šumu. Benzinski motori su jednostavni i dobro podnose gas. Za zimu u brdima potražite komplet u rubrici [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a veće terence nudi [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi).', text_en = 'A used Suzuki is a small, light and frugal car: the Swift and Ignis for the city, the SX4 and S-Cross as compact crossovers, the Vitara in several generations and the Jimny, a small off-roader that gets through where bigger ones cannot. Many models have all-wheel drive, which makes them sought after in hilly areas.

On 4x4 models, check that the drive engages without noise or vibration. The Jimny and the older Vitara have a ladder-frame chassis: look at it from below for rust, especially if the car was used for hunting or in the woods. The petrol engines are simple and take gas conversions well. For winter in the hills, look for a set in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and bigger off-roaders come from [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'suzuki' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Seat je španska marka sa nemačkom tehnikom: Ibiza u klasi malih automobila, Leon kao sportskiji rođak modela Golf, Altea za porodicu, Alhambra sa sedam sedišta i SUV modeli Arona i Ateca. Motori, menjači i platforme dolaze iz koncerna [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen), a cene su obično niže.

Važi isto što i za ostale automobile iz koncerna: kod TDI motora pitajte za zupčasti kaiš i zamajac, kod DSG menjača za servis. Verzije FR i Cupra često su vožene oštrije, pa pogledajte kvačilo, kočnice i gume i pitajte da li je motor čipovan. Proverite i rad klime i elektropodizača. Kada oglašavate, navedite tačnu oznaku motora i opremu. U istoj porodici je i [Škoda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/skoda).', text_en = 'A used Seat is a Spanish make with German technology: the Ibiza among small cars, the Leon as the sportier cousin of the Golf, the Altea for families, the seven-seat Alhambra and the SUVs Arona and Ateca. Engines, gearboxes and platforms come from the [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen) group, and prices are usually lower.

The same applies as for the other cars of the group: with TDI engines ask about the timing belt and the flywheel, with a DSG gearbox about its service. FR and Cupra versions are often driven harder, so look at the clutch, brakes and tyres and ask whether the engine has been remapped. Check the air conditioning and the electric windows too. When advertising, give the exact engine code and the equipment. [Škoda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/skoda) belongs to the same family.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'seat' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Volvo biraju porodice kojima je bezbednost najvažnija: V40 i stariji S40 i V50 u kompaktnoj klasi, S60 i V60 u srednjoj, veliki karavan V70 i SUV modeli XC60 i XC90. Sedišta su među najudobnijima u klasi, što se ceni na dugim putovanjima.

Petocilindrični dizeli su dugovečni, ali pitajte za dizne, turbinu i zupčasti kaiš. Kod automatskog menjača proverite da li menja bez trzaja i kada je menjano ulje. Kod modela XC90 sa pogonom na sva četiri točka pogledajte zadnji diferencijal i spojnicu. Delovi su skuplji nego kod masovnih marki, pa je račun iz servisa vredniji od obećanja. Po klasi i ceni slični su [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi) i [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw).', text_en = 'A used Volvo is chosen by families for whom safety comes first: the V40 and the older S40 and V50 in the compact class, the S60 and V60 in the middle class, the big V70 estate and the SUVs XC60 and XC90. The seats are among the most comfortable in the class, which is appreciated on long trips.

The five-cylinder diesels are long-lived, but ask about the injectors, the turbo and the timing belt. With an automatic gearbox, check that it changes without jerks and when its oil was changed. On an all-wheel-drive XC90, look at the rear differential and the coupling. Parts cost more than with mass-market makes, so a workshop invoice is worth more than a promise. [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi) and [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) are similar in class and price.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'volvo' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Alfa Romeo se kupuje srcem: 147 i Giulietta u kompaktnoj klasi, 156 i 159 kao limuzine i karavani, mali MiTo, a od novijih Giulia i SUV Stelvio. Dizajn i zvuk motora glavni su razlog što ovi automobili imaju verne vlasnike.

JTD dizeli važe za izdržljive, dok benzinci Twin Spark traže zamenu zupčastog kaiša na vreme: tražite račun, a ne usmeno uveravanje. Prednji trap sa više ramena troši se brže, pa poslušajte lupanje preko neravnina. Proverite elektroniku i lampice na instrument tabli. Najbolje je da automobil pregleda majstor koji radi baš ovu marku: potražite ga među oglasima za [auto servise](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi). Mnoge delove ova marka deli sa markom [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat).', text_en = 'A used Alfa Romeo is bought with the heart: the 147 and Giulietta in the compact class, the 156 and 159 as saloons and estates, the small MiTo, and among newer cars the Giulia and the Stelvio SUV. The design and the sound of the engine are the main reasons why these cars have loyal owners.

JTD diesels are considered durable, while Twin Spark petrol engines need their timing belt replaced on time: ask for the invoice, not for a verbal assurance. The multi-link front suspension wears faster, so listen for knocking over bumps. Check the electronics and the warning lights on the instrument panel. It is best to have the car inspected by a mechanic who works on this very make: look for one among the ads for [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi). This make shares many parts with [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'alfa-romeo' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Jeep je sinonim za terensko vozilo: Grand Cherokee je udoban i snažan, Cherokee nešto manji, Wrangler je pravi terenac sa skidivim krovom, a Compass i Renegade su gradski SUV modeli, od kojih neki imaju samo prednji pogon. Pre kupovine zato proverite koji pogon konkretan automobil zaista ima.

Veliki motori troše više goriva, pa je kod benzinaca česta ugradnja gasa: tražite atest. Pogledajte šasiju, kardane i diferencijale i pitajte koliko je vozilo korišćeno van asfalta. Vazdušno oslanjanje na skupljim verzijama treba da drži visinu. Kod uvoza iz Amerike proverite istoriju šteta po broju šasije. Terenske gume i felne tražite u rubrici [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a pouzdane japanske terence nudi [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi).', text_en = 'A used Jeep is a synonym for an off-road vehicle: the Grand Cherokee is comfortable and powerful, the Cherokee somewhat smaller, the Wrangler is a true off-roader with a removable roof, and the Compass and Renegade are urban SUVs, some of them with front-wheel drive only. So before buying, check which drive the particular car really has.

Big engines use more fuel, so petrol versions are often converted to gas: ask for the certificate. Look at the chassis, the propshafts and the differentials, and ask how much the car was used off the tarmac. Air suspension on the more expensive versions should hold its height. With imports from America, check the damage history by chassis number. Look for off-road tyres and wheels in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and reliable Japanese off-roaders come from [Mitsubishi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/mitsubishi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'jeep' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovna Tesla je najtraženiji električni automobil: Model 3 kao limuzina i Model Y kao porodični krosover, a ređe se nude i veća limuzina i veliki SUV sa zadnjim vratima koja se otvaraju nagore. Ponuda u Srbiji je još mala, pa sačuvajte pretragu i uključite obaveštenja e-poštom.

Najvažnije je stanje baterije: uporedite domet koji automobil prikazuje pri punoj bateriji sa fabričkim podatkom i pitajte da li garancija na bateriju i pogon još važi. Proverite koja je verzija pogona i baterije, da li su funkcije pomoći u vožnji plaćene i ostaju li uz vozilo, i da li se automobil normalno puni na brzim punjačima. Pregledajte uklapanje limarije, gume i trap, jer je automobil težak. Druge marke sa električnim i hibridnim pogonom naći ćete u rubrici [polovni automobili](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), a ponude iz prestonice među [automobilima u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).', text_en = 'A used Tesla is the most sought-after electric car: the Model 3 as a saloon and the Model Y as a family crossover, and more rarely the bigger saloon and the big SUV with rear doors that open upwards. The offer in Serbia is still small, so save the search and switch on email alerts.

The state of the battery matters most: compare the range the car shows at full charge with the factory figure and ask whether the battery and drive-unit warranty is still valid. Check which version of the drive and battery it is, whether the driver-assistance features are paid for and stay with the car, and whether the car charges normally at fast chargers. Inspect the panel fit, the tyres and the suspension, because the car is heavy. Other makes with electric and hybrid drive are in [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), and offers from the capital among [cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'tesla' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Porsche je automobil koji se kupuje posle duge pripreme: Cayenne i manji Macan su najčešći u oglasima, Panamera je brza limuzina, a 911, Boxster i Cayman klasični sportski automobili. Kod ovakvih vozila istorija je važnija od godišta.

Tražite kompletnu servisnu dokumentaciju i proveru u ovlašćenom servisu, gde se očitava i broj prekoračenja obrtaja motora. Kod modela Cayenne proverite vazdušno oslanjanje, kardan i hlađenje, a kod sportskih modela kvačilo, kočnice i tragove vožnje na stazi. Uporedite opremu sa fabričkom specifikacijom po broju šasije, jer dodaci znatno menjaju cenu. Računajte i na skuplje gume i registraciju. U sličnoj klasi SUV modela su [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi) i [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw).', text_en = 'A used Porsche is a car you buy after long preparation: the Cayenne and the smaller Macan are the most common in the ads, the Panamera is a fast saloon, and the 911, Boxster and Cayman are classic sports cars. With such cars the history matters more than the year.

Ask for the complete service records and an inspection at an authorised workshop, where the engine over-rev count is read as well. On a Cayenne, check the air suspension, the propshaft and the cooling; on sports models, the clutch, the brakes and signs of track use. Compare the equipment with the factory specification by chassis number, because options change the price considerably. Allow for more expensive tyres and registration too. [Audi](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/audi) and [BMW](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/bmw) are in a similar class of SUVs.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'porsche' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Chevrolet je kod nas najčešće povoljan gradski ili porodični automobil: Spark i Aveo za grad, Lacetti i Cruze u kompaktnoj klasi i Captiva sa sedam sedišta. Manji modeli nastavljaju liniju koju je započeo Daewoo, a noviji dele tehniku sa markom [Opel](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/opel).

Marka se povukla sa evropskog tržišta, pa pre kupovine proverite da li za konkretan model ima delova i ko ga u vašem gradu održava. Mehanika je jednostavna, a benzinci često voze na gas: tražite atest za uređaj. Kod dizela u modelima Cruze i Captiva pitajte za dizne i filter čestica. Pogledajte i limariju i lak. Potrošne i limarijske delove tražite u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a sličan odnos cene i opreme nudi [Dacia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/dacia).', text_en = 'A used Chevrolet in Serbia is most often an affordable city or family car: the Spark and Aveo for the city, the Lacetti and Cruze in the compact class and the seven-seat Captiva. The smaller models continue the line started by Daewoo, and the newer ones share technology with [Opel](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/opel).

The make has left the European market, so before buying check whether parts are available for the particular model and who maintains it in your city. The mechanics are simple, and petrol versions often run on gas: ask for the certificate of the system. With diesels in the Cruze and Captiva, ask about the injectors and the particulate filter. Look at the bodywork and paint as well. Look for service and body parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and [Dacia](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/dacia) offers a similar balance of price and equipment.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'chevrolet' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni motori Yamaha pokrivaju sve klase: sportski modeli R1 i R6, motocikli bez oklopa iz serije MT, putni enduro Tenere i Tracer, skuteri Aerox, NMAX, XMAX i TMAX, kao i kros i enduro motori YZ i WR. Zato ovde kupuju i početnici sa manjom kubikažom i iskusni vozači.

Pogledajte krajeve ručica, poklopce motora i oslonce za noge: ogrebotine na tim mestima govore da je motor padao. Proverite lanac i lančanike, semeringe prednje viljuške i da li motor pali iz prve na hladno. Kod jačih modela pitajte da li je snaga ograničena za A2 kategoriju i da li je to upisano u saobraćajnu dozvolu. Kacigu, jaknu i rukavice potražite u rubrici [moto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), a za teren pogledajte i [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm).', text_en = 'Used Yamaha motorcycles cover every class: the sporty R1 and R6, the unfaired MT series, the Tenere and Tracer adventure tourers, the Aerox, NMAX, XMAX and TMAX scooters, and the YZ and WR motocross and enduro bikes. That is why both beginners on smaller engines and experienced riders shop here.

Look at the bar ends, the engine covers and the footrests: scratches there tell you the bike has been dropped. Check the chain and sprockets, the front fork seals and whether the engine starts first time from cold. With the stronger models, ask whether the power is restricted for the A2 licence and whether that is entered in the registration document. Look for a helmet, jacket and gloves in [motorcycle gear](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), and for off-road riding see [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm) as well.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'motorcycles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'yamaha' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni Tomos je moped uz koji su odrasle generacije: APN 4 i APN 6, Automatik, T12, T14 i T15, kao i noviji modeli iz fabrike u Kopru. Danas ga kupuju i oni kojima treba jeftin prevoz po selu i gradu i kolekcionari koji restauriraju stare primerke.

Dvotaktni motor je jednostavan, a delova još ima, novih i polovnih. Pre kupovine proverite da li moped ima papire i može li da se registruje, jer se mnogi prodaju bez dokumenata. Poslušajte motor: teško paljenje i slaba vuča ukazuju na istrošen cilindar i klip. Kod primeraka za restauraciju vrednost dižu originalni rezervoar, sedište i farbani delovi. Kacigu potražite u rubrici [moto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), a klasične skutere pod markom [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa).', text_en = 'A used Tomos is the moped that generations grew up with: the APN 4 and APN 6, the Automatik, the T12, T14 and T15, and the newer models from the factory in Koper. Today it is bought both by those who need cheap transport around the village or town and by collectors who restore old examples.

The two-stroke engine is simple and parts are still available, new and used. Before buying, check that the moped has papers and can be registered, because many are sold without documents. Listen to the engine: hard starting and weak pull point to a worn cylinder and piston. On bikes for restoration, an original tank, seat and painted parts raise the value. Look for a helmet in [motorcycle gear](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), and for classic scooters under [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'motorcycles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'tomos' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni motori KTM su prvi izbor za vožnju van asfalta: enduro modeli EXC, kros motori SX, ali i ulični Duke i sportski RC u više kubikaža, kao i veliki putni Adventure. Narandžasta boja i lagana konstrukcija prepoznaju se izdaleka.

Kod enduro i kros motora ne gleda se kilometraža nego broj radnih sati i način održavanja: pitajte kada su menjani klip i ulje i koliko se često čistio filter vazduha. Pregledajte ram, ležajeve zadnje viljuške, vešanje i felne. Takmičarski modeli često nemaju papire za drum, pa unapred proverite da li motor može da se registruje. Za prevoz do staze poslužiće [prikolica](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice), zaštitnu opremu nudi rubrika [moto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), a slične modele ima i [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha).', text_en = 'Used KTM motorcycles are the first choice for riding off the tarmac: the EXC enduro models, the SX motocross bikes, but also the Duke street bikes and the sporty RC in several engine sizes, plus the big Adventure tourers. The orange colour and light build are recognisable from afar.

With enduro and motocross bikes you look at running hours and maintenance rather than mileage: ask when the piston and the oil were changed and how often the air filter was cleaned. Inspect the frame, the swingarm bearings, the suspension and the rims. Competition models often have no road papers, so check in advance whether the bike can be registered. A [trailer](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice) will carry it to the track, protective kit is in [motorcycle gear](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema), and [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha) has similar models.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'motorcycles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'ktm' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni skuteri Vespa spajaju italijanski stil i praktičnu gradsku vožnju: moderni automatici Primavera, LX i GTS i klasični modeli PX sa ručnim menjačem na ručici, koje traže kolekcionari. Za razliku od većine skutera, karoserija je od čeličnog lima.

Upravo zato najpre pregledajte lim: rđa na podu i ispod sedišta ili ulubljenja posle pada skupo se popravljaju. Kod klasičnih dvotaktnih modela proverite da li su brojevi motora i rama originalni i da li skuter ima uredne papire. Kod novijih modela pitajte za servis varijatora, kaiša i kočnica. Restaurirani primerci vrede onoliko koliko je posao kvalitetno urađen, pa tražite fotografije pre i posle. Ostale marke su u rubrici [motocikli i skuteri](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), a domaći klasik među mopedima je [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos).', text_en = 'Used Vespa scooters combine Italian style with practical city riding: the modern automatic Primavera, LX and GTS, and the classic PX models with a hand gear change on the grip, sought after by collectors. Unlike most scooters, the body is made of pressed steel.

That is exactly why you should inspect the metal first: rust on the floor and under the seat or dents after a fall are expensive to repair. On classic two-stroke models, check that the engine and frame numbers are original and that the scooter has proper papers. On newer models, ask about the service of the variator, belt and brakes. Restored examples are worth as much as the quality of the work, so ask for before and after photos. Other makes are in [motorcycles and scooters](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), and the local classic among mopeds is [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'motorcycles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'vespa' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Farovi, stop svetla, maglenke, migavci i sijalice, ali i auto elektrika: alternatori, anlaseri, bobine, senzori, prekidači i instalacije. Ovde se nude novi zamenski i polovni originalni delovi, često sa vozila koja se prodaju u delovima.

Far mora da odgovara modelu, godištu i tipu svetla: halogeni, ksenonski i LED farovi istog automobila nisu međusobno zamenjivi bez prepravki. Proverite nosače i ušice, da li je staklo zamagljeno ili napuklo i da li far ima oznaku homologacije. Farovi sa vozila iz Velike Britanije prave se za vožnju levom stranom i kod nas ne prolaze tehnički pregled. Kod ksenona pitajte da li uz far idu balast i sijalica. Elektriku je najbolje probati pre ugradnje, a ugradnju prepustiti električaru iz rubrike [auto servisi](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi). Ostale delove tražite u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).', text_en = 'Headlights, tail lights, fog lights, indicators and bulbs, plus car electrics: alternators, starter motors, coils, sensors, switches and wiring looms. New aftermarket and used original parts are offered here, often from cars that are being sold for parts.

A headlight must match the model, the year and the type of light: halogen, xenon and LED headlights of the same car are not interchangeable without modifications. Check the brackets and lugs, whether the lens is cloudy or cracked and whether the headlight carries an approval mark. Headlights from cars from Great Britain are made for driving on the left and do not pass the roadworthiness test in Serbia. With xenon, ask whether the ballast and the bulb come with the headlight. Electrical parts are best tested before fitting, and the fitting left to an auto electrician from [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi). Look for other parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'car-parts') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'lights' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u celoj Srbiji: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi za samce i studente, dvosobni i trosobni za porodice, stanovi u novogradnji i u starijim zgradama. Najviše oglasa stiže iz velikih gradova, pa pretragu možete početi od stranica [stanovi na prodaju u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd), [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad) ili [u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).

Filter „Oglašava“ odvaja ponude vlasnika od ponuda agencija, a kod agencije unapred pitajte kolika je provizija. U novogradnji tražite građevinsku i upotrebnu dozvolu i proverite investitora, a u starijoj zgradi stanje krova, fasade i liftova i visinu troškova održavanja. Kupci prvog stana u novogradnji mogu da ostvare povraćaj PDV-a. Kaparu dajte tek uz predugovor overen kod javnog beležnika. Ako još niste spremni za kupovinu, tu je [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Flats for sale all over Serbia: studios and one-bedroom flats for singles and students, two- and three-bedroom flats for families, flats in new developments and in older buildings. Most ads come from the big cities, so you can start your search with [flats for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd), [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad) or [in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).

The "Advertiser" filter separates owners'' offers from agencies'' offers, and with an agency ask in advance how much the commission is. In a new development, ask for the building and occupancy permits and check the developer; in an older building, check the roof, the facade and the lifts and the level of maintenance costs. First-time buyers of a flat in a new development can claim a VAT refund. Pay a deposit only with a preliminary contract certified by a notary public. If you are not ready to buy yet, there are [flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na duži period: namešteni i prazni stanovi, garsonjere, jednosobni i veći stanovi za porodice. Ponudu suzite po gradu i ceni, a u Beogradu i Novom Sadu i po delu grada. Najviše oglasa imaju [stanovi za izdavanje u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad) i [u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis).

Pre nego što date depozit, pogledajte stan uživo i uverite se da ga izdaje vlasnik ili ovlašćena agencija. Ugovor neka sadrži iznos kirije i depozita, otkazni rok i popis nameštaja i uređaja sa stanjem brojila na dan useljenja. Pitajte koliki su zimi računi za grejanje, da li su ljubimci dozvoljeni i ko plaća održavanje zgrade. Za prevoz stvari potražite ponude u rubrici [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz), a ako vam je dovoljna jedna prostorija, pogledajte [izdavanje soba](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Flats to rent for the longer term: furnished and unfurnished flats, studios, one-bedroom and bigger flats for families. Narrow the offer by city and price, and in Belgrade and Novi Sad by part of the city as well. Most ads are for [flats to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad) and [in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis).

Before you hand over a deposit, see the flat in person and make sure it is let by the owner or an authorised agency. The contract should state the rent and the deposit, the notice period and an inventory of furniture and appliances, with the meter readings on the day you move in. Ask how high the heating bills are in winter, whether pets are allowed and who pays for the upkeep of the building. For moving your things, look for offers in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz), and if a single room is enough, see [rooms to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Stan na dan je rešenje za kratak boravak: poslovni put, lekarski pregled, koncert, utakmicu ili vikend u drugom gradu. Stanovi su opremljeni posteljinom, peškirima i kuhinjom, a cena je po noćenju. Najveći izbor imaju [stanovi na dan u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd) i [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/novi-sad).

Pre rezervacije pitajte za tačnu adresu, sprat, parking i vreme prijave i odjave. Dogovorite da li cena važi po stanu ili po osobi i šta se doplaćuje. Nepoznatom izdavaocu ne šaljite ceo iznos unapred: uobičajena je manja akontacija, a ostatak se plaća pri preuzimanju ključa. Izdavaocima savetujemo da stave fotografije svih prostorija i napišu koliko gostiju stan prima. Ako planirate odmor van grada, pogledajte [smeštaj na planinama](/oglasi/odmor/planine) i [smeštaj u banjama](/oglasi/odmor/banje).', text_en = 'A flat by the day is the answer for a short stay: a business trip, a medical appointment, a concert, a match or a weekend in another city. The flats come with bed linen, towels and a kitchen, and the price is per night. The widest choice is among [flats by the day in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd) and [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/novi-sad).

Before booking, ask for the exact address, the floor, parking and the check-in and check-out times. Agree whether the price is per flat or per person and what costs extra. Do not send the whole amount in advance to a host you do not know: a small advance payment is usual, and the rest is paid when you collect the key. We advise hosts to post photos of every room and say how many guests the flat takes. If you are planning a break out of town, see [mountain accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/planine) and [spa accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/banje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'daily' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica na planinama, pored reka i jezera i u vikend naseljima nadomak gradova. U ponudi su zidane kuće, brvnare i montažni objekti, sa placem ili bez njega. Uz Dunav su tražene [vikendice na Srebrnom jezeru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/srebrno-jezero), a blizu prestonice [vikendice u okolini Beograda](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/beograd).

Vikendicu obiđite bar dva puta, jednom radnim danom i jednom vikendom, da vidite koliko je naselje živo i bučno. Proverite da li je objekat upisan u katastar i na kom je zemljištu: na poljoprivrednom ili šumskom zemljištu legalizacija ume da bude problem. Pitajte kako se zimi čisti put, odakle stiže voda i ko održava zajednički prilaz. Ako biste radije gradili po svojoj meri, pogledajte [prodaju placeva](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), a opšti pregled ponude daje rubrika [vikendice](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice).', text_en = 'Weekend cottages for sale in the mountains, by rivers and lakes and in weekend settlements close to the cities. On offer are brick houses, log cabins and prefabricated buildings, with a plot or without one. Along the Danube, [cottages at Srebrno Jezero](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/srebrno-jezero) are in demand, and near the capital, [cottages around Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/beograd).

Visit a cottage at least twice, once on a working day and once at a weekend, to see how lively and noisy the settlement is. Check that the building is entered in the land registry and what land it stands on: on farmland or forest land, legalisation can be a problem. Ask how the road is cleared in winter, where the water comes from and who maintains the shared access. If you would rather build to your own taste, see [land for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), and [cottages](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice) gives an overview of the whole offer.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća: porodične kuće u gradu i prigradskim naseljima, spratne kuće sa više stanova, seoska domaćinstva sa okućnicom i kuće u izgradnji. Počnite od grada koji vas zanima, na primer [kuće na prodaju u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) ili [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad), pa suzite po ceni i tome ko oglašava.

Kod kuće se plaća i ono što se ne vidi na fotografijama. Proverite da li je cela kuća legalizovana, uključujući dograđene delove i pomoćne objekte, i da li se površina u papirima slaže sa stvarnom. Pogledajte podrum zbog vlage, tavan zbog krova i pitajte ima li kuća kanalizaciju ili septičku jamu. Raspitajte se o godišnjim troškovima grejanja. Kome je bliža gradnja nove kuće, može da krene od oglasa za [građevinske placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi) i [montažne kuće](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/montazne-kuce).', text_en = 'Houses for sale: family houses in the city and the suburbs, multi-storey houses with several flats, village homesteads with a yard and houses under construction. Start with the city you are interested in, for example [houses for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) or [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad), then narrow by price and by who is advertising.

With a house you also pay for what the photos do not show. Check that the whole house is legalised, including extensions and outbuildings, and that the area in the papers matches the real one. Look at the cellar for damp and the attic for the roof, and ask whether the house has sewerage or a septic tank. Ask about the yearly heating costs. Those who lean towards building a new house can start with the ads for [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi) and [prefabricated houses](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/montazne-kuce).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje kuća biraju porodice kojima treba dvorište, više soba i parking, ali i firme koje traže prostor za kancelarije ili smeštaj radnika. U ponudi su cele kuće i spratovi kuća sa posebnim ulazom, nameštene i prazne. Primer lokalne ponude su [kuće za izdavanje u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac).

Kuća nosi više obaveza nego stan, pa ugovorom odredite ko kosi dvorište, čisti sneg i plaća sitne popravke. Pitajte čime se kuća greje i koliko to košta po sezoni, jer su troškovi veći nego u zgradi. Proverite pritisak vode, stanje bojlera i da li podrum i garaža ulaze u cenu. Ako planirate ljubimca ili rad od kuće sa strankama, dogovorite to unapred. Manje prostora uz manje brige nudi [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje), a ko razmišlja o kupovini, neka pogleda [prodaju kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja).', text_en = 'Houses to rent are chosen by families who need a yard, more rooms and parking, but also by companies looking for office space or accommodation for workers. On offer are whole houses and floors of houses with a separate entrance, furnished and unfurnished. One example of a local offer is [houses to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac).

A house brings more duties than a flat, so set out in the contract who mows the yard, clears the snow and pays for small repairs. Ask how the house is heated and what that costs per season, because the costs are higher than in a block of flats. Check the water pressure, the state of the water heater and whether the cellar and garage are included in the price. If you plan to keep a pet or work from home with clients, agree that in advance. [Flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje) offer less space with fewer worries, and those thinking about buying should see [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta: građevinske parcele u gradu i na obodu naselja, placevi za vikendicu, njive, voćnjaci, vinogradi, livade i šume. Cena najviše zavisi od lokacije i namene, pa uporedite više oglasa iz istog kraja, na primer [placeve u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad) ili [na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora).

U listu nepokretnosti pogledajte ne samo vlasnika nego i terete: hipoteke, zabeležbe sporova i pravo službenosti prolaza. Kod poljoprivrednog zemljišta vlasnici susednih parcela imaju pravo preče kupovine, pa prodavac prvo mora njima da ponudi zemlju. Dobro je da geometar pre isplate obeleži međe na terenu. Proverite ima li parcela izlaz na javni put ili se do nje dolazi preko tuđeg imanja. Ako kupujete radi gradnje, izdvojite [građevinske placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale: building parcels in the city and on the edge of settlements, plots for a cottage, fields, orchards, vineyards, meadows and forests. The price depends most on the location and the designated use, so compare several ads from the same area, for example [plots in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad) or [on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora).

In the land registry extract, look not only at the owner but also at the encumbrances: mortgages, notes of disputes and rights of way. With farmland, the owners of neighbouring parcels have a right of first refusal, so the seller must offer the land to them first. It is wise to have a surveyor mark the boundaries on the ground before you pay. Check whether the parcel has access to a public road or is reached across someone else''s property. If you are buying in order to build, single out [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Građevinski placevi za kuću, vikendicu ili poslovni objekat: parcele u gradu, u novim naseljima i na selu, sa priključcima ili bez njih. Vredi onaj plac na kome zaista možete da sagradite ono što ste zamislili, a to se proverava pre kupovine, ne posle.

U opštini zatražite informaciju o lokaciji: iz nje se vidi koliki deo parcele sme da se izgradi, koliko spratova i na kojoj udaljenosti od međe. Pitajte koliko su udaljeni struja, voda i kanalizacija i koliko koštaju priključci, a uračunajte i doprinos za uređenje građevinskog zemljišta. Na strmom ili nasutom terenu temelji su skuplji, pa se pre projekta radi ispitivanje tla. Širu ponudu daje [prodaja placeva](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), brže rešenje su [montažne kuće](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/montazne-kuce), a cigla, crep i armatura su u rubrici [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal).', text_en = 'Building plots for a house, a cottage or a commercial building: parcels in the city, in new settlements and in villages, with utility connections or without them. A plot is worth buying if you can really build what you have in mind on it, and that is checked before the purchase, not after.

Ask the municipality for the location information: it shows how much of the parcel may be built on, how many storeys and at what distance from the boundary. Ask how far away electricity, water and sewerage are and what the connections cost, and include the land development contribution in your budget. On sloping or filled ground the foundations cost more, so a soil survey is done before the design. [Land for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja) gives a wider offer, [prefabricated houses](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/montazne-kuce) are a quicker solution, and bricks, roof tiles and reinforcement are in [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'building-plots' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje soba je najpovoljniji način da se živi u većem gradu: soba u stanu sa gazdom, soba u stanu koji dele cimeri ili ležaj u dvokrevetnoj sobi. Ponuda je najveća pred početak akademske godine, kada se traže [sobe u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd) i [u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad), pa tada vredi reagovati brzo.

Sobu pogledajte uveče, kada su ukućani kod kuće: tako ćete videti koliko je stan bučan i kako se deli kupatilo. Pitajte da li se soba zaključava, sme li da se kuva i primaju gosti i na koliko meseci se izdaje. Kiriju plaćajte uz potvrdu ili preko računa. Izdavaocima savetujemo da jasno napišu traže li studenta, zaposlenu osobu ili par. Uz stanovanje se često traži i zarada, pa pogledajte [studentske i honorarne poslove](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi), a kad poželite više mira, [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Renting a room is the most affordable way to live in a bigger city: a room in a flat with the landlord, a room in a flat shared by flatmates or a bed in a twin room. The offer is biggest before the start of the academic year, when [rooms in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd) and [in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad) are in demand, so that is when it pays to act fast.

View the room in the evening, when the household is at home: you will see how noisy the flat is and how the bathroom is shared. Ask whether the room can be locked, whether cooking and guests are allowed and for how many months it is let. Pay the rent against a receipt or by bank transfer. We advise landlords to say clearly whether they want a student, a working person or a couple. Housing often goes together with earning, so see [student and part-time jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi), and when you want more peace, [flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'rooms') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Vulkanizeri u vašem gradu: sezonska zamena guma, montaža i balansiranje, krpljenje, ispravljanje felni, centriranje trapa i čuvanje drugog kompleta do naredne sezone. Neke radnje izlaze i na teren, kada guma pukne na putu ili ispred kuće.

Najveće gužve su u jesen, jer je zimska oprema obavezna kada na kolovozu ima snega ili leda, pa termin zakažite pre prvog snega. Pitajte da li cena obuhvata balansiranje i nove ventile i šta se doplaćuje za veće prečnike i gume sa ojačanim bokom. Posle zamene proverite pritisak i dotegnutost točkova nakon nekoliko desetina kilometara. Radnje mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa cenovnikom i radnim vremenom. Nove i polovne gume birajte u rubrici [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a mehaničare i limare među oglasima za [auto servise](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).', text_en = 'Tyre fitters in your city: seasonal tyre changes, fitting and balancing, puncture repair, rim straightening, wheel alignment and storage of the second set until the next season. Some workshops also come out to you when a tyre fails on the road or in front of your house.

The biggest queues are in autumn, because winter equipment is mandatory when there is snow or ice on the road, so book a slot before the first snow. Ask whether the price includes balancing and new valves and what costs extra for bigger diameters and run-flat tyres. After a change, check the pressure and the wheel bolts after a few dozen kilometres. Workshops can post an ad with a price list and opening hours for free. Choose new and used tyres in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and mechanics and body shops among the ads for [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'car-service') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tyre-service' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ketering i torte za svadbe, rođendane, krštenja, slave i poslovne događaje: slana i slatka zakuska, kuvana jela, posna i mrsna trpeza, torte po narudžbini i sitni kolači. Ponude dolaze od restorana, ketering kuća i poslastičara koji rade od kuće.

Pre porudžbine dogovorite broj gostiju i način posluženja: švedski sto, posluženje za stolom ili samo dostava hrane. Pitajte da li cena obuhvata posuđe, stolnjake i konobare i koliki je depozit za iznajmljeni inventar. Naglasite ako neko od gostiju ima alergiju ili ne jede određene namirnice. Kod torti unapred odredite ukus, broj parčadi i natpis, a poslastičaru pošaljite fotografiju modela koji želite. Proverite i do kada porudžbina može da se izmeni ili otkaže. Muziku, dekoraciju i fotografa potražite u rubrici [proslave](/oglasi/usluge/proslave), a domaće proizvode za trpezu među oglasima [domaća rakija, med i ajvar](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi).', text_en = 'Catering and cakes for weddings, birthdays, christenings, family feast days and business events: savoury and sweet buffets, cooked dishes, fasting and non-fasting menus, cakes made to order and small pastries. Offers come from restaurants, catering companies and pastry cooks who work from home.

Before ordering, agree the number of guests and the style of service: a buffet, table service or food delivery only. Ask whether the price includes crockery, tablecloths and waiters and how much the deposit for hired equipment is. Say so if any guest has an allergy or avoids certain foods. With cakes, decide the flavour, the number of slices and the inscription in advance, and send the pastry cook a photo of the design you want. Check until when the order can be changed or cancelled as well. Look for music, decoration and a photographer in [celebrations](/oglasi/usluge/proslave), and for home-made products for the table among the ads for [home-made rakija, honey and ajvar](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'events') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'catering' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni traktori IMT su najrašireniji na domaćim imanjima: mali IMT 533 i 539, univerzalni IMT 542 i 549, jači IMT 558, 560 i 577. Proizvodili su se u Beogradu, a cene se po jednostavnosti i dostupnosti delova: skoro svaki seoski majstor ume da ih popravi.

Kod traktora ovih godišta stanje je važnije od godine proizvodnje. Upalite motor na hladno i pogledajte boju dima, proverite pritisak ulja, kvačilo i hod menjača. Hidraulik treba da podigne priključak i da ga drži bez spuštanja. Pogledajte i prednju osovinu, upravljač i gume. Pitajte da li je traktor registrovan i ima li kabinu ili ram. Plugove, tanjirače i prskalice koji mu odgovaraju naći ćete među [priključnim mašinama](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine), a ostale marke u rubrici [traktori](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori).', text_en = 'Used IMT tractors are the most widespread on Serbian farms: the small IMT 533 and 539, the all-round IMT 542 and 549, the stronger IMT 558, 560 and 577. They were built in Belgrade and are valued for simplicity and the availability of parts: almost every village mechanic can repair them.

With tractors of this age, condition matters more than the year of manufacture. Start the engine from cold and look at the colour of the smoke, check the oil pressure, the clutch and the gear change. The hydraulics should lift an implement and hold it without sinking. Look at the front axle, the steering and the tyres too. Ask whether the tractor is registered and whether it has a cab or a roll bar. Ploughs, disc harrows and sprayers that suit it are among [tractor implements](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine), and other makes are in [tractors](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tractors') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'imt' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni traktori Belarus, poznati i pod oznakom MTZ, biraju se za teže poslove: oranje, tanjiranje i vuču prikolica. Najčešći su modeli MTZ 82 sa pogonom na sva četiri točka i MTZ 80 sa zadnjim pogonom, a nude se i jači traktori novijih serija.

Robusna konstrukcija podnosi mnogo, ali pregled ne treba preskočiti. Proverite prednji pogonski most i kardan kod modela sa vučom na sva četiri točka, pumpu hidraulika, kvačilo i curenje ulja na spojevima motora i menjača. Kabina starijih primeraka često je načeta rđom. Pitajte za radne sate i da li je rađena generalna popravka motora. Delovi su pristupačni i lako se nabavljaju. Za lakše poslove i manje parcele dovoljan je [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt), a prikolice i kombajne tražite u rubrici [poljoprivredne mašine](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).', text_en = 'Used Belarus tractors, also known by the MTZ badge, are chosen for heavier work: ploughing, disc harrowing and pulling trailers. The most common are the MTZ 82 with four-wheel drive and the MTZ 80 with rear-wheel drive, and stronger tractors of the newer series are offered as well.

The robust build takes a lot, but an inspection should not be skipped. Check the front drive axle and the propshaft on four-wheel-drive models, the hydraulic pump, the clutch and oil leaks at the joints of the engine and gearbox. The cab of older examples is often eaten by rust. Ask about the running hours and whether the engine has been overhauled. Parts are affordable and easy to get. For lighter work and smaller fields an [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt) is enough, and trailers and combines are in [farm machinery](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tractors') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'belarus' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni traktori Zetor stižu iz Češke i važe za udobnije i tiše od domaćih vršnjaka: stariji modeli sa oznakama poput 4911, 5211, 6211 i 7245, i novije serije Proxima i Forterra. Često imaju kabinu sa grejanjem, što mnogo znači u zimskim poslovima.

Pre kupovine proverite motor na hladno, kvačilo, menjač i hidraulik, a kod modela sa prednjom vučom i prednji most. Pogledajte da li kabina prokišnjava i rade li instrumenti i svetla. Pitajte za radne sate, ali ih uporedite sa istrošenošću pedala, sedišta i guma. Kod uvezenih traktora tražite carinske papire i proverite da li je traktor registrovan u Srbiji. Sličnu snagu po nižoj ceni nudi [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus), a setvospremače i sejalice naći ćete među [priključnim mašinama](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine).', text_en = 'Used Zetor tractors come from the Czech Republic and are considered more comfortable and quieter than Serbian tractors of the same age: older models with numbers such as 4911, 5211, 6211 and 7245, and the newer Proxima and Forterra series. They often have a heated cab, which means a lot for winter work.

Before buying, check the engine from cold, the clutch, the gearbox and the hydraulics, and on front-wheel-assist models the front axle too. See whether the cab leaks and whether the instruments and lights work. Ask about the running hours, but compare them with the wear of the pedals, seat and tyres. With imported tractors, ask for the customs papers and check that the tractor is registered in Serbia. [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus) offers similar power at a lower price, and seedbed cultivators and seed drills are among [tractor implements](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tractors') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'zetor' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni traktori Torpedo pravljeni su u Rijeci po licenci nemačke fabrike Deutz, sa vazdušno hlađenim motorima koji ne traže rashladnu tečnost. Najčešći su modeli Torpedo 4506, 4806, 6006 i 7506, a traže ih voćari, povrtari i mala gazdinstva.

Vazdušno hlađenje je jednostavno, ali rebra cilindara i limovi za usmeravanje vazduha moraju biti čisti: zapušen sistem pregreva motor. Proverite da li motor curi na glavama, kako radi pumpa visokog pritiska i u kakvom su stanju kvačilo i hidraulik. Fabrika više ne radi, pa pitajte prodavca gde nabavlja delove: mnogi su isti kao kod traktora Deutz. Pogledajte gume i felne, jer novi komplet znatno diže ulaganje. Za obradu između redova u voćnjaku pogledajte [motokultivatore i freze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), a širu ponudu daje rubrika [traktori](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori).', text_en = 'Used Torpedo tractors were built in Rijeka under licence from the German maker Deutz, with air-cooled engines that need no coolant. The most common models are the Torpedo 4506, 4806, 6006 and 7506, and they are sought by fruit growers, vegetable growers and small farms.

Air cooling is simple, but the cylinder fins and the air ducting plates must be clean: a clogged system overheats the engine. Check whether the engine leaks at the heads, how the injection pump works and what state the clutch and hydraulics are in. The factory no longer operates, so ask the seller where they get parts: many are the same as on Deutz tractors. Look at the tyres and rims, because a new set raises the investment considerably. For working between the rows in an orchard, see [two-wheel tractors and tillers](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), and [tractors](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori) gives a wider offer.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tractors') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'torpedo' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Priključne mašine za traktor: plugovi i tanjirače za osnovnu obradu, setvospremači i drljače, sejalice za žita i kukuruz, prskalice, rasipači đubriva, rotacione kosačice, sakupljači sena i balirke. Najviše oglasa stiže pred prolećne i jesenje radove, kada se oprema i najbrže prodaje.

Priključak birajte prema traktoru: proverite kategoriju trotačkog podizača, potrebnu snagu i težinu koju hidraulik može da nosi. Kod sejalica pregledajte setvene aparate i ulagače, kod prskalica pumpu, rezervoar i dizne, a kod balirki vezače i lance. Pitajte ima li rezervnih delova za tu mašinu i da li se još proizvodi. U oglasu navedite radni zahvat i broj radnih tela. Traktor odgovarajuće snage potražite u rubrici [polovni traktori](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori), a za baštu i plastenik dovoljni su [motokultivatori i freze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze).', text_en = 'Tractor implements: ploughs and disc harrows for primary tillage, seedbed cultivators and harrows, drills for cereals and maize, sprayers, fertiliser spreaders, rotary mowers, hay rakes and balers. Most ads arrive before the spring and autumn work, which is also when equipment sells fastest.

Choose an implement to suit the tractor: check the category of the three-point linkage, the power required and the weight the hydraulics can carry. On seed drills inspect the metering units and coulters, on sprayers the pump, tank and nozzles, and on balers the knotters and chains. Ask whether spare parts exist for that machine and whether it is still in production. In your ad, state the working width and the number of working bodies. Look for a tractor of suitable power in [used tractors](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori), and for a garden or polytunnel [two-wheel tractors and tillers](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze) are enough.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'farm-machinery') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'implements' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Motokultivatori, freze i kopačice za baštu, plastenik, voćnjak i vinograd. Manje kopačice sa benzinskim motorom dovoljne su za povrtnjak, dok jači motokultivatori sa dizel motorom vuku plug i prikolicu i pokreću kosu i frezu.

Probajte mašinu u zemlji, ne samo u dvorištu: tako se vidi da li kvačilo proklizava, da li menjač iskače iz brzine i koliko su noževi freze istrošeni. Motor treba da upali lako i da radi bez dima i lupanja. Pitajte koji priključci idu uz mašinu, jer plug, freza, kosa i prikolica zasebno koštaju mnogo. Pogledajte i ručke, sajle i gume. Za veće površine potrebni su traktor i [priključne mašine](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine). Travu oko kuće lakše održavaju [kosilice i trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), a za prolećnu sadnju pogledajte [rasad povrća i seme](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme).', text_en = 'Two-wheel tractors, rotary tillers and hoes for the garden, polytunnel, orchard and vineyard. Smaller petrol-engined hoes are enough for a vegetable patch, while stronger diesel two-wheel tractors pull a plough and a trailer and drive a cutter bar and a rotavator.

Try the machine in the soil, not just in the yard: that shows whether the clutch slips, whether the gearbox jumps out of gear and how worn the tiller blades are. The engine should start easily and run without smoke or knocking. Ask which attachments come with the machine, because a plough, rotavator, cutter bar and trailer cost a lot separately. Look at the handles, cables and tyres too. Bigger areas need a tractor and [tractor implements](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine). Grass around the house is easier to keep with [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), and for spring planting see [vegetable seedlings and seed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'farm-machinery') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tillers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ovce i koze na prodaju: jagnjad i jarad, šilježice i dviske za priplod, ovce sa jagnjadima, priplodni ovnovi i jarčevi. U oglasima se sreću rase virtemberg, il de frans, romanovska ovca, pramenka i cigaja, a kod koza alpska i sanska.

Kupujte iz stada koje možete da vidite. Zdrava životinja je živahna, ima čiste oči i nos, ravnomernu vunu ili dlaku i ne hramlje. Pogledajte zube da procenite starost, vime kod muzne koze i papke kod ovaca. Svako grlo treba da ima ušnu markicu i da potiče sa registrovanog gazdinstva, a za prevoz je potrebno uverenje o zdravstvenom stanju. Za priplod tražite podatke o roditeljima i broju jagnjadi po jagnjenju. Seno i koncentrat su u rubrici [stočna hrana](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), a krupnu stoku nudi stranica [krave i telad](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad).', text_en = 'Sheep and goats for sale: lambs and kids, young ewes for breeding, ewes with lambs, breeding rams and billy goats. The ads feature the Württemberg, Île-de-France and Romanov breeds, the Pramenka and the Tsigai, and among goats the Alpine and the Saanen.

Buy from a flock you can see. A healthy animal is lively, has clean eyes and nose and an even fleece or coat, and does not limp. Look at the teeth to judge the age, at the udder of a dairy goat and at the hooves of sheep. Every animal should have an ear tag and come from a registered holding, and a health certificate is needed for transport. For breeding stock, ask for details of the parents and the number of lambs per lambing. Hay and concentrate are in [animal feed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), and larger stock is on the page [cows and calves](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'livestock') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sheep-goats' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Konji na prodaju za jahanje, zapregu, rad i sport: lipicaneri, domaći hladnokrvnjaci, arapski i engleski punokrvni konji, kasači, poniji, kobile sa ždrebadima i ždrebad za odgoj. Prodaju ih odgajivači, ergele i vlasnici koji više nemaju uslova za držanje.

Konja obavezno probajte u onome za šta ga kupujete: pod sedlom, u zaprezi ili u vuči. Posmatrajte ga u hodu i kasu zbog hramanja, pogledajte kopita, noge i zube i obratite pažnju kako se ponaša pri timarenju i potkivanju. Svaki konj mora da ima pasoš i mikročip. Pre isplate vredi platiti pregled kod veterinara po svom izboru. Pitajte čime se konj hrani i kako podnosi prevoz. Za prevoz će vam trebati odgovarajuća [prikolica](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice), a seno i zob nudi rubrika [stočna hrana](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana).', text_en = 'Horses for sale for riding, driving, work and sport: Lipizzaners, local draught horses, Arabians and Thoroughbreds, trotters, ponies, mares with foals and young stock for rearing. They are sold by breeders, stud farms and owners who no longer have the means to keep them.

Always try a horse in what you are buying it for: under saddle, in harness or pulling. Watch it at walk and trot for lameness, look at the hooves, legs and teeth, and note how it behaves when groomed and shod. Every horse must have a passport and a microchip. Before paying, it is worth paying for an examination by a vet of your own choice. Ask what the horse is fed and how it travels. For transport you will need a suitable [trailer](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice), and hay and oats are in [animal feed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'livestock') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'horses' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Svinje i prasići na prodaju: prasići za tov i za ražanj, nazimice, suprasne krmače, nerastovi i tovljenici. Pored belih mesnatih rasa kao što su landras, jorkšir i durok, nude se i mangulica i moravka, domaće rase koje se drže na otvorenom.

Zbog afričke kuge svinja kupujte samo obeležene životinje sa uverenjem o zdravstvenom stanju i sa gazdinstva koje poznajete ili možete da obiđete. Zdravo prase je živahno, ima sjajnu dlaku, uvijen rep i dobro jede. Pitajte za težinu, starost, vakcinacije i čime su prasići hranjeni. Cena se obično ugovara po kilogramu žive vage, pa dogovorite merenje pred obema stranama. Kukuruz, ječam i koncentrate potražite u rubrici [seno, kukuruz i stočna hrana](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), a ostale vrste među oglasima [domaće životinje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje).', text_en = 'Pigs and piglets for sale: piglets for fattening and for the spit, gilts, in-pig sows, boars and fatteners. Besides white meat breeds such as Landrace, Yorkshire and Duroc, the Mangalica and the Moravka are offered too, local breeds kept outdoors.

Because of African swine fever, buy only tagged animals with a health certificate and from a holding you know or can visit. A healthy piglet is lively, has a glossy coat and a curled tail and eats well. Ask about the weight, age, vaccinations and what the piglets were fed. The price is usually agreed per kilogram of live weight, so arrange for the weighing to be done in front of both parties. Look for maize, barley and concentrates in [hay, maize and animal feed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), and for other species among the ads for [farm animals](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'livestock') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'pigs' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Krave i telad na prodaju: muzne krave, steone junice, telad za tov i odgoj, junad i priplodni bikovi. Najzastupnija je simentalska rasa, koja daje i mleko i meso, a u mlečnim stadima česta je i holštajn-frizijska.

Kod muzne krave pitajte koja je laktacija po redu, koliko mleka daje i kada je poslednji put osemenjena. Opipajte vime: treba da bude meko, bez čvorova i sa sve četiri ispravne četvrti. Pogledajte papke i hod, a kod teladi pupak i disanje. Svako grlo mora da ima ušne markice i pasoš, a podsticaji se mogu ostvariti samo za obeležena grla upisana u registar. Kupovinu većeg broja grla dogovorite uz veterinarski pregled. Kabastu hranu i koncentrate nudi rubrika [stočna hrana](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), a sitnu stoku stranica [ovce i koze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze).', text_en = 'Cows and calves for sale: dairy cows, in-calf heifers, calves for fattening and rearing, young cattle and breeding bulls. The most common breed is the Simmental, which gives both milk and meat, and the Holstein-Friesian is frequent in dairy herds.

With a dairy cow, ask which lactation she is in, how much milk she gives and when she was last inseminated. Feel the udder: it should be soft, without lumps and with all four quarters sound. Look at the hooves and the gait, and with calves at the navel and the breathing. Every animal must have ear tags and a passport, and subsidies per head can be claimed only for registered animals. Arrange the purchase of a larger number of animals with a veterinary examination. Roughage and concentrates are in [animal feed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), and small stock is on the page [sheep and goats](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'livestock') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'cattle' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Živina i pilići: jednodnevni pilići, brojleri za tov, koke nosilje pred pronošenjem, ćurke, guske, patke, morke i prepelice, kao i ukrasne rase kokošaka i rasplodna jaja. Najveća potražnja je u proleće, kada se obnavljaju dvorišna jata.

Kod nosilja pitajte za starost, jer nosivost posle druge godine primetno opada, i za to koje su vakcine primile. Jednodnevne piliće kupujte iz inkubatorske stanice ili od odgajivača koji može da pokaže matično jato. Zdrava ptica ima čiste oči i nozdrve i uredno, sjajno perje. Prevozite ih u prozračnim kutijama i izbegavajte vrućinu. Nova grla držite nekoliko nedelja odvojeno od starog jata. Hranu za piliće i nosilje nudi rubrika [stočna hrana](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), a golubove i ukrasne ptice tražite na stranici [papagaji, golubovi i ptice](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice).', text_en = 'Poultry and chicks: day-old chicks, broilers for fattening, point-of-lay hens, turkeys, geese, ducks, guinea fowl and quail, as well as ornamental chicken breeds and hatching eggs. Demand is highest in spring, when backyard flocks are renewed.

With laying hens, ask about the age, because laying drops noticeably after the second year, and about the vaccines they have had. Buy day-old chicks from a hatchery or from a breeder who can show you the parent flock. A healthy bird has clean eyes and nostrils and tidy, glossy plumage. Carry them in well-ventilated boxes and avoid heat. Keep new birds apart from the old flock for a few weeks. Feed for chicks and layers is in [animal feed](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/stocna-hrana), and pigeons and ornamental birds are on the page [parrots, pigeons and birds](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'livestock') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'poultry' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Voćne sadnice za dvorište i zasad: jabuka, kruška, šljiva, trešnja, višnja, kajsija, breskva, dunja, kalemljeni orah i leska, malina, kupina, borovnica i vinova loza. Prodaju ih rasadnici i proizvođači, sa golim korenom ili u saksiji.

Za zasad kupujte sertifikovane sadnice sa deklaracijom, na kojoj pišu sorta, podloga i proizvođač. Od podloge zavisi koliko će stablo biti bujno i na kom razmaku se sadi, pa je ne zanemarujte. Koren treba da bude svež i razgranat, a kalemljeno mesto zaraslo. Sadnice golog korena sade se u jesen i rano proleće, dok vegetacija miruje, a one u saksiji i kasnije. Pitajte za oprašivače, jer mnoge sorte ne rađaju same. Sistem kap po kap tražite u rubrici [oprema za navodnjavanje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), a ako tek birate parcelu za voćnjak, pogledajte [prodaju placeva i zemljišta](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja).', text_en = 'Fruit trees for the garden and the orchard: apple, pear, plum, sweet cherry, sour cherry, apricot, peach, quince, grafted walnut and hazel, raspberry, blackberry, blueberry and grapevine. They are sold by nurseries and growers, bare-rooted or in pots.

For an orchard, buy certified plants with a label that states the variety, the rootstock and the producer. The rootstock decides how vigorous the tree will be and at what spacing it is planted, so do not overlook it. The roots should be fresh and well branched, and the graft union healed. Bare-root trees are planted in autumn and early spring, while growth is dormant, and potted ones later too. Ask about pollinators, because many varieties do not fruit on their own. Look for drip irrigation in [irrigation equipment](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), and if you are still choosing a parcel for an orchard, see [plots and land for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'plants') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'fruit-trees' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Rasad povrća i seme za baštu i plastenik: paradajz, paprika, krastavac, kupus, salata, praziluk, lubenica i dinja, živići jagode, začinsko bilje, kao i seme starih domaćih sorti i hibrida. Sezona traje od kraja zime do početka leta.

Dobar rasad je nizak i zbijen, tamnozelenih listova i sa belim, razvijenim korenom. Izdužene i blede biljke gajene su bez dovoljno svetla i teže se primaju. Pitajte da li je rasad okaljen pre iznošenja na otvoreno i da li je kalemljen, što je važno kod lubenice i paradajza u plasteniku. Kod semena proverite godinu proizvodnje i klijavost na pakovanju. Proizvođači mogu besplatno da objave cene po komadu i po kontejneru. Zemlju za sadnju pripremaju [motokultivatori i freze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), a za višegodišnje zasade pogledajte [voćne sadnice](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice).', text_en = 'Vegetable seedlings and seed for the garden and the polytunnel: tomato, pepper, cucumber, cabbage, lettuce, leek, watermelon and melon, strawberry runners, herbs, as well as seed of old local varieties and of hybrids. The season lasts from the end of winter to the beginning of summer.

Good seedlings are short and compact, with dark green leaves and white, well-developed roots. Leggy, pale plants were grown without enough light and take less easily. Ask whether the seedlings were hardened off before going outdoors and whether they are grafted, which matters for watermelon and for tomato in a polytunnel. With seed, check the year of production and the germination rate on the packet. Growers can publish prices per plant and per tray for free. The soil for planting is prepared by [two-wheel tractors and tillers](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), and for perennial plantings see [fruit trees](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'plants') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'seedlings' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Mobilni telefoni Xiaomi nude mnogo za uloženi novac: serija Redmi za svakodnevnu upotrebu, POCO za one kojima treba jači procesor i glavna serija sa boljim kamerama. Zbog velikog broja modela i sličnih imena, u oglasu uvek tražite tačnu oznaku i količinu memorije.

Proverite da li je telefon globalna verzija sa srpskim jezikom i Google servisima, jer se uvoze i uređaji namenjeni kineskom tržištu. Prodavac treba da se odjavi sa svog Xiaomi naloga pre predaje, inače telefon ostaje zaključan posle vraćanja na fabrička podešavanja. Pogledajte ekran pod jakim svetlom, probajte punjenje, kamere i zvučnik. Pitajte ide li uz telefon originalni brzi punjač. Maske i zaštitna stakla naći ćete u rubrici [oprema za mobilne telefone](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone), a za poređenje pogledajte [Samsung](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/samsung).', text_en = 'Xiaomi mobile phones offer a lot for the money: the Redmi series for everyday use, POCO for those who need a faster processor and the main series with better cameras. Because there are many models with similar names, always ask for the exact model name and storage size in an ad.

Check that the phone is a global version with the Serbian language and Google services, because devices meant for the Chinese market are imported too. The seller should sign out of their Xiaomi account before handing it over, otherwise the phone stays locked after a factory reset. Look at the screen in strong light and try the charging, the cameras and the speaker. Ask whether the original fast charger comes with the phone. Cases and screen protectors are in [mobile phone accessories](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone), and for comparison see [Samsung](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/samsung).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'xiaomi' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni iPhone dugo dobija ažuriranja sistema i dobro drži cenu, pa je čest izbor i među korišćenim telefonima. U oglasima su modeli raznih generacija, u osnovnim, Pro i Pro Max verzijama, sa različitom memorijom, koja ne može naknadno da se proširi.

Najvažnije je da telefon bude odjavljen sa naloga iCloud i da je isključena opcija za pronalaženje uređaja: zaključan telefon je neupotrebljiv. U podešavanjima pogledajte zdravlje baterije i da li sistem prijavljuje neoriginalne delove, ekran ili bateriju. Proverite prepoznavanje lica ili otisak prsta, kamere, zvučnike i mikrofon u pozivu. Uporedite serijski broj na kutiji i u telefonu. Slušalice iste marke potražite na stranici [slušalice i AirPods](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), sat u rubrici [pametni satovi](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi), a računar među oglasima [MacBook laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple).', text_en = 'A used iPhone gets system updates for a long time and holds its price well, so it is a common choice among second-hand phones too. The ads include models of various generations, in standard, Pro and Pro Max versions, with different storage, which cannot be expanded later.

What matters most is that the phone is signed out of iCloud and that the option for finding the device is switched off: a locked phone is useless. In the settings, look at the battery health and whether the system reports non-genuine parts, screen or battery. Check face or fingerprint recognition, the cameras, the speakers and the microphone during a call. Compare the serial number on the box with the one in the phone. Look for earphones of the same make on the page [headphones and AirPods](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), a watch in [smartwatches](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi), and a computer among the ads for [MacBook laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'iphone' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Mobilni telefoni Samsung pokrivaju sve cenovne razrede: pristupačniji telefoni iz porodice Galaxy za svakodnevnu upotrebu, najjači modeli sa najboljim ekranima i kamerama i preklopni modeli za one koji žele nešto drugačije. Ponuda polovnih uređaja je velika, pa je lako uporediti cene istog modela u više gradova.

Ekrane ove marke prati jedna boljka: kod starijih primeraka mogu ostati tragovi stalno prikazanih elemenata. Otvorite belu pozadinu i pogledajte da li se naziru senke tastature ili ikonica. Proverite da li je telefon odjavljen sa naloga Samsung i Google i da li radi sa karticama svih operatera. Kod preklopnih modela pregledajte pregib ekrana i šarku. Pitajte da li je menjan ekran i da li je zamena rađena u ovlašćenom servisu. Povoljnija alternativa je [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi), a veći ekran nude [tableti](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti).', text_en = 'Samsung mobile phones cover every price range: the more affordable Galaxy phones for everyday use, the top models with the best screens and cameras, and the folding models for those who want something different. The offer of used devices is large, so it is easy to compare prices of the same model across several cities.

The screens of this make have one weakness: on older devices, traces of permanently displayed elements can remain. Open a white background and see whether shadows of the keyboard or icons show through. Check that the phone is signed out of the Samsung and Google accounts and that it works with SIM cards of all operators. On folding models, inspect the crease of the screen and the hinge. Ask whether the screen has been replaced and whether that was done at an authorised service centre. [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi) is a more affordable alternative, and [tablets](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti) offer a bigger screen.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'samsung' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Mobilni telefoni Huawei poznati su po dobrim kamerama i dugom trajanju baterije: modeli više klase sa naprednim kamerama i pristupačniji telefoni za svakodnevnu upotrebu. Pri kupovini je presudno jedno pitanje: da li telefon ima Google servise.

Stariji modeli, poput serije P30, imaju Google prodavnicu i sve uobičajene aplikacije. Noviji uređaji koriste sopstvenu prodavnicu aplikacija, pa pre kupovine proverite da li na njima rade bankarske i druge aplikacije koje su vam potrebne. U oglasu zato uvek tražite tačan model. Proverite ekran, bateriju i kamere i da li je telefon odjavljen sa naloga prodavca. Pitajte ide li uz telefon originalni punjač, jer brzo punjenje radi samo sa odgovarajućim. Ako su vam Google servisi neophodni, pogledajte [Samsung](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/samsung) ili [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi), a popravku ekrana nude [servisi za popravku uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Huawei mobile phones are known for good cameras and long battery life: upper-class models with advanced cameras and more affordable phones for everyday use. One question is decisive when buying: does the phone have Google services.

Older models, such as the P30 series, have the Google store and all the usual apps. Newer devices use the maker''s own app store, so before buying check that the banking and other apps you need work on them. That is why you should always ask for the exact model in an ad. Check the screen, the battery and the cameras and that the phone is signed out of the seller''s account. Ask whether the original charger is included, because fast charging works only with the right one. If you cannot do without Google services, see [Samsung](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/samsung) or [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi), and screen repairs are offered by [device repair services](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'huawei' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Mobilni telefoni Nokia danas znače dve stvari: jednostavne telefone sa tastaturom, čija baterija traje danima, i pametne telefone sa čistim sistemom Android. Traže se i stari modeli, kao što su 3310 i 6310, koje kupuju kolekcionari i oni kojima treba samo telefon za pozive.

Telefoni sa tasterima su dobar izbor za starije članove porodice, kao rezervni uređaj ili telefon za posao na terenu. Proverite tastaturu, zvučnik, glasnoću zvona i da li telefon prima karticu vašeg operatera, jer stariji modeli rade samo na mreži druge generacije. Kod pametnih modela pogledajte ekran i bateriju i pitajte do kada uređaj dobija ažuriranja. Kolekcionarski primerci vrede više sa originalnom kutijom i punjačem. Punjače i baterije nudi rubrika [oprema za mobilne telefone](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone), a ostale marke stranica [mobilni telefoni](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni).', text_en = 'Nokia mobile phones mean two things today: simple phones with a keypad, whose battery lasts for days, and smartphones with clean Android. Old models such as the 3310 and 6310 are in demand as well, bought by collectors and by those who need a phone just for calls.

Keypad phones are a good choice for older family members, as a spare device or as a phone for work in the field. Check the keypad, the speaker, the ring volume and whether the phone takes your operator''s SIM card, because older models work only on second-generation networks. With smart models, look at the screen and the battery and ask until when the device gets updates. Collectors'' pieces are worth more with the original box and charger. Chargers and batteries are in [mobile phone accessories](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone), and other makes on the page [mobile phones](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'nokia' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Mobilni telefoni Motorola cenjeni su zbog čistog sistema Android bez suvišnih dodataka: pristupačni modeli za svakodnevnu upotrebu, bolje opremljena viša serija i preklopni modeli koji oživljavaju čuveni dizajn na preklop. Dobar su izbor za one koji žele jednostavan telefon sa velikom baterijom.

Pre kupovine proverite za koje tržište je model pravljen i podržava li sve mrežne opsege domaćih operatera. Pogledajte ekran, probajte punjenje, kameru i čitač otiska prsta. Pitajte koliko je baterija stara i da li je telefon menjan u garantnom roku. Kod preklopnih modela pregledajte šarku i spoljašnji ekran. U oglasu navedite memoriju, boju i šta ide u kutiji. Slične telefone po sličnoj ceni nudi [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi), a ko traži samo telefon za pozive, neka pogleda marku [Nokia](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/nokia).', text_en = 'Motorola mobile phones are valued for clean Android without unnecessary extras: affordable models for everyday use, a better-equipped upper series and the folding models that revive the famous flip design. They are a good choice for those who want a simple phone with a big battery.

Before buying, check which market the model was made for and whether it supports all the network bands of Serbian operators. Look at the screen and try the charging, the camera and the fingerprint reader. Ask how old the battery is and whether the phone was replaced under warranty. On folding models, inspect the hinge and the outer screen. In your ad, state the storage, the colour and what is in the box. [Xiaomi](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/xiaomi) offers similar phones at a similar price, and anyone who wants a phone just for calls should look at [Nokia](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/nokia).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'phones') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'motorola' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni MacBook laptopovi dolaze u dve linije: lagani MacBook Air za učenje, kancelarijski rad i put i jači MacBook Pro za montažu, programiranje i dizajn. Noviji modeli sa procesorima koje Apple sam razvija rade tiše i znatno duže na bateriji od starijih sa procesorima Intel.

Proverite da li je računar odjavljen sa naloga iCloud i da nije pod upravljanjem neke firme ili škole, što se vidi pri prvom podešavanju. U sistemskom izveštaju pogledajte broj ciklusa i stanje baterije. Memorija i disk se kod novijih modela ne mogu nadograditi, zato odmah birajte dovoljno. Pregledajte tastaturu, ekran po ivicama i priključke za punjenje. Raspored tastera može biti američki ili evropski, pa pogledajte fotografije. Telefon iste marke potražite na stranici [iPhone](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/iphone), a ostale marke u rubrici [laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).', text_en = 'Used MacBook laptops come in two lines: the light MacBook Air for study, office work and travel, and the stronger MacBook Pro for editing, programming and design. The newer models with Apple''s own processors run more quietly and far longer on battery than the older ones with Intel processors.

Check that the computer is signed out of iCloud and is not managed by a company or a school, which shows during the first set-up. In the system report, look at the cycle count and the condition of the battery. Memory and storage cannot be upgraded on the newer models, so choose enough from the start. Inspect the keyboard, the edges of the screen and the charging ports. The keyboard layout may be American or European, so look at the photos. Look for a phone of the same make on the page [iPhone](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni/iphone), and for other makes in [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'laptops') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand = 'apple' AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Slušalice svih vrsta: bežične bubice, AirPods, slušalice preko ušiju sa poništavanjem buke, sportske, studijske i gejmerske sa mikrofonom. Mnoge se prodaju nove i neotpakovane, kao poklon koji nikome nije zatrebao.

Kod bežičnih bubica proverite da li obe slušalice i kutijica pune i drže bateriju i da li su odjavljene sa naloga prethodnog vlasnika. Kopije poznatih modela su česte: uporedite serijski broj na kutijici i u podešavanjima telefona i ne verujte ceni koja je previše dobra. Iz higijenskih razloga računajte na nove silikonske nastavke ili jastučiće. Kod žičanih modela savijte kabl kod priključka i poslušajte da li zvuk puca. Za društvo i dvorište bolji su [zvučnici](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici), a za ozbiljno slušanje muzike [gramofoni i hi-fi oprema](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi).', text_en = 'Headphones of every kind: wireless earbuds, AirPods, over-ear headphones with noise cancelling, sports, studio and gaming headsets with a microphone. Many are sold new and unopened, as a gift nobody needed.

With wireless earbuds, check that both earbuds and the case charge and hold their battery and that they are removed from the previous owner''s account. Copies of well-known models are common: compare the serial number on the case with the one in the phone settings and do not trust a price that is too good. For hygiene, allow for new silicone tips or ear pads. With wired models, bend the cable at the plug and listen for crackling. For company and the garden, [speakers](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici) are better, and for serious listening, [turntables and hi-fi equipment](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'audio') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'headphones' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Zvučnici za kuću, dvorište i put: prenosivi bluetooth zvučnici, veliki zvučnici za žurke sa mikrofonom, zvučnici za računar, zvučne letvice za televizor i klasične zvučne kutije za pojačalo. Izbor zavisi od toga gde ćete ih slušati i koliko glasno.

Prenosivi zvučnik probajte na većoj glasnoći: krčanje i zujanje znače oštećenu membranu. Pitajte koliko baterija traje i da li je zvučnik otporan na vodu, ako ga nosite na plažu ili reku. Kod pasivnih kutija skinite masku i pogledajte da li su membrane i gumeni obodi celi, jer oni vremenom pucaju. Snaga u vatima sama ne govori mnogo, pa zvuk poslušajte uživo. Pojačala i gramofone naći ćete na stranici [gramofoni i hi-fi oprema](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi), opremu za nastupe u rubrici [ozvučenje](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), a zvuk za film uz [televizore](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori).', text_en = 'Speakers for home, garden and travel: portable bluetooth speakers, big party speakers with a microphone, computer speakers, soundbars for the television and classic speaker cabinets for an amplifier. The choice depends on where you will listen and how loudly.

Try a portable speaker at higher volume: crackling and buzzing mean a damaged cone. Ask how long the battery lasts and whether the speaker is water-resistant, if you take it to the beach or the river. With passive cabinets, take off the grille and see whether the cones and rubber surrounds are intact, because they crack with time. Power in watts says little on its own, so listen to the sound in person. Amplifiers and turntables are on the page [turntables and hi-fi equipment](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi), gear for performances in [PA equipment](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), and sound for films alongside [televisions](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'audio') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'speakers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Gramofoni i hi-fi oprema za ljubitelje dobrog zvuka: gramofoni, pojačala i risiveri, CD plejeri, kasetofoni, tjuneri, zvučne kutije i muzičke linije. Posebno su tražene komponente iz sedamdesetih i osamdesetih godina, koje uz malo servisa sviraju decenijama.

Uređaj poslušajte uživo, na oba kanala i na raznim glasnoćama. Kod gramofona proverite iglu, zvučnicu, kaiš i da li tanjir drži ravnomernu brzinu. Kod pojačala okrenite potenciometre: krčanje se obično rešava čišćenjem, ali brujanje i izobličenje traže majstora. Pitajte da li je uređaj servisiran i da li su menjani kondenzatori. Težak uređaj je bolje preuzeti lično nego slati poštom. Ploče za novu iglu potražite u rubrici [gramofonske ploče](/oglasi/muzika/ploce-i-cd), popravku starih uređaja među oglasima [servis i popravka uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), a manje zahtevna rešenja na stranici [zvučnici](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici).', text_en = 'Turntables and hi-fi equipment for lovers of good sound: turntables, amplifiers and receivers, CD players, cassette decks, tuners, speaker cabinets and mini systems. Components from the seventies and eighties are especially sought after, as with a little servicing they play for decades.

Listen to the device in person, on both channels and at different volumes. On a turntable, check the stylus, the cartridge, the belt and whether the platter keeps an even speed. On an amplifier, turn the knobs: crackling is usually solved by cleaning, but hum and distortion call for a technician. Ask whether the device has been serviced and whether the capacitors have been replaced. A heavy device is better collected in person than sent by post. Look for records for the new stylus in [vinyl records](/oglasi/muzika/ploce-i-cd), repairs of old devices among the ads for [device servicing and repair](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), and less demanding solutions on the page [speakers](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'audio') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'hifi' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'PlayStation konzole i igrice: PS5 u verziji sa diskom i bez njega, PS4 u tanjem i u jačem izdanju, starije generacije za kolekcionare, kontroleri, igre na disku i oprema. Polovna konzola sa nekoliko igara često je najisplativiji način da se počne.

Tražite da konzola radi bar petnaestak minuta u zahtevnijoj igri: tako se čuje ventilator i vidi da li se uređaj pregreva. Proverite čitač diskova, sve priključke i povezivanje kontrolera. Palice kontrolera ne smeju same da pomeraju kursor. Prodavac treba da deaktivira konzolu na svom nalogu i vrati je na fabrička podešavanja. Uverite se i da nalog i konzola nisu blokirani za igranje preko mreže. Igre na disku možete kasnije preprodati, digitalne ostaju na nalogu. Za sliku pogledajte [televizore](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori), a porodičnu zabavu nudi [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo).', text_en = 'PlayStation consoles and games: the PS5 with a disc drive and without one, the PS4 in its slimmer and its stronger edition, older generations for collectors, controllers, disc games and accessories. A used console with a few games is often the most economical way to start.

Ask for the console to run for at least fifteen minutes or so in a demanding game: that lets you hear the fan and see whether the device overheats. Check the disc drive, all the ports and the pairing of the controllers. The controller sticks must not move the cursor on their own. The seller should deactivate the console on their account and restore it to factory settings. Make sure too that the account and the console are not banned from online play. Disc games can be resold later, while digital ones stay on the account. For the picture see [televisions](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori), and for family fun there is [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'consoles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'playstation' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nintendo Switch i igrice za celu porodicu: osnovni model koji se igra i na televizoru i u rukama, verzija sa OLED ekranom i manji model namenjen samo prenosnom igranju. Uz konzole se nude igre na karticama, dodatni kontroleri, postolja i torbice.

Najčešća mana su kontroleri čije palice vremenom počnu same da skreću: probajte ih u meniju i u igri. Proverite da li konzola puni, da li radi na televizoru preko postolja i da li ekran ima ogrebotine. Pitajte da li je konzola modifikovana, jer takve mogu biti isključene sa mrežnih servisa. Igre na karticama zadržavaju vrednost i lako se preprodaju, a deca ih rado menjaju. U oglasu navedite model, igre i opremu koja ide uz konzolu. Jaču grafiku nudi [PlayStation](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation), a igre bez ekrana potražite u rubrici [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke).', text_en = 'Nintendo Switch and games for the whole family: the standard model that is played both on the television and in the hands, the version with an OLED screen and the smaller model meant for handheld play only. Alongside the consoles there are games on cartridges, extra controllers, docks and cases.

The most common fault is controllers whose sticks start drifting over time: try them in the menu and in a game. Check that the console charges, that it works on the television through the dock and that the screen is not scratched. Ask whether the console has been modified, because such consoles can be banned from online services. Cartridge games keep their value and are easy to resell, and children like to swap them. In your ad, state the model, the games and the accessories that come with the console. [PlayStation](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation) offers stronger graphics, and for games without a screen look in [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'consoles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'nintendo' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Inverter klime hlade leti i greju zimi uz manju potrošnju struje od običnih uređaja, jer kompresor ne radi stalno punom snagom nego se prilagođava temperaturi u prostoriji. Zato su tiše i održavaju ravnomerniju temperaturu.

Ako klimu kupujete prvenstveno za grejanje, pogledajte do koje spoljne temperature uređaj radi i koliki mu je učinak na hladnoći: to piše u tehničkim podacima, ne u nazivu modela. Uporedite energetski razred posebno za hlađenje i posebno za grejanje. Kod polovnog uređaja pitajte koliko je star, da li je redovno čišćen i ko ga je demontirao. Novu klimu treba da ugradi ovlašćeni monter, inače garancija ne važi. Montažu i čišćenje nude [serviseri iz rubrike popravke uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), ostale tipove naći ćete među oglasima [klima uređaji](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji), a za najhladnije dane dobra je dopuna [TA peć](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci).', text_en = 'Inverter air conditioners cool in summer and heat in winter using less electricity than ordinary units, because the compressor does not run at full power all the time but adapts to the room temperature. That makes them quieter and the temperature more even.

If you are buying an air conditioner mainly for heating, look at the lowest outdoor temperature the unit works at and at its output in the cold: that is in the technical data, not in the model name. Compare the energy class for cooling and for heating separately. With a used unit, ask how old it is, whether it was cleaned regularly and who dismantled it. A new unit should be installed by an authorised fitter, otherwise the warranty is void. Installation and cleaning are offered by [technicians in device repairs](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), other types are among the ads for [air conditioners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji), and for the coldest days a [storage heater](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci) is a good addition.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'air-conditioners') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'inverter' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Norveški i uljani radijatori su tiho i bezbedno električno grejanje za sobu, kancelariju ili vikendicu. Norveški radijator je tanak zidni panel sa preciznim termostatom, koji brzo zagreva vazduh, dok se uljani radijator na točkićima sporije greje, ali drži toplotu i pošto se isključi.

Norveški radijatori imaju elektronski termostat i često program za dan i noć, pa troše struju samo dok ne postignu zadatu temperaturu. Proverite da li uz njega idu nosači za zid ili nožice. Kod uljanog radijatora pogledajte spojeve rebara: tragovi ulja znače da uređaj curi i da nije za upotrebu. Uključite ga i poslušajte da li termostat pravilno pali i gasi grejač. Za kupatilo birajte model sa zaštitom od prskanja vode. Brže, ali bučnije greju [grejalice i kaloriferi](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/grejalice-i-kaloriferi), a noćnu struju koriste [TA peći](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci).', text_en = 'Panel heaters and oil-filled radiators are quiet and safe electric heating for a room, an office or a cottage. A panel heater, known locally as a Norwegian radiator, is a slim wall unit with a precise thermostat that warms the air quickly, while an oil-filled radiator on castors heats up more slowly but keeps its warmth after being switched off.

Panel heaters have an electronic thermostat and often a day and night programme, so they draw electricity only until the set temperature is reached. Check whether wall brackets or feet come with it. On an oil-filled radiator, look at the joints between the fins: traces of oil mean the unit leaks and is not fit for use. Switch it on and listen whether the thermostat turns the element on and off properly. For a bathroom, choose a model with splash protection. [Fan heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/grejalice-i-kaloriferi) warm faster but more noisily, and [storage heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci) use night-rate electricity.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heaters') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'oil-radiators' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Grejalice i kaloriferi zagrevaju prostoriju za nekoliko minuta, pa su dobri za kupatilo, radionicu, garažu i dogrevanje u prelaznom periodu. U ponudi su kaloriferi sa ventilatorom, keramičke grejalice, kvarcne i halogene grejalice, infracrveni paneli i zidni modeli za kupatilo.

Kalorifer greje vazduh i čuje se dok radi, a kvarcna i infracrvena grejalica greju ono što je ispred njih i rade bez zvuka. Za stalno grejanje ovi uređaji troše mnogo struje, pa ih birajte za kraću upotrebu. Kod polovne grejalice pogledajte kabl i utikač: požuteli ili omekšali delovi znače pregrevanje. Proverite da li rade sve jačine i da li se uređaj sam gasi kada se prevrne. Ne ostavljajte ga uključenog bez nadzora ni blizu zavesa. Za grejanje preko cele noći bezbedniji su [norveški i uljani radijatori](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori), a ostale uređaje daje rubrika [grejalice](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice).', text_en = 'Fan heaters and electric fires warm a room in a few minutes, so they suit a bathroom, a workshop, a garage and top-up heating between seasons. On offer are fan heaters, ceramic heaters, quartz and halogen heaters, infrared panels and wall-mounted bathroom models.

A fan heater warms the air and can be heard while it runs, whereas quartz and infrared heaters warm whatever is in front of them and work silently. For constant heating these devices use a lot of electricity, so choose them for shorter use. On a used heater, look at the cable and plug: yellowed or softened parts mean overheating. Check that all the heat settings work and that the device switches itself off when it tips over. Do not leave it on unattended or near curtains. For heating through the night, [panel heaters and oil-filled radiators](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori) are safer, and other devices are in [heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heaters') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'fan-heaters' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'TA peći greju tako što se noću, po jeftinijoj tarifi, pune toplotom koju danju postepeno odaju u prostoriju. Zato su i dalje jedan od najisplativijih načina grejanja na struju u stanovima bez centralnog grejanja. U oglasima su peći raznih snaga, domaćih i stranih proizvođača.

Snaga peći se bira prema veličini i izolaciji prostorije, a priključak mora da izvede električar, jer jače peći traže trofaznu struju i poseban osigurač. Polovnu peć pogledajte dok radi: treba da se napuni, da ventilator duva tiho i da termostat reaguje. Pitajte da li su grejači i šamotne opeke celi. Pri prevozu se opeke vade i nose odvojeno, pa uračunajte vreme i pomoć, a selidbu teškog tereta nude oglasi u rubrici [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz). Bez akumulacije, ali uz jednostavnu montažu, greju [norveški i uljani radijatori](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori).', text_en = 'Storage heaters work by charging with heat at night, on the cheaper tariff, and releasing it gradually into the room during the day. That is why they remain one of the most economical ways of electric heating in flats without central heating. The ads include heaters of various outputs, from Serbian and foreign makers.

The output is chosen according to the size and insulation of the room, and the connection must be made by an electrician, because the stronger heaters need a three-phase supply and a separate fuse. See a used heater working: it should charge, the fan should blow quietly and the thermostat should respond. Ask whether the elements and the firebricks are intact. For transport the bricks are taken out and carried separately, so allow time and help, and moving a heavy load is offered by the ads in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz). [Panel heaters and oil-filled radiators](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori) heat without storage but are simple to install.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heaters') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'storage-heaters' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Roštilji i gril aparati za kuhinju, terasu i dvorište: električni roštilji i kontaktni gril tosteri, roštilji na ćumur, plinski roštilji sa poklopcem, zidani i limeni dvorišni roštilji, ražnjevi i pekači. Sezona kupovine počinje s prvim toplim danima, pred prvomajske praznike.

Kod električnog gril aparata pogledajte ploče: oštećen nelepljivi sloj znači da će se hrana lepiti. Proverite da li se ploče skidaju radi pranja i da li termostat radi. Kod roštilja na ćumur važni su debljina lima, stabilnost nogu i rešetka koja se lako čisti. Plinski roštilj tražite sa ispravnim crevom i regulatorom i probajte sve gorionike. Zidani roštilj se ne seli, pa je za dvorište praktičniji onaj na točkovima. Uz roštilj idu sto i klupe iz rubrike [baštenski nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj), za izlete pogledajte [kamp opremu](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), a drva i ćumur potražite u ponudi [ogreva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev).', text_en = 'Barbecues and grills for the kitchen, terrace and garden: electric grills and contact grill toasters, charcoal barbecues, gas barbecues with a lid, brick and sheet-metal garden barbecues, spits and roasters. The buying season starts with the first warm days, before the May Day holidays.

On an electric grill, look at the plates: a damaged non-stick coating means food will stick. Check whether the plates come off for washing and whether the thermostat works. With a charcoal barbecue, the thickness of the metal, the stability of the legs and a grate that is easy to clean are what count. Ask for a gas barbecue with a sound hose and regulator, and try all the burners. A brick barbecue cannot be moved, so one on wheels is more practical for a garden. A table and benches from [garden furniture](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj) go with a barbecue, for outings see [camping equipment](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), and look for wood and charcoal among [firewood](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'small-appliances') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'grills' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Pegle i parne stanice za svakodnevno peglanje: klasične pegle na paru, parne stanice sa odvojenim rezervoarom za veće količine veša, vertikalni parni aparati za osvežavanje odeće na vešalici i male putne pegle. Mnogo uređaja se prodaje gotovo nekorišćeno.

Pogledajte stopalo pegle: ogrebotine i zagoreli tragovi kače tkaninu. Sipajte vodu i proverite da li para izlazi ravnomerno iz svih otvora i da li pegla kaplje. Kamenac je glavni neprijatelj ovih uređaja, pa pitajte da li je korišćena destilovana voda i da li je rađeno čišćenje. Kod parne stanice proverite crevo između kotla i pegle i vreme zagrevanja. Parna stanica ima smisla ako peglate mnogo odjednom, a za nekoliko košulja nedeljno dovoljna je obična pegla. Ostale uređaje nudi rubrika [mali kućni aparati](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), a tehniku za pranje stranica [mašine za veš](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine).', text_en = 'Irons and steam generators for everyday ironing: classic steam irons, steam generators with a separate tank for bigger loads of laundry, vertical steamers for freshening clothes on a hanger and small travel irons. Many devices are sold almost unused.

Look at the soleplate: scratches and burnt marks catch the fabric. Fill it with water and check that steam comes out evenly from all the holes and whether the iron drips. Limescale is the main enemy of these devices, so ask whether distilled water was used and whether it was descaled. On a steam generator, check the hose between the boiler and the iron and the heat-up time. A steam generator makes sense if you iron a lot at once, while an ordinary iron is enough for a few shirts a week. Other devices are in [small kitchen and home appliances](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), and laundry equipment on the page [washing machines](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'small-appliances') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'irons' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Blenderi, mikseri i multipraktici za brzu pripremu hrane: stoni blenderi za kašaste sokove, štapni mikseri, ručni mikseri za kolače, mikseri sa posudom za testo, multipraktici sa noževima i rendalima, seckalice i sokovnici. Mnogi su dobijeni na poklon i prodaju se u originalnoj kutiji.

Vrednost ovih aparata je u nastavcima, pa proverite da li su svi na broju: metlice, spirale za testo, diskovi, posude i poklopci. Uključite aparat na svim brzinama i poslušajte motor, jer miris paljevine i neujednačen rad znače da je preopterećivan. Pogledajte noževe, zaptivke i da li posuda ima naprslina. Za testo birajte jači mikser sa posudom, a za supe i kašice dovoljan je štapni. Kafu uz kolače spremaju [aparati za kafu](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/aparati-za-kafu), a šerpe, tepsije i kalupe potražite u rubrici [posuđe i escajg](/oglasi/namestaj/posudje).', text_en = 'Blenders, mixers and food processors for quick food preparation: jug blenders for smoothies, stick blenders, hand mixers for cakes, stand mixers for dough, food processors with blades and graters, choppers and juicers. Many were received as gifts and are sold in the original box.

The value of these appliances lies in the attachments, so check that they are all there: whisks, dough hooks, discs, bowls and lids. Run the appliance at every speed and listen to the motor, because a burning smell and uneven running mean it was overloaded. Look at the blades and seals and check the bowl for cracks. For dough choose a stronger stand mixer, while a stick blender is enough for soups and purees. Coffee to go with the cakes is made by [coffee machines](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/aparati-za-kafu), and pots, baking tins and moulds are in [cookware and cutlery](/oglasi/namestaj/posudje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'small-appliances') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'blenders' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Paročistači i Kärcher uređaji za temeljno čišćenje bez hemije: ručni i podni paročistači, parni usisivači, perači pod pritiskom za dvorište, automobil i fasadu i usisivači za dubinsko pranje tepiha i nameštaja. Ime marke se kod nas često koristi za sve perače pod pritiskom.

Kod paročistača proverite da li kotao drži pritisak, da li para izlazi ravnomerno i ima li sve nastavke i krpe. Kamenac skraćuje vek grejača, pa pitajte kako je uređaj održavan. Perač pod pritiskom uključite sa vodom: pumpa ne sme da pulsira ni da curi, a crevo i pištolj treba da budu bez pukotina. Jačinu birajte prema nameni, jer uređaj za terasu i auto ne mora da bude profesionalan. Ako posao radije prepuštate drugima, pogledajte usluge [čišćenja](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje). Svakodnevno usisavanje olakšavaju [štapni i ručni usisivači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci), a sredstva za negu vozila su u rubrici [auto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema).', text_en = 'Steam cleaners and Kärcher machines for thorough cleaning without chemicals: handheld and floor steam cleaners, steam vacuum cleaners, pressure washers for the yard, the car and the facade, and carpet and upholstery washers. In Serbia the name of the make is often used for all pressure washers.

On a steam cleaner, check that the boiler holds pressure, that the steam comes out evenly and that all the attachments and cloths are there. Limescale shortens the life of the element, so ask how the device was maintained. Run a pressure washer with water: the pump must not pulse or leak, and the hose and the gun should be free of cracks. Choose the power to suit the job, because a device for the terrace and the car does not have to be professional. If you would rather leave the work to others, see [cleaning](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje) services. Everyday vacuuming is made easier by [stick and handheld vacuum cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci), and car care products are in [car accessories](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'vacuums') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'steam' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Štapni i ručni usisivači su uvek pri ruci: bežični štapni modeli za brzo usisavanje poda, modeli dva u jedan sa odvojivim ručnim delom, mali ručni usisivači za mrvice i automobil i štapni usisivači sa kablom. Nema kese ni vučenja creva po stanu.

Baterija je srce bežičnog usisivača i najskuplji deo za zamenu. Napunite uređaj i izmerite koliko radi na najjačem stepenu, pa to uporedite sa podatkom proizvođača. Proverite da li se četka slobodno okreće, da li su filteri čisti i celi i da li punjač i zidni nosač idu uz uređaj. Pitajte može li se baterija kupiti posebno za taj model. Za veliki stan sa tepisima štapni model teško zamenjuje klasičan usisivač, ali je odlična dopuna. Ostale tipove, od robota do usisivača sa vodenim filterom, nudi rubrika [usisivači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci), a za pranje podova parom pogledajte [paročistače](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci).', text_en = 'Stick and handheld vacuum cleaners are always at hand: cordless stick models for quick floor cleaning, two-in-one models with a detachable handheld unit, small handhelds for crumbs and the car, and corded stick vacuums. There is no bag and no hose to drag around the flat.

The battery is the heart of a cordless vacuum and the most expensive part to replace. Charge the device and time how long it runs on the highest setting, then compare that with the maker''s figure. Check that the brush turns freely, that the filters are clean and intact and that the charger and wall mount come with the device. Ask whether a battery can be bought separately for that model. In a big flat with carpets a stick model can hardly replace a classic vacuum cleaner, but it is an excellent addition. Other types, from robots to water-filter vacuums, are in [vacuum cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci), and for washing floors with steam see [steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'vacuums') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'stick' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Pumpe za vodu za kuću, baštu i gradilište: baštenske pumpe za zalivanje, hidrofori za snabdevanje kuće, potapajuće pumpe za bunare i cisterne, dubinske pumpe za bušene bunare, muljne pumpe za prljavu vodu i motorne pumpe na benzin za mesta bez struje.

Pumpu birajte prema bunaru, ne prema ceni. Površinska pumpa može da povuče vodu samo sa nekoliko metara dubine, pa je za dublje bunare potrebna potapajuća ili dubinska. Prodavcu recite dubinu vode, visinu na koju se voda diže i dužinu creva. Polovnu pumpu probajte u vodi: ne sme da bruji bez protoka niti da izbacuje osigurač. Kod hidrofora proverite posudu i presostat, a kod muljne pumpe plovak. Rad na suvo brzo uništava zaptivke, pa pitajte da li pumpa ima zaštitu. Creva, rasprskivače i sisteme kap po kap nudi rubrika [oprema za navodnjavanje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), a struju na njivi obezbeđuju [agregati](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati).', text_en = 'Water pumps for the house, garden and building site: garden pumps for watering, pressure sets for supplying a house, submersible pumps for wells and tanks, deep-well pumps for boreholes, sludge pumps for dirty water and petrol-engined pumps for places without electricity.

Choose a pump to suit the well, not the price. A surface pump can draw water only from a depth of a few metres, so deeper wells need a submersible or a deep-well pump. Tell the seller the depth of the water, the height it has to be lifted to and the length of the hose. Try a used pump in water: it must not hum without flow or trip the fuse. On a pressure set, check the vessel and the pressure switch, and on a sludge pump the float. Running dry quickly destroys the seals, so ask whether the pump has protection. Hoses, sprinklers and drip systems are in [irrigation equipment](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), and electricity in the field is provided by [generators](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'generators-pumps') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'pumps' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Agregati za struju za kuću, vikendicu, gradilište i tezgu: mali benzinski agregati za osnovne potrošače, dizel agregati za duži rad, inverterski agregati sa mirnim naponom za osetljivu elektroniku i trofazni agregati za mašine i radionice.

Saberite snagu svega što želite da priključite i dodajte rezervu, jer motori frižidera, pumpi i alata pri pokretanju vuku više struje nego u radu. Za računar, televizor i kotao sa elektronikom tražite agregat sa stabilizacijom napona ili inverterski model. Polovan agregat upalite na hladno i opteretite ga grejalicom ili alatom: napon ne sme da pada, a motor da se guši. Pitajte za radne sate i zamenu ulja. Priključenje na kućnu instalaciju sme da izvede samo električar, preko preklopnika. Agregat nikada ne sme da radi u zatvorenom prostoru. Trajnije rešenje bez goriva su [solarni paneli](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/solarni-paneli), a vodu bez mreže daju [pumpe](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/pumpe-za-vodu).', text_en = 'Power generators for the house, the cottage, the building site and the market stall: small petrol generators for basic loads, diesel generators for longer running, inverter generators with a steady voltage for sensitive electronics and three-phase generators for machines and workshops.

Add up the power of everything you want to connect and leave a reserve, because the motors of fridges, pumps and tools draw more current on start-up than when running. For a computer, a television and a boiler with electronics, ask for a generator with voltage regulation or an inverter model. Start a used generator from cold and load it with a heater or a tool: the voltage must not drop and the engine must not bog down. Ask about the running hours and oil changes. Connection to the house wiring may be done only by an electrician, through a transfer switch. A generator must never run in an enclosed space. [Solar panels](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/solarni-paneli) are a more lasting solution without fuel, and [pumps](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/pumpe-za-vodu) give you water off the grid.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'generators-pumps') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'generators' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kosilice za travu za svako dvorište: električne sa kablom, akumulatorske, benzinske koje se guraju, samohodne sa pogonom na točkove, vretenaste ručne, robotske i traktorske kosilice za velike površine. Najviše oglasa je u proleće, dok se u jesen kupuje povoljnije.

Širina košenja i zapremina korpe određuju koliko ćete puta preći dvorište i koliko često prazniti travu. Na neravnom i strmom terenu samohodna kosilica štedi leđa. Pitajte da li mašina ima malčiranje, kod koga sitno iseckana trava ostaje na travnjaku kao đubrivo. Kod polovne benzinske kosilice proverite da li pali iz nekoliko poteza, da li radilica vibrira posle udara noža u kamen i kako radi pogon točkova. Nož se oštri ili menja jeftino, ali krivo vratilo ne. Ivice i uske prolaze dovršavaju [trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/trimeri), a posle košenja prija odmor uz [baštenski nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj).', text_en = 'Lawn mowers for every garden: corded electric, battery, petrol push mowers, self-propelled mowers with driven wheels, hand reel mowers, robotic mowers and ride-on mowers for large areas. Most ads appear in spring, while buying in autumn is cheaper.

The cutting width and the size of the grass box decide how many passes you make and how often you empty the clippings. On uneven and steep ground a self-propelled mower saves your back. Ask whether the machine mulches, leaving finely chopped grass on the lawn as fertiliser. With a used petrol mower, check that it starts in a few pulls, whether the crankshaft vibrates after the blade has hit a stone and how the wheel drive works. A blade is cheap to sharpen or replace, but a bent shaft is not. Edges and narrow passages are finished by [trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/trimeri), and after mowing it is good to rest on [garden furniture](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mowers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'mowers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Trimeri za travu sređuju ono što kosilica ne može: ivice staza, prostor oko drveća i ograda, kanale, strmine i zarasle placeve. U ponudi su laki električni i akumulatorski trimeri za dvorište i benzinski trimeri, koje zovu i motorne kose, za gustu travu i šiblje.

Za travnjak je dovoljna glava sa najlonskom niti, a za korov i šiblje potreban je trimer koji prima nož ili disk sa zubima. Ravna osovina i ručke u obliku rogova znače jaču mašinu za duži rad, uz obavezan ramenski kaiš. Dvotaktni motori troše mešavinu benzina i ulja: pitajte u kom odnosu se meša. Polovan trimer upalite, dodajte gas i poslušajte da li glava vibrira ili osovina zuji. Radite sa zaštitnim naočarima ili vizirom i u dugim pantalonama. Zaštitnu opremu nudi rubrika [radna odeća i cipele](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), ravne površine brže sređuju [kosilice](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/kosilice), a za grane služe [motorne testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere).', text_en = 'Grass trimmers deal with what a mower cannot: path edges, the space around trees and fences, ditches, slopes and overgrown plots. On offer are light electric and battery trimmers for the garden and petrol trimmers, also called brushcutters, for thick grass and scrub.

For a lawn, a head with nylon line is enough, while weeds and scrub need a trimmer that takes a blade or a toothed disc. A straight shaft and cow-horn handles mean a stronger machine for longer work, with a shoulder harness as a must. Two-stroke engines burn a mix of petrol and oil: ask in what ratio it is mixed. Start a used trimmer, open the throttle and listen whether the head vibrates or the shaft whines. Work with safety glasses or a visor and in long trousers. Protective kit is in [workwear and safety shoes](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), flat areas are done faster by [lawn mowers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/kosilice), and [chainsaws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere) are for branches.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mowers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'trimmers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Brusilice i testere za sečenje i obradu metala, drveta i kamena: male i velike ugaone brusilice, vibracione i ekscentrične brusilice za drvo, kružne i ubodne testere, potezne i stone testere za precizne rezove i sabljaste testere za rušenje.

Kod ugaone brusilice uključite alat bez ploče i poslušajte: grebanje i jako varničenje na četkicama znače skori servis. Vreteno ne sme da ima zazor, a štitnik i bočna ručka moraju biti na alatu. Kod kružne testere proverite da li se zaštita lista vraća sama i da li je osnovna ploča ravna. Pitajte da li je alat hobi klase ili profesionalan, jer se razlikuju po izdržljivosti pri celodnevnom radu. Uvek koristite ploče koje odgovaraju prečniku i broju obrtaja alata. Naočare, rukavice i antifone potražite u rubrici [radna odeća i cipele](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), a uz sečenje obično treba i bušenje: pogledajte [bušilice i odvijače](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci).', text_en = 'Grinders and saws for cutting and working metal, wood and stone: small and large angle grinders, orbital and random-orbit sanders for wood, circular saws and jigsaws, mitre and table saws for precise cuts and reciprocating saws for demolition.

With an angle grinder, run the tool without a disc and listen: scraping and heavy sparking at the brushes mean a service is due soon. The spindle must have no play, and the guard and side handle must be on the tool. On a circular saw, check that the blade guard springs back by itself and that the base plate is flat. Ask whether the tool is hobby grade or professional, because they differ in how they stand up to all-day work. Always use discs that match the diameter and speed of the tool. Look for glasses, gloves and ear defenders in [workwear and safety shoes](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), and cutting usually goes with drilling: see [drills and screwdrivers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'power-tools') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'grinders' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Aparati za varenje za radionicu, garažu i teren: inverterski aparati za elektrolučno varenje elektrodom, aparati za varenje žicom u zaštiti gasa, TIG aparati za tanke limove, prohrom i aluminijum, klasični transformatori i aparati za tačkasto varenje.

Za kućne popravke, ograde i kapije najčešće je dovoljan inverter za elektrode, koji radi na običnu utičnicu. Za limariju i duže šavove praktičniji je aparat sa žicom, uz bocu sa gasom i reduktor. Pogledajte koliku struju aparat daje i koliko dugo može da vari bez pauze na toj struji. Polovan aparat probajte na debljem materijalu: luk treba da bude miran, a ventilator da radi. Proverite kablove, klešta i masu. Tražite i masku, najbolje automatsku, jer varenje bez zaštite trajno oštećuje vid. Za pripremu i čišćenje šavova trebaju vam [brusilice](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), a rukavice i kecelju nudi rubrika [radna odeća](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).', text_en = 'Welding machines for the workshop, the garage and work on site: inverter welders for stick welding, wire-feed welders with shielding gas, TIG machines for thin sheet, stainless steel and aluminium, classic transformers and spot welders.

For repairs around the house, fences and gates, a stick inverter that runs from an ordinary socket is usually enough. For bodywork and longer seams a wire-feed machine is more practical, with a gas cylinder and a regulator. Look at how much current the machine gives and for how long it can weld without a break at that current. Try a used machine on thicker material: the arc should be steady and the fan should run. Check the cables, the electrode holder and the earth clamp. Ask for a mask too, ideally an auto-darkening one, because welding without protection damages your sight for good. For preparing and cleaning seams you need [grinders](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), and gloves and an apron are in [workwear](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'power-tools') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'welders' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Bušilice i odvijači za kuću i gradilište: akumulatorske bušilice-odvijači, udarne bušilice za zid, čekić-bušilice za beton, udarni odvijači za duge šrafove, stubne bušilice za radionicu i mešači za lepak i malter.

Za sklapanje nameštaja i sitne popravke dovoljan je akumulatorski odvijač, dok za beton treba čekić-bušilica sa prihvatom za burgije bez ključa. Kod akumulatorskog alata cena baterija često prelazi cenu samog alata, pa proverite koliko ih dobijate, koliko drže i da li odgovaraju drugim alatima iste marke. Stegnite burgiju i pogledajte da li se vrti bez bacanja. Probajte obe brzine, udarac i promenu smera. Kofer sa burgijama i nastavcima podiže vrednost kompleta. Tiple, šrafove i lepak naći ćete u rubrici [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal), a za sečenje pogledajte [brusilice i testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere).', text_en = 'Drills and screwdrivers for the home and the building site: cordless drill-drivers, hammer drills for walls, rotary hammers for concrete, impact drivers for long screws, pillar drills for the workshop and mixers for adhesive and mortar.

For assembling furniture and small repairs a cordless screwdriver is enough, while concrete needs a rotary hammer with a keyless bit holder. With cordless tools the batteries often cost more than the tool itself, so check how many you get, how long they last and whether they fit other tools of the same make. Clamp a bit and see whether it runs true. Try both speeds, the hammer action and reverse. A case with bits and accessories raises the value of the set. Wall plugs, screws and adhesive are in [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal), and for cutting see [grinders and saws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'power-tools') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'drills' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Tuš kabine i kade za novo ili renovirano kupatilo: kvadratne i polukružne kabine, paravani i prolazni tuševi bez praga, tuš kade, akrilne i čelične kade, ugaone i samostojeće, kao i hidromasažne kabine i kade.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor i proverite jesu li zidovi pod pravim uglom, jer se kabina teško prilagođava krivim zidovima. Staklo treba da bude kaljeno, a točkići i šarke da klize bez zapinjanja. Kod polovne kabine tražite sve profile, zaptivne gume i šrafove, jer se delovi za starije modele teško nalaze. Akrilnu kadu pregledajte zbog naprslina, a hidromasažnu obavezno probajte sa vodom. Proverite gde je odvod i da li odgovara vašem sifonu. Vodu greju [bojleri](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/bojleri), zidove i pod oblažu [pločice](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), a šolju i lavabo birajte na stranici [WC šolje i lavaboi](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje).', text_en = 'Shower enclosures and bathtubs for a new or renovated bathroom: square and quadrant enclosures, screens and walk-in showers without a threshold, shower baths, acrylic and steel bathtubs, corner and freestanding ones, plus whirlpool cabins and tubs.

Before buying, measure the space and check that the walls are at right angles, because an enclosure is hard to adapt to crooked walls. The glass should be toughened, and the rollers and hinges should move without sticking. With a used enclosure, ask for all the profiles, seals and screws, because parts for older models are hard to find. Inspect an acrylic bathtub for cracks, and always try a whirlpool tub with water. Check where the waste outlet is and whether it suits your trap. Water is heated by [water heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/bojleri), walls and floor are covered with [tiles](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), and you can choose a toilet and basin on the page [toilets and washbasins](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bathroom') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'showers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'WC šolje i lavaboi za kupatilo i toalet: monoblok šolje sa vodokotlićem, konzolne šolje sa ugradnim vodokotlićem, šolje bez ivice koje se lakše čiste, bidei, lavaboi sa ormarićem, nadgradni i ugradni lavaboi i baterije.

Kod WC šolje je najvažniji položaj odvoda: u pod ili u zid. Šolja mora da odgovara postojećoj cevi, inače sledi razbijanje pločica. Izmerite i rastojanje od zida do sredine odvoda. Konzolna šolja traži ugradni element i čvrst zid ili oblogu od gips ploča. Keramiku pregledajte pod svetlom zbog sitnih naprslina i oštećene glazure, koja kasnije upija prljavštinu. Proverite da li uz šolju idu daska, vodokotlić i pribor za montažu. Kod lavaboa pogledajte otvor za bateriju i preliv. Tuš i kadu birajte na stranici [tuš kabine i kade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine), a ugradnju prepustite vodoinstalateru iz rubrike [majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Toilets and washbasins for the bathroom and cloakroom: close-coupled toilets with a cistern, wall-hung toilets with a concealed cistern, rimless pans that are easier to clean, bidets, basins with a vanity unit, countertop and inset basins and taps.

With a toilet, the position of the outlet matters most: into the floor or into the wall. The pan must match the existing pipe, otherwise tiles have to be broken. Measure the distance from the wall to the centre of the outlet too. A wall-hung pan needs a mounting frame and a solid wall or plasterboard cladding. Inspect the ceramic in good light for hairline cracks and damaged glaze, which later absorbs dirt. Check whether the seat, the cistern and the fixing kit come with the pan. On a basin, look at the tap hole and the overflow. Choose a shower and a bath on the page [shower enclosures and bathtubs](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine), and leave the fitting to a plumber from [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bathroom') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'toilets' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kotlovi na pelet i drva za centralno grejanje kuće: kotlovi na čvrsto gorivo, automatski kotlovi na pelet sa rezervoarom i dozatorom, kombinovani kotlovi i pirolitički kotlovi, koji drva sagorevaju potpunije. Nude se novi i polovni, često posle prelaska domaćinstva na gas ili toplotnu pumpu.

Prejak kotao je jednako loš izbor kao i preslab: radi prigušeno, katraniše dimnjak i troši više. Snagu neka izračuna instalater prema površini i izolaciji kuće. Polovan kotao pregledajte iznutra: ložište, rešetka i izmenjivač ne smeju biti progoreli ni da cure. Kod kotla na pelet proverite gorionik, puž i elektroniku. Pitajte koliko je sezona kotao radio i da li je imao zaštitu od hladnog povrata. Dimnjak mora da odgovara kotlu po prečniku i visini. Gorivo birajte u rubrici [pelet i drva za ogrev](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev), grejna tela na stranici [radijatori](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori), a ugradnju poverite stručnjaku iz rubrike [majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Pellet and wood boilers for the central heating of a house: solid-fuel boilers, automatic pellet boilers with a hopper and feeder, combination boilers and gasification boilers, which burn wood more completely. They are offered new and used, often after a household has switched to gas or a heat pump.

An oversized boiler is as bad a choice as an undersized one: it runs throttled, tars up the chimney and uses more fuel. Have a heating engineer work out the output from the area and insulation of the house. Inspect a used boiler inside: the firebox, the grate and the heat exchanger must not be burnt through or leaking. On a pellet boiler, check the burner, the auger and the electronics. Ask how many seasons the boiler has worked and whether it had protection against cold return water. The chimney must suit the boiler in diameter and height. Choose fuel in [pellets and firewood](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev), heat emitters on the page [radiators](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori), and entrust the installation to a specialist from [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heating') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'boilers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Radijatori za centralno grejanje: aluminijumski člankasti radijatori, čelični panelni radijatori, stari liveni radijatori, koji dugo drže toplotu, i kupatilski radijatori za sušenje peškira. Prodaju se novi iz viškova sa gradilišta i polovni posle renoviranja.

Broj članaka ili veličinu panela ne birajte odoka: potrebna snaga zavisi od veličine prostorije, izolacije i temperature vode u sistemu, a sistemi sa toplotnom pumpom traže veće radijatore. Polovne radijatore pogledajte na spojevima i dnu, gde se javljaju korozija i curenje, i pitajte da li su ispirani. Liveni radijatori su teški, ali skoro neuništivi, i vraćaju se u enterijere starih stanova. Proverite razmak između priključaka, da odgovara vašim cevima. Uz radijatore uzmite ventile, termostatske glave i nosače. Izvor toplote birajte na stranici [kotlovi na pelet i drva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), a tamo gde nema centralnog grejanja rešenje su [norveški i uljani radijatori](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori).', text_en = 'Radiators for central heating: aluminium sectional radiators, steel panel radiators, old cast-iron radiators that hold heat for a long time, and bathroom towel radiators. They are sold new from building-site surplus and used after renovations.

Do not pick the number of sections or the panel size by eye: the output needed depends on the size of the room, the insulation and the water temperature in the system, and heat-pump systems require bigger radiators. Look at used radiators at the joints and the bottom, where corrosion and leaks appear, and ask whether they have been flushed. Cast-iron radiators are heavy but almost indestructible, and are returning to the interiors of old flats. Check that the distance between the connections suits your pipes. Get valves, thermostatic heads and brackets with the radiators. Choose the heat source on the page [pellet and wood boilers](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), and where there is no central heating, [panel heaters and oil-filled radiators](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori) are the answer.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heating') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'radiators' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Peći na drva i pelet greju bez centralnog sistema: klasične peći na drva, šporeti na čvrsto gorivo na kojima se i kuva, kamini i kaminske peći sa staklom, peći na pelet sa termostatom i etažne peći, koje toplom vodom greju i radijatore u drugim sobama.

Peć na drva je jednostavna i radi i kad nestane struje, dok se peć na pelet sama loži i održava temperaturu, ali joj trebaju struja i redovno čišćenje. Kod polovne peći pogledajte šamot, rešetku, vrata i zaptivne pletenice: napukli delovi se menjaju, ali progorelo ložište ne. Staklo na vratima treba da bude celo. Kod peći na pelet tražite da je vidite kako se pali i gasi. Prečnik dimovodne cevi mora da odgovara priključku na dimnjak. Ogrev potražite u rubrici [pelet i drva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev), za pripremu drva pogledajte [motorne testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere), a za celu kuću bolje rešenje su [kotlovi](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi).', text_en = 'Wood and pellet stoves heat without a central system: classic wood stoves, solid-fuel cookers you can also cook on, fireplaces and glass-fronted stoves, pellet stoves with a thermostat and boiler stoves, which also heat radiators in other rooms with hot water.

A wood stove is simple and works during a power cut too, while a pellet stove feeds itself and keeps the temperature, but needs electricity and regular cleaning. On a used stove, look at the firebricks, the grate, the door and the rope seals: cracked parts can be replaced, but a burnt-through firebox cannot. The glass in the door should be intact. With a pellet stove, ask to see it light up and shut down. The diameter of the flue pipe must match the chimney connection. Look for fuel in [pellets and firewood](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev), for preparing the wood see [chainsaws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere), and for a whole house [boilers](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi) are a better solution.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'heating') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'stoves' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Fasada i lepkovi za izolaciju kuće spolja: fasadni stiropor i kamena vuna, građevinski lepak, mrežica, tiplovi, ugaone lajsne, podloga i završni dekorativni malter u kanti ili u džaku. Posle gradnje često ostane viška materijala, koji se prodaje povoljnije nego u stovarištu.

Sistem je dobar onoliko koliko i njegov najslabiji sloj, pa ne štedite na lepku i mrežici. Kod materijala u džakovima proverite datum proizvodnje i da li su čuvani na suvom, jer navlažen lepak i malter više ne vezuju. Završni malter u kantama mora biti iz iste serije, da nijansa bude ujednačena, a zamrznut materijal nije za upotrebu. Količinu računajte po kvadratu fasade uz mali dodatak za otpad. Radovi se izvode samo kad nema mraza ni jakog sunca. Ostale materijale za izolaciju nudi rubrika [stiropor, kamena vuna i fasada](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada), izvođače naći ćete među oglasima [majstori i građevinske usluge](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a pre fasade se menja [stolarija](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija).', text_en = 'Facade systems and adhesives for insulating a house from the outside: facade polystyrene and mineral wool, construction adhesive, mesh, fixings, corner beads, primer and decorative finishing render in a tub or a bag. Surplus material is often left after building and is sold more cheaply than at a builders'' merchant.

A system is only as good as its weakest layer, so do not economise on the adhesive and the mesh. With bagged materials, check the production date and whether they were kept dry, because adhesive and render that have taken up moisture no longer set. Finishing render in tubs must come from the same batch so that the shade is even, and material that has frozen is not fit for use. Work out the quantity per square metre of facade with a small allowance for waste. The work is done only when there is neither frost nor strong sun. Other insulation materials are in [polystyrene, mineral wool and facade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada), contractors among the ads for [tradesmen and building services](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), and [windows and doors](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija) are replaced before the facade.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'insulation') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'facade' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Patike za muškarce, žene i decu na jednom mestu: modeli za svaki dan, za trčanje i trening, košarkaške, visoke i plitke, bele klasične i šarene iz ograničenih serija. Nude se nove u kutiji, jednom probane i nošene, pa se cene istog modela mogu znatno razlikovati.

Kod poznatih marki, kao što su Nike, Adidas i Puma, proverite originalnost: šifra modela na etiketi u jeziku patike mora da se slaže sa šifrom na kutiji, a šavovi i lepljenje treba da budu uredni. Tražite fotografije đona, pete i unutrašnjosti, jer one pokazuju koliko su patike zaista nošene. Pitajte za dužinu uloška u centimetrima, pošto isti broj nije isti kod svih proizvođača. Izbor možete odmah suziti na [muške patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) ili [ženske patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), a modele za sport nudi rubrika [patike za trčanje i košarku](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).', text_en = 'Trainers for men, women and children in one place: models for every day, for running and training, basketball shoes, high-tops and low-tops, classic white ones and colourful limited editions. They are offered new in the box, tried on once and worn, so prices of the same model can differ a lot.

With well-known makes such as Nike, Adidas and Puma, check that they are genuine: the model code on the label in the tongue must match the code on the box, and the stitching and gluing should be neat. Ask for photos of the sole, the heel and the inside, because they show how much the trainers have really been worn. Ask for the insole length in centimetres, as the same size is not the same with every maker. You can narrow the choice straight away to [men''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) or [women''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), and models for sport are in [running and basketball shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sneakers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Trenerke za trening, šetnju i odmor kod kuće: kompleti, posebno gornji i donji delovi, pamučne i plišane trenerke, lagane od poliestera za sport i retro šuškavci, koji su se vratili u modu. U ponudi su modeli za odrasle i decu, novi i nošeni.

Pamučna trenerka je prijatnija i toplija, ali se posle mnogo pranja širi na kolenima i laktovima, dok se poliester brže suši i duže drži oblik. Pogledajte rajsferšlus, manžetne i rendere i pitajte da li se materijal skupio ili izbledeo. Kod kompleta proverite da li su oba dela iste veličine, jer se često prodaju spareni. Mere u centimetrima, kao što su širina ramena i dužina nogavice, pouzdanije su od oznake na etiketi. Pogledajte posebno [muške trenerke](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) i [ženske trenerke i komplete](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke), a za najmlađe rubriku [odeća za decu](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu).', text_en = 'Tracksuits for training, walking and relaxing at home: sets, tops and bottoms sold separately, cotton and velour tracksuits, light polyester ones for sport and retro shell suits, which are back in fashion. There are models for adults and children, new and worn.

A cotton tracksuit is more pleasant and warmer, but after many washes it bags at the knees and elbows, while polyester dries faster and keeps its shape longer. Look at the zip, the cuffs and the ribbing, and ask whether the fabric has shrunk or faded. With a set, check that both pieces are the same size, because they are often sold paired up. Measurements in centimetres, such as shoulder width and leg length, are more reliable than the label. See [men''s tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) and [women''s tracksuits and sets](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke) separately, and for the youngest, [children''s clothing](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tracksuits' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Jakne i kaputi za sva godišnja doba: zimske i perjane jakne, kožne i teksas jakne, prelazne jakne i vetrovke, mantili, vuneni kaputi, bunde i prsluci. Ko kupuje van sezone, krajem zime ili usred leta, obično prolazi najpovoljnije.

Kod perjane jakne pitajte čime je punjena i opipajte da li je punjenje ravnomerno raspoređeno ili se zbilo u grudve. Kožnu jaknu pregledajte na laktovima, kragni i oko džepova, gde koža najpre puca i svetli. Vuneni kaput pogledajte pod svetlom zbog rupica od moljaca i izlizanih rukava. Postava, dugmad i rajsferšlus menjaju se kod krojača, ali to uračunajte u cenu. Tražite fotografiju jakne na osobi, uz podatak o visini. Ponudu možete podeliti na [muške jakne i kapute](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi) i [ženske jakne i kapute](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), a za planinu postoji [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca).', text_en = 'Jackets and coats for every season: winter and down jackets, leather and denim jackets, light jackets and windbreakers, trench coats, wool coats, fur coats and gilets. Those who buy out of season, at the end of winter or in the middle of summer, usually get the best price.

With a down jacket, ask what it is filled with and feel whether the filling is evenly spread or has clumped. Inspect a leather jacket at the elbows, the collar and around the pockets, where leather cracks and shines first. Look at a wool coat in good light for moth holes and worn sleeves. A lining, buttons and a zip can be replaced by a tailor, but allow for that in the price. Ask for a photo of the jacket on a person, with their height. You can split the offer into [men''s jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi) and [women''s jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), and for the mountains there is [ski wear](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'jackets' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Pantalone, farmerke i helanke za posao, izlazak i slobodno vreme: klasične farmerke, platnene i elegantne pantalone, somotske i lanene, bermude i šorcevi, sportske i svakodnevne helanke. To je odeća kod koje kroj odlučuje više od marke.

Kod farmerki veličina je obično izražena u inčima, kao širina struka i dužina nogavice, pa od prodavca tražite i mere u centimetrima: struk, kukove i unutrašnju dužinu nogavice. Uporedite ih sa parom koji vam dobro stoji. Pogledajte međunožje, kolena i ivice džepova, gde se tkanina najpre tanji. Rastegljive farmerke vremenom gube elastičnost, a helanke postaju providne: pitajte koliko su nošene. Skraćivanje je jednostavna prepravka, sužavanje nije uvek. Ženske modele naći ćete na stranici [ženske pantalone, farmerke i helanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), muške u rubrici [muška odeća](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca), a otporne modele za rad među oglasima [radna odeća](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).', text_en = 'Trousers, jeans and leggings for work, going out and leisure: classic jeans, chinos and smart trousers, corduroy and linen ones, bermudas and shorts, sports and everyday leggings. This is clothing where the cut decides more than the brand.

With jeans the size is usually given in inches, as waist width and leg length, so ask the seller for measurements in centimetres as well: waist, hips and inside leg. Compare them with a pair that fits you well. Look at the crotch, the knees and the pocket edges, where the fabric thins first. Stretch jeans lose their elasticity over time and leggings become see-through: ask how much they were worn. Shortening is a simple alteration; taking in is not always. Women''s models are on the page [women''s trousers, jeans and leggings](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), men''s in [men''s clothing](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca), and hard-wearing models for work among the ads for [workwear](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'trousers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Čizme i gležnjače za jesen i zimu: kožne čizme do kolena, gležnjače sa petom i bez nje, duboke zimske cipele sa krznom, gumene čizme za kišu i čvrste čizme za sneg. Sezona počinje s prvim hladnim danima, a pred proleće cene padaju.

Prava koža diše i vremenom se oblikuje prema stopalu, dok se veštačka koža lakše ljušti i puca na pregibima. Pregledajte pregib iznad prstiju, petu i spoj đona sa gornjim delom. Rajsferšlus povucite celom dužinom, jer je njegova zamena kod obućara skuplja nego što izgleda. Kod visokih čizama pitajte za obim sare, da ne budu tesne preko lista. Krzno i uložak treba da budu čisti i suvi, bez mirisa vlage. Najveći izbor imaju [ženske čizme i gležnjače](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme), muške modele tražite u rubrici [muška obuća](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca), a dečje u rubrici [dečije patike i obuća](/oglasi/deca/obuca-za-decu).', text_en = 'Boots and ankle boots for autumn and winter: knee-high leather boots, ankle boots with and without a heel, fur-lined winter boots, rubber boots for rain and sturdy boots for snow. The season starts with the first cold days, and prices fall towards spring.

Real leather breathes and shapes itself to the foot over time, while artificial leather peels more easily and cracks at the creases. Inspect the crease above the toes, the heel and the joint between the sole and the upper. Run the zip along its whole length, because having a cobbler replace it costs more than you would think. With tall boots, ask for the shaft circumference so that they are not tight over the calf. The lining and insole should be clean and dry, with no smell of damp. The widest choice is among [women''s boots and ankle boots](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme); look for men''s models in [men''s footwear](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca), and for children''s in [children''s trainers and shoes](/oglasi/deca/obuca-za-decu).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'boots' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Cipele za posao, svečane prilike i svaki dan: muške kožne cipele, ženske salonke i štikle, baletanke, mokasine, oksfordice i cipele od antilopa. Mnogi parovi su obuveni svega nekoliko puta, za svadbu, maturu ili razgovor za posao.

Kožni đon je znak kvalitetnije izrade, ali se klizi po mokrom i brže troši, pa pogledajte da li je već stavljen gumeni podmetač. Pregledajte vrh, petu i unutrašnju postavu kod pete, koja se prva izliže. Cipele koje su dugo stajale probajte pažljivo: lepak i đon mogu da popuste posle godina u ormaru. Tražite širinu cipele i dužinu uloška, ne samo broj. Par čuvan na kalupima i u kutiji vredi više. Ponudu podelite na [muške cipele](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) i [ženske cipele, štikle i baletanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), a obuću za venčanje pogledajte i u rubrici [venčanice i svečane haljine](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).', text_en = 'Shoes for work, formal occasions and every day: men''s leather shoes, women''s court shoes and high heels, ballet flats, loafers, Oxfords and suede shoes. Many pairs have been worn only a few times, for a wedding, a school prom or a job interview.

A leather sole is a sign of better workmanship, but it slips in the wet and wears faster, so see whether a rubber half-sole has already been fitted. Inspect the toe, the heel and the lining at the heel, which wears through first. Try shoes that have stood unused for a long time carefully: the glue and the sole can give way after years in a wardrobe. Ask for the width of the shoe and the insole length, not just the size. A pair kept on shoe trees and in its box is worth more. Split the offer into [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) and [women''s shoes, heels and ballet flats](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), and look for wedding footwear in [wedding and formal dresses](/oglasi/moda/vencanice) as well.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'shoes' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Sandale i papuče za leto, plažu i kuću: kožne sandale, sandale sa petom i platformom, sportske sandale za hodanje, anatomske papuče, japanke, klompe i tople kućne papuče. Kupuju se najviše u maju i junu, pa prodavcima vredi da oglas postave pre sezone.

Kod sandala sve drži kaiš: proverite šnale, čičak trake i mesta gde su kaiševi ušiveni ili zalepljeni u đon. Uložak ne sme da bude izlizan do tamnih otisaka niti da se odvaja od đona. Anatomske papuče sa plutanim uloškom ne podnose kvašenje, pa pogledajte da li je pluta ispucala. Kod obuće koja se nosi na bosu nogu većina kupaca traži nove ili jedva nošene parove, zato iskreno opišite stanje. Odvojeno pogledajte [ženske sandale i papuče](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce) i [muške papuče i sandale](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce), a ako tek planirate letovanje, tu je i [smeštaj na moru](/oglasi/odmor/more).', text_en = 'Sandals and slippers for summer, the beach and the home: leather sandals, sandals with a heel or a platform, sports sandals for walking, footbed sandals, flip-flops, clogs and warm house slippers. They are bought mostly in May and June, so it pays sellers to post their ad before the season.

On sandals everything depends on the straps: check the buckles, the hook-and-loop fasteners and the places where the straps are sewn or glued into the sole. The footbed must not be worn down to dark prints or coming away from the sole. Footbed sandals with a cork insole do not stand getting wet, so see whether the cork has cracked. With footwear worn on bare feet most buyers want new or barely worn pairs, so describe the condition honestly. See [women''s sandals and slippers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce) and [men''s slippers and sandals](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce) separately, and if you are only planning your summer holiday, there is [seaside accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/more) too.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fashion') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sandals' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Novčanici za muškarce i žene: kožni novčanici na preklop, veliki ženski novčanici sa rajsferšlusom, tanki držači kartica, futrole za dokumenta i novčanici sa RFID zaštitom od očitavanja kartica. Nov novčanik u kutiji čest je poklon, pa ih je mnogo nekorišćenih.

Prava koža ima nepravilnu teksturu i miris, a ivice su joj obojene i uglačane, dok se veštačka koža na pregibima brzo ljušti. Otvorite novčanik i pogledajte šavove, pregrade za kartice, drikere i rajsferšlus na delu za kovanice. Proverite da li u njega staju lična karta, vozačka i saobraćajna dozvola, jer se formati razlikuju. Kod poznatih marki tražite kutiju i račun. U oglasu navedite dimenzije i broj pregrada. Uz novčanik se često bira i torba: pogledajte [muške torbe i torbice](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe) ili [ženske torbe i tašne](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), a za poklon i [muške satove](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi).', text_en = 'Wallets for men and women: leather bifold wallets, large women''s zip-around purses, slim card holders, document holders and wallets with RFID protection against card skimming. A new wallet in a box is a common gift, so there are many unused ones.

Real leather has an irregular texture and a smell, and its edges are painted and burnished, while artificial leather quickly peels at the folds. Open the wallet and look at the stitching, the card slots, the press studs and the zip of the coin section. Check that your identity card, driving licence and vehicle registration fit in, because the formats differ. With well-known brands, ask for the box and the receipt. In your ad, give the dimensions and the number of compartments. A bag is often chosen along with a wallet: see [men''s bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe) or [women''s bags and handbags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), and for a gift, [men''s watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) too.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bags') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'wallets' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske torbe i tašne za svaku priliku: velike torbe za posao i fakultet, torbe preko ramena, male večernje torbice, pletene i platnene torbe za leto, rančići i putne torbe. U ponudi su kožne i od veštačke kože, nove sa etiketom i nošene.

Torbu ocenite po mestima koja najviše trpe: uglovima dna, ručkama i spojevima kaiša. Metalni delovi ne smeju da budu oljušteni, a rajsferšlus treba da klizi bez zapinjanja. Zavirite unutra, jer mrlje od šminke i olovke na postavi teško izlaze. Kod dizajnerskih torbi tražite račun, karticu autentičnosti i fotografije serijske oznake, a šavove i slova na logotipu uporedite sa fotografijama proizvođača. U oglasu navedite širinu, visinu i dužinu kaiša. Uz torbu idu [novčanici](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici), za svečane prilike [ženske cipele i štikle](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), a sitnice koje upotpunjuju izgled nudi rubrika [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit).', text_en = 'Women''s bags and handbags for every occasion: large bags for work and university, shoulder bags, small evening bags, woven and canvas bags for summer, small backpacks and travel bags. There are leather and faux-leather ones, new with tags and used.

Judge a bag by the places that suffer most: the bottom corners, the handles and the strap joints. The metal parts must not be flaking, and the zip should run without catching. Look inside, because make-up and pen stains on the lining are hard to remove. With designer bags, ask for the receipt, the authenticity card and photos of the serial tag, and compare the stitching and the lettering of the logo with the maker''s photos. In your ad, give the width, the height and the strap length. [Wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) go with a bag, [women''s shoes and heels](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele) with formal occasions, and the small things that complete a look are in [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bags') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'womens-bags' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške torbe i torbice za grad, posao i put: male torbice preko ramena, torbice oko struka, poslovne torbe i aktovke, torbe za laptop, sportske torbe za trening i putne torbe za vikend. Praktičnost je ovde važnija od ukrasa.

Kod torbe za laptop izmerite računar i uporedite ga sa unutrašnjim dimenzijama pregrade, jer se oznaka veličine ekrana ne poklapa uvek sa stvarnom širinom. Proverite da li je pregrada postavljena sunđerom i da li dno ima ojačanje. Kaiš za rame treba da ima čvrste metalne karabinjere i podmetač koji ne klizi. Pregledajte šavove na ručkama, uglove i rajsferšluse, a kod kožnih aktovki bravice i ključeve. Pitajte da li je torba otporna na kišu. Sam računar potražite u rubrici [laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), sitnu kožnu galanteriju na stranici [novčanici](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici), a rančeve i kofere među ostalim oglasima u rubrici [torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe).', text_en = 'Men''s bags for the city, work and travel: small cross-body bags, waist bags, business bags and briefcases, laptop bags, sports bags for training and weekend travel bags. Practicality matters more than decoration here.

With a laptop bag, measure the computer and compare it with the inner dimensions of the compartment, because the screen-size label does not always match the real width. Check that the compartment is padded and that the bottom is reinforced. The shoulder strap should have strong metal clips and a pad that does not slip. Inspect the stitching on the handles, the corners and the zips, and on leather briefcases the locks and keys. Ask whether the bag is rainproof. Look for the computer itself in [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), small leather goods on the page [wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici), and backpacks and suitcases among the other ads in [bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bags') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'mens-bags' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške jakne i kaputi: zimske jakne sa kapuljačom, perjane jakne i prsluci, kožne i teksas jakne, kratke jakne sa renderima, parke, vodootporne jakne za planinu i klasični vuneni kaputi za odelo. Dobar komad se nosi godinama, pa vredi tražiti kvalitetnu polovnu jaknu.

Jaknu birajte po merama, ne po oznaci veličine: tražite širinu ramena, obim grudi i dužinu rukava i uporedite ih sa jaknom koju već nosite. Kaput preko sakoa treba da bude za broj komotniji. Pogledajte manžetne i ivice džepova, gde se materijal najpre izliže, i proverite rade li svi drikeri i rajsferšlusi. Kod vodootpornih jakni pitajte da li su šavovi lepljeni i da li je membrana počela da se ljušti iznutra. Uz kaput ide [muško odelo ili sako](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi), za zimu pogledajte [čizme i duboke cipele](/oglasi/moda/cizme), a zajedničku ponudu za muškarce i žene daje stranica [jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/jakne-i-kaputi).', text_en = 'Men''s jackets and coats: hooded winter jackets, down jackets and gilets, leather and denim jackets, short jackets with ribbed cuffs, parkas, waterproof mountain jackets and classic wool coats to wear over a suit. A good piece is worn for years, so a quality second-hand jacket is worth looking for.

Choose a jacket by measurements, not by the size label: ask for the shoulder width, the chest and the sleeve length and compare them with a jacket you already wear. A coat worn over a suit jacket should be a size roomier. Look at the cuffs and pocket edges, where the fabric wears first, and check that all the press studs and zips work. With waterproof jackets, ask whether the seams are taped and whether the membrane has started to peel on the inside. A [men''s suit or blazer](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) goes with a coat, for winter see [boots](/oglasi/moda/cizme), and the joint offer for men and women is on the page [jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/jakne-i-kaputi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'jackets' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške trenerke za trening, grad i kuću: kompleti sa duksom na rajsferšlus ili sa kapuljačom, donji delovi sa manžetnom i ravnim nogavicama, klupske i navijačke trenerke i tanji modeli za trčanje. Najtraženije su crne, sive i teget.

Za teretanu i trčanje birajte tanji materijal koji odvodi znoj, a za hladnije dane deblji pamuk sa češljanom unutrašnjom stranom. Pitajte za visinu i težinu osobe koja je trenerku nosila: to često govori više od broja na etiketi. Pogledajte kolena, međunožje i džepove i proverite da li je učkur na mestu. Kod navijačkih i klupskih trenerki proverite da li su grb i natpisi vezeni ili štampani i da li su se oljuštili. Uz trenerku se biraju [muške patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike), za vežbanje kod kuće [tegovi i bučice](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice), a modele za žene i decu nudi stranica [trenerke](/oglasi/moda/trenerke).', text_en = 'Men''s tracksuits for training, the city and home: sets with a zip-up top or a hoodie, bottoms with cuffed and straight legs, club and supporters'' tracksuits and thinner models for running. Black, grey and navy are the most wanted.

For the gym and running choose a thinner fabric that wicks sweat away, and for colder days thicker cotton with a brushed inside. Ask for the height and weight of the person who wore the tracksuit: that often says more than the number on the label. Look at the knees, the crotch and the pockets and check that the drawstring is in place. With supporters'' and club tracksuits, check whether the crest and lettering are embroidered or printed and whether they have peeled. [Men''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) are chosen to go with a tracksuit, [weights and dumbbells](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice) for exercise at home, and models for women and children are on the page [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/trenerke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tracksuits' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muška odela i sakoi za svadbu, maturu, posao i svečane prilike: klasična i uža odela, trodelna odela sa prslukom, pojedinačni sakoi, smokinzi i odela za dečake. Odelo obučeno jednom ili dvaput često se prodaje za deo cene novog.

Sako mora da legne u ramenima, jer se to ne može prepraviti, dok krojač lako skraćuje rukave, sužava struk i podešava dužinu pantalona. Tražite mere: širinu ramena, obim grudi, dužinu sakoa i rukava, struk i dužinu nogavice. Pogledajte laktove, kragnu i postavu ispod pazuha, gde se vidi nošenje. Vuna se manje gužva i bolje diše od poliestera, pa pitajte za sastav sa ušivene etikete. Proverite da li je odelo hemijski očišćeno pre prodaje. Uz odelo birajte [muške cipele](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) i [muški sat](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi), a za mladoženju pogledajte i rubriku [venčanice i svečana odeća](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).', text_en = 'Men''s suits and blazers for weddings, proms, work and formal occasions: classic and slimmer suits, three-piece suits with a waistcoat, separate blazers, dinner suits and suits for boys. A suit worn once or twice is often sold for a fraction of the price of a new one.

A jacket must sit right in the shoulders, because that cannot be altered, whereas a tailor easily shortens the sleeves, takes in the waist and adjusts the trouser length. Ask for the measurements: shoulder width, chest, jacket and sleeve length, waist and leg length. Look at the elbows, the collar and the lining under the arms, where wear shows. Wool creases less and breathes better than polyester, so ask for the composition from the sewn-in label. Check whether the suit was dry-cleaned before sale. Choose [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) and a [men''s watch](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) to go with a suit, and for a groom see [wedding and formal wear](/oglasi/moda/vencanice) as well.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'suits' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške patike za grad, posao bez strogog pravila oblačenja i slobodno vreme: bele kožne patike, modeli sa vazdušnim đonom, retro modeli za trčanje, visoke patike i lagane letnje od platna i mrežice. Veći brojevi se teže nalaze u radnjama, pa ih mnogi traže upravo u oglasima.

Evropski, britanski i američki brojevi se razlikuju, a razlikuju se i kalupi pojedinih marki, pa je najsigurnije uporediti dužinu uloška sa parom koji već nosite. Pogledajte petu spolja i iznutra: iskošen đon i pocepana postava znače mnogo pređenih kilometara. Kod patika sa vazdušnim jastukom proverite da nije probušen. Pitajte da li su patike prane u mašini, jer to ume da oslabi lepak. Modele za trčanje, košarku i teretanu tražite u rubrici [sportske patike](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), uz patike idu [muške trenerke](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke), a za formalnije prilike pogledajte [muške cipele](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele).', text_en = 'Men''s trainers for the city, work without a strict dress code and leisure: white leather trainers, models with air soles, retro running styles, high-tops and light summer ones in canvas and mesh. Bigger sizes are harder to find in shops, so many people look for them in the ads.

European, British and American sizes differ, and so do the lasts of individual makes, so it is safest to compare the insole length with a pair you already wear. Look at the heel outside and inside: a slanted sole and a torn lining mean many kilometres covered. On trainers with an air cushion, check that it is not punctured. Ask whether the trainers were machine-washed, as that can weaken the glue. Look for running, basketball and gym models in [sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca); [men''s tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) go with trainers, and for more formal occasions see [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sneakers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške cipele za odelo, kancelariju i izlazak: klasične crne i braon cipele na pertlanje, mokasine, cipele od antilopa, lagane letnje i duboke cipele za jesen. Kvalitetan kožni par uz malo nege traje mnogo godina, zato se polovne cipele poznatih proizvođača traže.

Savijte cipelu u rukama: koža treba da se nabira sitno, a ne da puca. Đon pogledajte na vrhu i peti, jer se tu vidi koliko je par prešao. Šivene cipele mogu da dobiju nov đon kod obućara, lepljene teže. Pitajte da li su nošene uz kalupe i da li je koža redovno mazana. Širok ili uzak kalup prodavac će najbolje opisati ako napiše kome su cipele bile udobne. Nekoliko nošenja za svadbu ne ostavlja trag, pa su takvi parovi najbolja kupovina. Uz cipele birajte [odelo ili sako](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) i kožni [novčanik](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici), a za opušteniji stil tu su [muške patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike).', text_en = 'Men''s shoes for a suit, the office and going out: classic black and brown lace-ups, loafers, suede shoes, light summer shoes and ankle-high shoes for autumn. A quality leather pair lasts many years with a little care, which is why second-hand shoes by well-known makers are in demand.

Bend the shoe in your hands: the leather should crease finely, not crack. Look at the sole at the toe and the heel, where you can see how far the pair has walked. Stitched shoes can be resoled by a cobbler, glued ones less easily. Ask whether they were kept on shoe trees and whether the leather was regularly polished. A seller describes a wide or narrow last best by saying who found the shoes comfortable. A few wears at a wedding leave no trace, so such pairs are the best buy. Choose a [suit or blazer](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) and a leather [wallet](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) to go with the shoes, and for a more relaxed style there are [men''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'shoes' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muške papuče i sandale za vrućine, plažu, bazen i kuću: kožne sandale sa kaiševima, sportske sandale sa čičak trakama za pešačenje, papuče sa jednim kaišem, japanke, gumene klompe i kućne papuče. Leti se nose svaki dan, pa se isplati izabrati udoban par.

Za duže hodanje birajte sandale sa oblikovanim uloškom i kaišem iza pete, a papuče ostavite za kraće relacije. Gumu i penu savijte rukom: materijal koji je stajao na suncu postaje krt i puca. Kod kožnih sandala pogledajte da li je uložak potamneo i da li su šavovi kaiševa celi. Čičak traka koja je puna končića slabije drži, ali se lako očisti. Papuče za bazen treba da imaju đon koji ne klizi po mokrim pločicama. Za izlete i kampovanje pogledajte [kamp opremu](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), za grad su praktičnije [muške patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike), a ženske i dečje modele nudi stranica [sandale i papuče](/oglasi/moda/sandale-i-papuce).', text_en = 'Men''s slippers and sandals for hot weather, the beach, the pool and the home: leather strap sandals, sports sandals with hook-and-loop straps for hiking, single-strap slides, flip-flops, rubber clogs and house slippers. They are worn every day in summer, so it pays to choose a comfortable pair.

For longer walks choose sandals with a shaped footbed and a heel strap, and keep slides for short distances. Bend rubber and foam with your hand: material left in the sun turns brittle and cracks. On leather sandals, see whether the footbed has darkened and whether the strap stitching is intact. A hook-and-loop strap full of threads holds less well but is easily cleaned. Pool slides should have a sole that does not slip on wet tiles. For outings and camping see [camping equipment](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), [men''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) are more practical for the city, and women''s and children''s models are on the page [sandals and slippers](/oglasi/moda/sandale-i-papuce).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sandals' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženski satovi kao modni detalj i poklon: elegantni satovi sa metalnom narukvicom, modeli sa kožnim kaišem, satovi sa kristalima, minimalistički sa tankim kućištem i sportski otporni na vodu. Poznate modne marke, kao što su Guess, Casio i Tissot, traže se i polovne.

Metalna narukvica se skraćuje vađenjem članaka, pa pitajte da li se uz sat dobijaju izvađeni članci, da biste mogli da je produžite. Pogledajte staklo zbog ogrebotina, pozlatu na ivicama kućišta i kopči i da li krunica lako podešava vreme. Baterija se menja jeftino, ali sat koji je dugo stajao sa praznom baterijom može da ima oštećen mehanizam. Oznaka vodootpornosti kod modnih satova obično znači otpornost na kišu i pranje ruku, ne na plivanje. Kutija i garantni list podižu vrednost. Uz sat se biraju i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit) i [ženske torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), a merenje koraka i pulsa nude [pametni satovi](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi).', text_en = 'Women''s watches as a fashion detail and a gift: elegant watches with a metal bracelet, models with a leather strap, watches with crystals, minimalist ones with a slim case and water-resistant sports watches. Well-known fashion brands such as Guess, Casio and Tissot are in demand second-hand too.

A metal bracelet is shortened by removing links, so ask whether the removed links come with the watch, so that you can lengthen it. Look at the glass for scratches, at the gilding on the edges of the case and clasp, and at whether the crown sets the time easily. A battery is cheap to change, but a watch that stood for a long time with a flat battery may have a damaged movement. The water-resistance mark on fashion watches usually means resistance to rain and hand-washing, not swimming. A box and a warranty card raise the value. [Jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit) and [women''s bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) are chosen to go with a watch, and [smartwatches](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi) count steps and measure the pulse.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'watches') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'womens' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muški satovi za svaki džep: kvarcni satovi za svaki dan, automatski i mehanički satovi za ljubitelje, hronografi, ronilački satovi i digitalni modeli otporni na udarce. U oglasima se sreću Casio, Seiko i Tissot, ali i skuplje švajcarske marke i stari satovi iz porodičnih fioka.

Kod automatskog sata pitajte kada je mehanizam poslednji put servisiran i koliko sat odstupa na dan. Pogledajte da li kazaljke i oznake svetle ravnomerno i da li se krunica čvrsto zavrće. Safirno staklo se teško grebe, mineralno lakše. Kod skupljih satova tražite kutiju, papire i serijski broj i obavite pregled kod časovničara pre isplate, jer su kopije sve uverljivije. Kaiš je potrošna roba, ali originalna metalna narukvica vredi mnogo. Stare džepne i ručne satove naći ćete i u rubrici [antikviteti](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), obaveštenja sa telefona prikazuju [pametni satovi](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi), a modele za dame stranica [ženski satovi](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi).', text_en = 'Men''s watches for every budget: quartz watches for every day, automatic and mechanical watches for enthusiasts, chronographs, dive watches and shock-resistant digital models. The ads feature Casio, Seiko and Tissot, but also more expensive Swiss makes and old watches from family drawers.

With an automatic watch, ask when the movement was last serviced and how much the watch gains or loses a day. See whether the hands and markers glow evenly and whether the crown screws down firmly. Sapphire glass is hard to scratch; mineral glass scratches more easily. With more expensive watches, ask for the box, the papers and the serial number and have a watchmaker inspect it before you pay, because copies are getting ever more convincing. A strap is a consumable, but an original metal bracelet is worth a lot. Old pocket and wrist watches are also in [antiques](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), [smartwatches](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi) show notifications from your phone, and models for ladies are on the page [women''s watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'watches') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'mens' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Haljine za svaki dan i za posebne prilike: letnje haljine, košulja haljine, pletene i džemper haljine, koktel haljine, duge večernje i maturske haljine. Svečana haljina se često obuče samo jednom, pa je u oglasima ima kao nove, po znatno nižoj ceni.

Oznaka veličine kod haljina malo govori, jer svaki proizvođač kroji drugačije. Tražite obim grudi, struka i kukova i dužinu od ramena, kao i podatak koliko je materijal rastegljiv. Fotografija na osobi vredi više od fotografije na vešalici. Pogledajte porub, rajsferšlus i predeo ispod pazuha, a kod haljina sa šljokicama i perlicama da li neke nedostaju. Pitajte da li je haljina skraćivana ili sužavana i da li može da se vrati na prvobitnu meru. Venčanice i haljine za kume tražite u rubrici [venčanice i svečane haljine](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), uz haljinu birajte [cipele i štikle](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), malu [torbicu](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit).', text_en = 'Dresses for every day and for special occasions: summer dresses, shirt dresses, knitted and jumper dresses, cocktail dresses, long evening gowns and prom dresses. A formal dress is often worn only once, so the ads have them as good as new at a much lower price.

The size label says little with dresses, because every maker cuts differently. Ask for the bust, waist and hip measurements and the length from the shoulder, and how stretchy the fabric is. A photo on a person is worth more than a photo on a hanger. Look at the hem, the zip and the underarm area, and on dresses with sequins and beads check whether any are missing. Ask whether the dress was shortened or taken in and whether it can be let out to the original size. Look for wedding and bridesmaid dresses in [wedding and formal dresses](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), and choose [shoes and heels](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), a small [bag](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) and [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit) to go with the dress.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'dresses' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske jakne i kaputi: duge i kratke perjane jakne, vuneni kaputi ravnog i strukiranog kroja, mantili za prelazno doba, kožne jakne, bunde od prirodnog i veštačkog krzna i postavljeni prsluci. Klasičan kaput ne izlazi iz mode, pa se dobro očuvani komadi brzo prodaju.

Kod kaputa pogledajte sastav: veći udeo vune znači topliji kaput, koji se manje mucka. Pregledajte ivice rukava, okovratnik i mesto gde torba tare bok. Svetle jakne slikajte i gledajte na dnevnom svetlu, jer se tek tada vide fleke i požutela mesta. Bunda od prirodnog krzna ne sme da gubi dlaku niti da ima krutu, suvu kožu. Pojas, kapuljača i krzno na kapuljači često se skidaju, pa proverite da li su svi delovi tu. Uz kaput se nose [ženske čizme i gležnjače](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme) i veća [torba](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), a muške i dečje modele nudi stranica [jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/jakne-i-kaputi).', text_en = 'Women''s jackets and coats: long and short down jackets, wool coats in straight and fitted cuts, trench coats for between seasons, leather jackets, coats of real and faux fur and padded gilets. A classic coat never goes out of fashion, so well-kept pieces sell quickly.

With a coat, look at the composition: a higher share of wool means a warmer coat that pills less. Inspect the sleeve edges, the collar and the place where a bag rubs the hip. Photograph and view light-coloured jackets in daylight, because only then do stains and yellowed patches show. A real fur coat must not shed or have stiff, dry leather. A belt, a hood and the fur on the hood are often detachable, so check that all the parts are there. [Women''s boots and ankle boots](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme) and a bigger [bag](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) are worn with a coat, and men''s and children''s models are on the page [jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/jakne-i-kaputi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'jackets' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske trenerke i kompleti za šetnju, putovanje i opuštene dane: pamučni kompleti sa duksom, plišane trenerke, široki i uski modeli, kompleti sa kratkim duksom i trenerke za trudnice. Udoban komplet u neutralnoj boji danas se nosi i u gradu.

Pliš je mekan i lep dok je nov, ali se na laktovima i sedalnom delu vremenom izliže i sjaji, pa pogledajte baš ta mesta. Kod pamuka pitajte da li se komplet skupio ili izdužio posle pranja i da li je boja ostala ista na oba dela. Proverite dužinu nogavica, jer se modeli sa manžetnom ne skraćuju lako. Mere struka, kukova i dužine pouzdanije su od oznake veličine. Prodavcima savetujemo da komplet slikaju raširen na ravnoj podlozi i na osobi. Uz komplet idu [ženske patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), za vežbanje birajte opremu u rubrici [fitnes](/oglasi/sport/fitnes), a pojedinačne donje delove na stranici [ženske pantalone, farmerke i helanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke).', text_en = 'Women''s tracksuits and sets for walking, travelling and relaxed days: cotton sets with a hoodie, velour tracksuits, loose and slim models, sets with a cropped hoodie and maternity tracksuits. A comfortable set in a neutral colour is worn in town too these days.

Velour is soft and lovely when new, but in time it wears and shines at the elbows and the seat, so look at exactly those places. With cotton, ask whether the set shrank or stretched after washing and whether the colour stayed the same on both pieces. Check the leg length, because cuffed models are not easy to shorten. Waist, hip and length measurements are more reliable than the size label. We advise sellers to photograph the set laid flat and on a person. [Women''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike) go with a set, choose exercise equipment in [fitness](/oglasi/sport/fitnes), and separate bottoms on the page [women''s trousers, jeans and leggings](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tracksuits' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske pantalone, farmerke i helanke: farmerke visokog struka, ravne, uske i zvoncare, elegantne pantalone na ivicu, široke lanene pantalone za leto, kožne i somotske, helanke za trening i za svaki dan i modeli za trudnice.

Isti konfekcijski broj kod dve marke može da se razlikuje za celu veličinu, zato tražite struk, kukove, dubinu i unutrašnju dužinu nogavice. Kod modela visokog struka dubina je presudna za to kako će pantalone stajati. Farmerke pogledajte na unutrašnjoj strani butina, a pantalone na ivicu na sjaju od peglanja. Sportske helanke rastegnite prema svetlu: dobre ostaju neprovidne i u čučnju. Pitajte da li je dužina skraćivana, posebno ako ste viši. Prodavcima savetujemo da navedu svoju visinu i dokle im nogavica dopire. Gornje delove birajte na stranici [ženske bluze, majice i džemperi](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/bluze-i-kosulje), obuću među oglasima [ženske patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), a muške modele nudi stranica [pantalone i farmerke](/oglasi/moda/pantalone-i-farmerke).', text_en = 'Women''s trousers, jeans and leggings: high-waisted, straight, skinny and flared jeans, smart creased trousers, wide linen trousers for summer, leather and corduroy ones, leggings for training and for every day, and maternity models.

The same clothing size from two brands can differ by a whole size, so ask for the waist, the hips, the rise and the inside leg. On high-waisted models the rise decides how the trousers will sit. Look at jeans on the inside of the thighs, and at creased trousers for shine from ironing. Stretch sports leggings against the light: good ones stay opaque in a squat too. Ask whether the length was shortened, especially if you are taller. We advise sellers to state their height and where the leg reaches on them. Choose tops on the page [women''s blouses, T-shirts and jumpers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/bluze-i-kosulje), footwear among the ads for [women''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), and men''s models are on the page [trousers and jeans](/oglasi/moda/pantalone-i-farmerke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'trousers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske bluze, majice i džemperi: košulje i bluze za posao, pamučne majice kratkih i dugih rukava, bodi, tunike, tanki i debeli džemperi, rolke i kardigani. To su komadi koji se najčešće kupuju i najčešće prodaju, često i u paketima od više komada iste veličine.

Sastav materijala pročitajte sa ušivene etikete: viskoza je prijatna, ali se skuplja i gužva, pamuk podnosi često pranje, a vuna i kašmir traže ručno pranje i sušenje u ležećem položaju. Kod džempera pogledajte ima li kuglica i da li su se rukavi i donja ivica razvukli. Bele bluze proverite na okovratniku i ispod pazuha. Kod paketa tražite fotografiju svakog komada posebno, da ne kupujete naslepo. Uz bluzu birajte donji deo na stranici [ženske pantalone, farmerke i helanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), za svečanije prilike pogledajte [haljine](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine), a suknje i ostalo nudi rubrika [ženska odeća](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca).', text_en = 'Women''s blouses, T-shirts and jumpers: shirts and blouses for work, cotton tops with short and long sleeves, bodysuits, tunics, thin and chunky jumpers, polo necks and cardigans. These are the pieces most often bought and most often sold, frequently in bundles of several items of the same size.

Read the composition from the sewn-in label: viscose is pleasant but shrinks and creases, cotton stands frequent washing, and wool and cashmere need hand-washing and drying flat. On a jumper, look for bobbles and see whether the sleeves and the hem have stretched. Check white blouses at the collar and under the arms. With a bundle, ask for a photo of each item separately so that you do not buy blind. Choose bottoms to go with a blouse on the page [women''s trousers, jeans and leggings](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), for more formal occasions see [dresses](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine), and skirts and the rest are in [women''s clothing](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'tops' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske patike za grad, posao i šetnju: bele kožne patike, modeli na platformi, lagane patike od mrežice, visoke platnene i patike živih boja iz ograničenih serija. Bele patike se nose uz sve, od farmerki do haljine, pa su i najtraženije.

Ko nosi manje brojeve može da pogleda i modele za stariju decu, koji su često isti kao ženski, a povoljniji. Proverite širinu, jer su neki kalupi uski i ne odgovaraju svakom stopalu. Kod belih patika pogledajte đon sa strane i mrežicu oko prstiju: požuteli đon i sive mrlje teško se vraćaju u prvobitno stanje. Platforma ne sme da se odvaja od gornjeg dela. Tražite fotografije na dnevnom svetlu i bez filtera. Uz patike se slažu [ženske trenerke i kompleti](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke), modele za trčanje nudi rubrika [sportske patike](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), a za leto su tu [ženske sandale i papuče](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce).', text_en = 'Women''s trainers for the city, work and walking: white leather trainers, platform models, light mesh trainers, canvas high-tops and brightly coloured limited editions. White trainers go with everything, from jeans to a dress, so they are the most wanted.

Those who wear smaller sizes can also look at models for older children, which are often the same as the women''s ones but cheaper. Check the width, because some lasts are narrow and do not suit every foot. On white trainers, look at the side of the sole and the mesh around the toes: a yellowed sole and grey stains are hard to restore. The platform must not be coming away from the upper. Ask for photos in daylight and without filters. [Women''s tracksuits and sets](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke) go well with trainers, running models are in [sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), and for summer there are [women''s sandals and slippers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sneakers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske čizme i gležnjače: čizme preko kolena i do kolena, gležnjače sa blok petom i ravne, modeli na šniranje, zimske čizme sa krznom i gumene čizme za kišu. Dobre kožne čizme su skupe kad su nove, pa je polovan par u dobrom stanju česta i pametna kupovina.

Kod čizama do kolena nije dovoljan broj: izmerite obim lista i uporedite ga sa obimom sare, a pitajte i za visinu sare od pete. Pogledajte flekice na petama i vrhove, jer se oni najpre troše, a zamena kod obućara je jeftina. Antilop upija so i vodu, pa na njemu potražite bele tragove i tvrda mesta. Rastegljivi deo sare ne sme da bude razvučen. Čizme koje su čuvane ispunjene i uspravno nemaju prelomljenu saru. Uz čizme se nose [ženske jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), za prelazno doba pogledajte [ženske cipele](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), a muške i dečje modele nudi stranica [čizme](/oglasi/moda/cizme).', text_en = 'Women''s boots and ankle boots: over-the-knee and knee-high boots, ankle boots with a block heel and flat ones, lace-up models, fur-lined winter boots and rubber boots for rain. Good leather boots are expensive when new, so a second-hand pair in good condition is a common and sensible buy.

With knee-high boots the size is not enough: measure your calf and compare it with the shaft circumference, and ask for the shaft height from the heel too. Look at the heel tips and the toes, because they wear first, and having a cobbler replace them is cheap. Suede absorbs salt and water, so look for white marks and hard patches on it. The elastic part of the shaft must not be stretched out. Boots stored stuffed and upright have no crease across the shaft. [Women''s jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi) are worn with boots, for between seasons see [women''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), and men''s and children''s models are on the page [boots](/oglasi/moda/cizme).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'boots' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske cipele, štikle i baletanke: salonke sa tankom i blok petom, cipele sa kaišem oko članka, baletanke, mokasine, oksfordice i svečane cipele za venčanja i mature. Par kupljen za jedno veče često ostane kao nov, pa ga vlasnice rado prodaju.

Visinu potpetice tražite u centimetrima i pitajte koliko je cipela stabilna, jer fotografija to ne pokazuje. Pogledajte flekice, vrh cipele i unutrašnji uložak sa zlatnim natpisom: što je natpis čitljiviji, cipele su manje nošene. Lakovana koža ne sme da bude izlomljena ni lepljiva, a saten ne sme da ima fleke od vode. Baletanke se najpre troše na peti i prstima, pa tražite fotografiju đona. Ako ste između dva broja, pitajte da li model ispada veći ili manji. Uz cipele birajte [haljinu](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) i [torbicu](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), a obuću za venčanje nudi i rubrika [venčanice i svečane haljine](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).', text_en = 'Women''s shoes, heels and ballet flats: court shoes with a thin or a block heel, ankle-strap shoes, ballet flats, loafers, Oxfords and formal shoes for weddings and proms. A pair bought for a single evening often stays like new, so owners are happy to sell it.

Ask for the heel height in centimetres and how stable the shoe is, because a photo does not show that. Look at the heel tips, the toe and the insole with its gold lettering: the more legible the lettering, the less the shoes were worn. Patent leather must not be cracked or sticky, and satin must not have water stains. Ballet flats wear first at the heel and toes, so ask for a photo of the sole. If you are between two sizes, ask whether the model runs large or small. Choose a [dress](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) and a [bag](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) to go with the shoes, and wedding footwear is also in [wedding and formal dresses](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'shoes' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženske sandale i papuče: ravne sandale, sandale sa petom i platformom, espadrile, rimljanke, elegantne sandale za svadbe, papuče sa jednim kaišem, japanke i anatomske papuče. Prvi topli dani donose najviše oglasa, a krajem leta cene su najniže.

Tanki kaiševi su najosetljiviji deo: povucite ih blago i pogledajte gde ulaze u đon. Kod sandala sa petom proverite da li se peta klima i da li je obloga pete oguljena. Platforme obložene jutom ili plutom ne vole vlagu, pa potražite tamne mrlje i odlepljene ivice. Uložak od svetle kože brzo potamni, što kupci prvo primete, zato ga prodavci treba da slikaju izbliza. Pitajte da li je model uzak, jer se sandale ne mogu razgaziti kao zatvorene cipele. Uz sandale se nose [haljine](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) i [naočare za sunce](/oglasi/moda/naocare), a za hladnija jutra pri ruci su [ženske patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike).', text_en = 'Women''s sandals and slippers: flat sandals, sandals with a heel or a platform, espadrilles, gladiator sandals, elegant sandals for weddings, single-strap slides, flip-flops and footbed sandals. The first warm days bring the most ads, and prices are lowest at the end of summer.

Thin straps are the most delicate part: pull them gently and see where they enter the sole. On heeled sandals, check whether the heel wobbles and whether its covering is scuffed. Platforms covered in jute or cork do not like damp, so look for dark stains and edges coming unstuck. A footbed of light leather darkens quickly, which is the first thing buyers notice, so sellers should photograph it close up. Ask whether the model is narrow, because sandals cannot be broken in like closed shoes. [Dresses](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) and [sunglasses](/oglasi/moda/naocare) are worn with sandals, and [women''s trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike) are handy for cooler mornings.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'womens-shoes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sandals' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ženski parfemi svih mirisnih grupa: cvetni, voćni, slatki, orijentalni i sveži citrusni. Nude se neotpakovani parfemi, bočice iz kojih je potrošeno tek nekoliko mililitara, testeri bez ukrasne kutije i pokloni koji vlasnici nisu legli.

Kod originalnog parfema šifra serije utisnuta na dnu kutije mora da bude ista kao na bočici. Pogledajte i celofan, štampu i raspršivač: neuredni šavovi folije i krivo odštampana slova znak su kopije. Parfemska voda je jača i trajnija od toaletne, pa uporedite koncentraciju pre nego što poredite cene. Pitajte koliko je parfem star i gde je čuvan, jer miris kvare sunce i toplota kupatila. Tester ima isti sadržaj kao parfem iz prodaje, samo jednostavnije pakovanje. Trajne i jake mirise nudi stranica [arapski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), mirise za njega [muški parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), a negu i šminku rubrika [kozmetika](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika).', text_en = 'Women''s perfumes of every fragrance family: floral, fruity, sweet, oriental and fresh citrus. On offer are unopened perfumes, bottles from which only a few millilitres have been used, testers without the decorative box and gifts that did not suit their owner.

With a genuine perfume, the batch code stamped on the bottom of the box must be the same as on the bottle. Look at the cellophane, the print and the atomiser too: untidy seams in the film and crooked lettering are signs of a copy. Eau de parfum is stronger and longer-lasting than eau de toilette, so compare the concentration before comparing prices. Ask how old the perfume is and where it was kept, because sunlight and the heat of a bathroom spoil a fragrance. A tester has the same contents as the retail perfume, only simpler packaging. Long-lasting, strong scents are on the page [Arabic perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), scents for him under [men''s perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), and skincare and make-up in [cosmetics](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'perfumes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'womens' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Arapski parfemi poznati su po jačini i trajnosti: bogati mirisi ouda, ambre, mošusa, vanile, začina i ruže, koji na koži i odeći ostaju satima. Nude se parfemske vode poznatih kuća iz Emirata, kao što su Lattafa i Armaf, uljani parfemi bez alkohola u malim bočicama i kompleti sa dezodoransom.

Mnogi od ovih parfema nastali su po uzoru na skupe zapadne mirise, pa su popularan izbor za one koji žele sličan utisak za manje novca. Miris se na papiru i na koži razvija različito, a prvi utisak ume da bude prejak, pa pre kupovine veće bočice potražite manje pakovanje ili otakanu količinu za probu. Uljani parfem se nanosi u kapima i ne prska po odeći. Proverite da li su kutija i bočica zapečaćene i da li se šifra serije slaže. Uporedite ih sa klasičnom ponudom na stranicama [ženski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) i [muški parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), a ostalo nudi rubrika [parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi).', text_en = 'Arabic perfumes are known for their strength and staying power: rich scents of oud, amber, musk, vanilla, spices and rose that stay on skin and clothes for hours. On offer are eaux de parfum from well-known houses in the Emirates, such as Lattafa and Armaf, alcohol-free perfume oils in small bottles and sets with a deodorant.

Many of these perfumes were modelled on expensive Western fragrances, so they are a popular choice for those who want a similar impression for less money. A scent develops differently on paper and on skin, and the first impression can be too strong, so before buying a bigger bottle look for a smaller size or a decanted sample to try. Perfume oil is applied in drops and is not sprayed on clothes. Check that the box and the bottle are sealed and that the batch code matches. Compare them with the classic offer on the pages [women''s perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) and [men''s perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), and the rest is in [perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'perfumes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'arabic' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Muški parfemi za posao, izlazak i sport: drvenasti i začinski mirisi, sveži morski i citrusni, kožni i duvanski tonovi za veče. U oglasima su celi parfemi, započete bočice, testeri i poklon kompleti sa gelom za tuširanje ili losionom posle brijanja.

Sveži mirisi su prijatni danju i leti, ali kraće traju, dok se teži, začinski mirisi bolje pokazuju u hladnijim mesecima i uveče. Kod započete bočice tražite fotografiju nivoa tečnosti uz svetlo i pitajte koliko je parfem star. Boja tečnosti koja je potamnela ne mora da znači kvar, ali kiseo ili metalan miris pri prvom prskanju znači. Uporedite oznake na kutiji i bočici i ne nasedajte na cenu daleko ispod uobičajene. Poklon komplet se isplati ako ćete koristiti sve iz njega. Izrazito trajne mirise nudi stranica [arapski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), pribor za brijanje i negu rubrika [kozmetika](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika), a uz parfem je lep poklon i [muški sat](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi).', text_en = 'Men''s perfumes for work, going out and sport: woody and spicy scents, fresh marine and citrus ones, leather and tobacco notes for the evening. The ads include full bottles, part-used bottles, testers and gift sets with a shower gel or an aftershave lotion.

Fresh scents are pleasant by day and in summer but do not last as long, while heavier, spicy scents show better in the colder months and in the evening. With a part-used bottle, ask for a photo of the liquid level against the light and how old the perfume is. Liquid that has darkened does not have to mean it has gone off, but a sour or metallic smell at the first spray does. Compare the markings on the box and the bottle and do not fall for a price far below the usual. A gift set pays off if you will use everything in it. Markedly long-lasting scents are on the page [Arabic perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), shaving and grooming products in [cosmetics](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika), and a [men''s watch](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) makes a fine gift alongside a perfume.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'perfumes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'mens' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Dušeci i jastuci za zdrav san: dušeci sa džepičastim oprugama, od hladne i memorijske pene, lateks dušeci, tanki naddušeci, dušeci za dečje krevetce i anatomski jastuci. U oglasima ima i potpuno novih dušeka, kupljenih u pogrešnoj dimenziji ili tvrdoći.

Dimenzije dušeka moraju tačno da odgovaraju okviru kreveta, pa izmerite unutrašnju širinu i dužinu ležišta. Tvrdoća se bira prema težini i položaju spavanja: ko spava na boku, traži mekše rame i kuk, ko spava na leđima, čvršću podlogu. Polovan dušek pogledajte bez navlake: udubljenja na mestima ležanja, mrlje i miris vlage razlog su da odustanete. Pitajte koliko je star i da li se navlaka skida i pere. Prodavci neka napišu visinu dušeka i vrstu jezgra. Okvir sa podnicom birajte na stranici [bračni i boks kreveti](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), a čaršave i prekrivače na stranici [posteljina i jorgani](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani).', text_en = 'Mattresses and pillows for healthy sleep: pocket-sprung mattresses, cold-foam and memory-foam ones, latex mattresses, thin toppers, cot mattresses and contoured pillows. The ads also include brand-new mattresses bought in the wrong size or firmness.

The size of a mattress must match the bed frame exactly, so measure the inner width and length of the base. Firmness is chosen according to weight and sleeping position: side sleepers want a softer shoulder and hip, back sleepers a firmer base. Look at a used mattress without its cover: dips where people lay, stains and a smell of damp are reasons to walk away. Ask how old it is and whether the cover comes off for washing. Sellers should give the height of the mattress and the type of core. Choose a frame with slats on the page [double and box-spring beds](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), and sheets and bedspreads on the page [bed linen and duvets](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'beds') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'mattresses' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Bračni i boks kreveti za spavaću sobu: kreveti sa podiznom podnicom i sandukom za posteljinu, boks kreveti sa visokim ležajem, tapacirani kreveti, kreveti od punog drveta i metalni kreveti. Prodaju se sa dušekom ili bez njega, što obavezno piše u dobrom oglasu.

Krevet se kupuje prema dimenziji ležaja, a ne prema spoljnoj meri, pa uporedite oba podatka sa prostorom u sobi. Pritisnite uglove i sedite na ivicu: krevet ne sme da škripi ni da se klati. Kod podiznog mehanizma proverite amortizere, koji moraju da drže podnicu podignutom. Pogledajte letvice, nosače i tapacirung uzglavlja. Pitajte da li se krevet rastavlja i da li su sačuvani šrafovi i okovi, jer veliki okvir ne prolazi kroz svaka vrata. Novi ležaj birajte na stranici [dušeci i jastuci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci), garderobu smestite u [ormare i plakare](/oglasi/namestaj/ormari-i-komode), a prevoz dogovorite u rubrici [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Double and box-spring beds for the bedroom: beds with a lift-up base and a storage box for bedding, box-spring beds with a high sleeping surface, upholstered beds, solid-wood beds and metal beds. They are sold with a mattress or without one, which a good ad always says.

A bed is bought by the size of the sleeping surface, not the outer measurement, so compare both with the space in the room. Press the corners and sit on the edge: the bed must not creak or wobble. On a lift-up mechanism, check the gas struts, which must hold the base raised. Look at the slats, the supports and the upholstery of the headboard. Ask whether the bed comes apart and whether the screws and fittings have been kept, because a large frame does not go through every door. Choose a new sleeping surface on the page [mattresses and pillows](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci), store clothes in [wardrobes](/oglasi/namestaj/ormari-i-komode), and arrange transport in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'beds') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'beds' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Lusteri i plafonjere za dnevnu sobu, trpezariju, hodnik i spavaću sobu: kristalni i mesingani lusteri, moderni lusteri sa više krakova, viseće lampe iznad stola, ravne plafonjere i ugradne svetiljke. Stari lusteri iz salonskih stanova ponovo su traženi, pa vrede više nego što vlasnici misle.

Visinu lustera uporedite sa visinom plafona: u niskim prostorijama bolja je plafonjera, a iznad trpezarijskog stola viseća svetiljka. Proverite koliko sijalica prima, sa kojim grlom, i da li su svi krakovi, čašice i kristali na broju. Stare instalacije u lusteru treba da pregleda električar pre kačenja. Težak luster traži kuku ili tipl u betonu, ne u gipsu. Staklene delove za slanje treba pakovati pojedinačno, zato je lično preuzimanje sigurnije. Sijalice i trake birajte na stranici [LED rasveta](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), dopunsko svetlo daju [podne i stone lampe](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe), a montažu rade [majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Chandeliers and ceiling lights for the living room, dining room, hall and bedroom: crystal and brass chandeliers, modern multi-arm chandeliers, pendants over the table, flush ceiling lights and recessed fittings. Old chandeliers from grand flats are in demand again, so they are worth more than their owners think.

Compare the height of a chandelier with the height of the ceiling: in low rooms a flush light is better, and over a dining table a pendant. Check how many bulbs it takes, with which cap, and whether all the arms, cups and crystals are there. Old wiring in a chandelier should be checked by an electrician before hanging. A heavy chandelier needs a hook or a plug in concrete, not in plasterboard. Glass parts have to be packed individually for sending, so collecting in person is safer. Choose bulbs and strips on the page [LED lighting](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), [floor and table lamps](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe) give extra light, and fitting is done by [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'lighting') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'chandeliers' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'LED rasveta i sijalice za stan, lokal i dvorište: LED sijalice svih grla, trake na metar i u kolutu, paneli za spuštene plafone, reflektori, ugradne svetiljke i ukrasna rasveta. Prodaju se i veće količine preostale posle opremanja lokala ili zamene rasvete u firmi.

Uz snagu u vatima pogledajte svetlosni tok u lumenima i boju svetla: toplo bela prija u dnevnoj i spavaćoj sobi, neutralna u kuhinji i kupatilu, a hladno bela u radionici i garaži. Kod traka pitajte na kom naponu rade, da li ide napajanje i kolika je gustina dioda po metru. Za kupatilo i dvorište tražite oznaku zaštite od vlage. Sijalice sa regulacijom jačine rade samo sa odgovarajućim prekidačem. Proverite da li u kompletu svetle sve diode i da li boja svetla odgovara među komadima. Kućišta za sijalice nudi stranica [lusteri i plafonjere](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), a struju sa krova [solarni paneli](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/solarni-paneli).', text_en = 'LED lighting and bulbs for the flat, the shop and the yard: LED bulbs of every cap, strips by the metre and on the reel, panels for suspended ceilings, floodlights, recessed fittings and decorative lighting. Bigger quantities left over after fitting out premises or replacing the lighting in a company are sold too.

Besides the power in watts, look at the light output in lumens and the colour of the light: warm white is pleasant in the living room and bedroom, neutral in the kitchen and bathroom, and cool white in a workshop and garage. With strips, ask what voltage they run on, whether a power supply is included and how many diodes there are per metre. For a bathroom and a yard, ask for the moisture-protection rating. Dimmable bulbs work only with a suitable switch. Check that all the diodes in a set light up and that the colour of the light matches between pieces. Fittings for bulbs are on the page [chandeliers and ceiling lights](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), and electricity from the roof comes from [solar panels](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/solarni-paneli).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'lighting') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'led' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Podne i stone lampe za čitanje, rad i prijatnu atmosferu: lampe sa abažurom, lučne podne lampe, radne lampe sa pokretnom rukom, noćne lampe za spavaću i dečju sobu, starinske lampe od mesinga i porcelana. Lampa je najlakši način da soba izgleda toplije.

Uključite lampu i pomerite kabl kod prekidača i grla: treperenje znači loš kontakt, koji električar lako popravlja, ali treba da se odrazi na cenu. Abažur pogledajte prema svetlu zbog fleka, pukotina i požutele tkanine. Podna lampa mora da ima teško postolje, da se ne prevrće u stanu sa decom i ljubimcima. Kod radne lampe proverite da li zglobovi drže položaj. Starinske lampe često imaju stari kabl bez uzemljenja, pa ga treba zameniti pre upotrebe. Glavno svetlo birajte na stranici [lusteri i plafonjere](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), štedljive izvore svetla na stranici [LED rasveta](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), a ostale ukrase u rubrici [dekoracija za stan](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija).', text_en = 'Floor and table lamps for reading, working and a pleasant atmosphere: lamps with a shade, arc floor lamps, desk lamps with an adjustable arm, bedside lamps for the bedroom and the children''s room, antique lamps of brass and porcelain. A lamp is the easiest way to make a room look warmer.

Switch the lamp on and move the cable at the switch and the holder: flickering means a poor contact, which an electrician fixes easily, but it should be reflected in the price. Hold the shade up to the light to see stains, cracks and yellowed fabric. A floor lamp must have a heavy base so that it does not tip over in a home with children and pets. On a desk lamp, check that the joints hold their position. Antique lamps often have an old cable without earthing, which should be replaced before use. Choose the main light on the page [chandeliers and ceiling lights](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), economical light sources on the page [LED lighting](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), and other ornaments in [home decor](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'lighting') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'lamps' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ugaone garniture za dnevnu sobu: garniture sa ležajem i sandukom za posteljinu, modeli u obliku slova koja se slažu iz elemenata, garniture sa pomičnim naslonima za glavu, od štofa, mikrofibera, kože i eko kože. Oglasa je najviše u vreme selidbi, krajem leta.

Prvo utvrdite na kojoj strani vam treba ugao: gleda se sa mesta ispred garniture, a neki modeli mogu da se sklope na obe strane. Izmerite obe dužine i dubinu sedenja, pa na podu sobe obeležite površinu koju će garnitura zauzeti. Razvucite ležaj do kraja i lezite: spojevi jastuka ne smeju da žuljaju. Pogledajte nogice, dno i sanduk, jer se tu vide tragovi vlage i moljaca. Pitajte da li je u kući bilo ljubimaca i pušača, jer štof zadržava mirise. Dubinsko pranje nude oglasi u rubrici [čišćenje](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje), manje komade stranica [kauči, dvosedi i trosedi](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/kauci-i-trosedi), a prevoz rubrika [selidbe](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Corner sofas for the living room: sofas with a pull-out bed and a storage box for bedding, modular models assembled from elements, sofas with adjustable headrests, in fabric, microfibre, leather and faux leather. Most ads appear at moving time, at the end of summer.

First establish which side you need the corner on: it is judged from in front of the sofa, and some models can be assembled either way. Measure both lengths and the seat depth, then mark out on the floor of the room the area the sofa will take up. Pull the bed out fully and lie down: the joins between the cushions must not dig in. Look at the feet, the underside and the storage box, where traces of damp and moths show. Ask whether there were pets and smokers in the house, because fabric holds smells. Deep cleaning is offered by the ads in [cleaning](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje), smaller pieces are on the page [sofas, two- and three-seaters](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/kauci-i-trosedi), and transport is in [removals](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'sofas') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'corner-sofas' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kauči, dvosedi i trosedi za manje dnevne sobe, garsonjere, kancelarije i čekaonice: kauči na razvlačenje za svakodnevno spavanje, trosedi sa ležajem za goste, dvosedi, kožni trosedi i sofe na nogicama. Zauzimaju manje mesta od ugaone garniture i lakše se unose u stan.

Ako ćete na kauču spavati svake noći, mehanizam i ležaj su važniji od izgleda: tražite ravnu površinu bez rupe na spoju i jezgro koje ne propada. Za goste nekoliko puta godišnje dovoljan je i jednostavniji mehanizam. Kožu pogledajte na sedištu i rukonaslonima: prava koža dobija patinu, a veštačka se ljušti u listićima i ne može se popraviti. Proverite da li su navlake na jastucima skidive. Širinu kauča uporedite sa širinom ulaznih vrata i zavojem stepeništa. Za veću porodicu pogledajte [ugaone garniture](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture), ispred kauča ide stočić iz rubrike [stolovi i stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice), a pod greju [tepisi i staze](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze).', text_en = 'Sofas, two-seaters and three-seaters for smaller living rooms, studio flats, offices and waiting rooms: sofa beds for everyday sleeping, three-seaters with a guest bed, two-seaters, leather three-seaters and sofas on legs. They take up less room than a corner sofa and are easier to get into a flat.

If you will sleep on the sofa every night, the mechanism and the sleeping surface matter more than the looks: ask for a flat surface without a gap at the join and a core that does not sag. For guests a few times a year a simpler mechanism will do. Look at leather on the seat and armrests: real leather gains a patina, whereas faux leather flakes off and cannot be repaired. Check whether the cushion covers are removable. Compare the width of the sofa with the width of the front door and the turn of the staircase. For a bigger family see [corner sofas](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture), a coffee table from [tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice) goes in front of the sofa, and [rugs and runners](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze) warm the floor.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'sofas') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sofas' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Trpezarijski stolovi i stolice za kuhinju i trpezariju: stolovi na razvlačenje, okrugli i ovalni stolovi, masivni stolovi od hrasta i oraha, stolovi sa staklenom pločom, kompleti sa četiri, šest ili više stolica i ugaone klupe. Komplet od punog drveta ume da nadživi nekoliko selidbi.

Računajte da svakom gostu treba dovoljno mesta za laktove, a iza stolica prostor da se ustane. Sto na razvlačenje otvorite do kraja i proverite da li umetak leži ravno i u istoj boji kao ostatak ploče. Furnir pogledajte po ivicama, gde se najpre odlepi, a masiv zbog pukotina. Na svaku stolicu sedite i zaljuljajte je: rasklimani spojevi se lepe, ali to je posao za stolara. Kod tapaciranih sedišta pitajte da li se navlake skidaju. Tanjire i pribor nudi rubrika [posuđe i escajg](/oglasi/namestaj/posudje), svetlo iznad stola stranica [lusteri i plafonjere](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), a visoke stolice za šank stranica [barske stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice).', text_en = 'Dining tables and chairs for the kitchen and dining room: extending tables, round and oval tables, solid oak and walnut tables, glass-topped tables, sets with four, six or more chairs and corner benches. A solid-wood set can outlive several moves.

Allow each guest enough elbow room, and space behind the chairs to get up. Open an extending table fully and check that the leaf lies flat and is the same colour as the rest of the top. Look at veneer along the edges, where it lifts first, and at solid wood for cracks. Sit on every chair and rock it: loose joints can be glued, but that is a job for a joiner. With upholstered seats, ask whether the covers come off. Plates and cutlery are in [cookware and cutlery](/oglasi/namestaj/posudje), light over the table on the page [chandeliers and ceiling lights](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), and tall chairs for a counter on the page [bar stools](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tables-chairs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'dining' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Barske stolice za kuhinjski šank, ostrvo, kafić i lokal: stolice sa gasnim liftom i okretnim sedištem, drvene i metalne stolice fiksne visine, modeli sa naslonom i bez njega i industrijske stolice od čelika. Često se prodaju u kompletu, posle preuređenja lokala.

Visina sedišta mora da odgovara visini ploče: između sedišta i donje ivice šanka treba da ostane mesta za kolena. Zato izmerite šank pre nego što pogledate oglas. Kod stolica sa gasnim liftom sedite i proverite da li cilindar drži visinu ili polako tone. Postolje treba da bude teško i sa gumenom ivicom, da ne grebe pod. Oslonac za noge je obavezan za udobno sedenje. Za lokal tražite modele namenjene ugostiteljstvu, jer su čvršći od kućnih. Ostalu opremu za kafiće nudi rubrika [ugostiteljska oprema](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), kuhinjske elemente rubrika [kuhinje](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje), a klasične komplete stranica [trpezarijski stolovi i stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice).', text_en = 'Bar stools for the kitchen counter, the island, the café and the shop: stools with a gas lift and a swivel seat, wooden and metal stools of fixed height, models with and without a backrest and industrial steel stools. They are often sold as a set after premises have been refitted.

The seat height must suit the height of the worktop: between the seat and the underside of the counter there should be room for the knees. So measure the counter before you look at an ad. On stools with a gas lift, sit down and check whether the cylinder holds its height or sinks slowly. The base should be heavy and have a rubber rim so that it does not scratch the floor. A footrest is essential for comfortable sitting. For business premises, ask for models made for the hospitality trade, because they are sturdier than domestic ones. Other equipment for cafés is in [catering equipment](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), kitchen units in [kitchens](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje), and classic sets on the page [dining tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'tables-chairs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'bar-stools' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Tepisi i staze za dnevnu sobu, hodnik, dečju sobu i terasu: vuneni i sintetički tepisi, čupavi tepisi dugog vlakna, ručno tkani ćilimi, orijentalni tepisi, staze za hodnik i stepenice, perivi tepisi i podmetači. Ručno rađeni pirotski ćilimi imaju i kolekcionarsku vrednost.

Tepih ne treba da pluta nasred sobe: prednje noge nameštaja treba da stoje na njemu, pa izmerite prostor pre kupovine. Pogledajte naličje: kod ručno tkanog tepiha šara se vidi i sa zadnje strane, a čvorovi su blago neravnomerni. Raširite ga ceo i potražite izbledela mesta od sunca, rupe od moljaca i tragove ljubimaca. Vuna je topla i dugotrajna, sintetika se lakše pere i jeftinija je. Pitajte da li je tepih skoro pran i kako. Za decu birajte tepih kratkog vlakna, koji se lako usisava. Pranje sa odvozom nude oglasi u rubrici [čišćenje](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje), posteljinu stranica [posteljina i jorgani](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani), a dubinsko pranje kod kuće omogućavaju [paročistači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci).', text_en = 'Rugs and runners for the living room, hall, children''s room and terrace: wool and synthetic rugs, shaggy long-pile rugs, hand-woven kilims, oriental carpets, runners for halls and stairs, washable rugs and mats. Hand-made Pirot kilims have a collector''s value too.

A rug should not float in the middle of the room: the front legs of the furniture should stand on it, so measure the space before buying. Look at the back: on a hand-woven rug the pattern shows on the reverse too, and the knots are slightly uneven. Spread it out fully and look for patches faded by the sun, moth holes and traces of pets. Wool is warm and long-lasting; synthetics are easier to wash and cheaper. Ask whether the rug was washed recently and how. For children, choose a short-pile rug that is easy to vacuum. Washing with collection is offered by the ads in [cleaning](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje), bedding is on the page [bed linen and duvets](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani), and [steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci) make deep cleaning at home possible.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'textiles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'rugs' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posteljina i jorgani za miran san: pamučna, satenska, flanelska i krep posteljina, čaršavi sa lastišem, jorgani za leto i zimu, vuneni i perjani pokrivači, ćebad i prekrivači. Mnogo je novih kompleta u originalnom pakovanju, dobijenih na poklon ili kupljenih u pogrešnoj dimenziji.

Pre kupovine izmerite jorgan i dušek, jer se dimenzije jorganskih navlaka i jastučnica razlikuju među proizvođačima. Čaršav sa lastišem mora da odgovara i visini dušeka. Pamuk sa gušćim tkanjem je glatkiji i trajniji, flanel je topao za zimu, a krep ne traži peglanje. Kod jorgana pitajte čime je punjen i da li se pere u mašini. Perjani jorgani i jastuci ne smeju da ispuštaju perje kroz platno. Iz higijenskih razloga većina kupaca traži novu ili jedva korišćenu posteljinu, pa stanje opišite tačno. Dušek i jastuke birajte na stranici [dušeci i jastuci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci), a opremu za bebe u rubrici [krevetci za bebe](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).', text_en = 'Bed linen and duvets for a peaceful sleep: cotton, sateen, flannel and seersucker bedding, fitted sheets, duvets for summer and winter, wool and down covers, blankets and bedspreads. There are many new sets in the original packaging, received as gifts or bought in the wrong size.

Before buying, measure your duvet and mattress, because the sizes of duvet covers and pillowcases differ between makers. A fitted sheet must suit the height of the mattress too. Cotton with a denser weave is smoother and more durable, flannel is warm for winter, and seersucker needs no ironing. With a duvet, ask what it is filled with and whether it is machine-washable. Down duvets and pillows must not shed feathers through the fabric. For hygiene, most buyers want new or barely used bedding, so describe the condition accurately. Choose a mattress and pillows on the page [mattresses and pillows](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci), and things for babies in [cots and children''s beds](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'textiles') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'bedding' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Hranilice za bebe od prve kašice do zajedničkog ručka: klasične visoke hranilice sa poslužavnikom, sklopive hranilice za male kuhinje, drvene stolice koje rastu sa detetom, hranilice koje se pretvaraju u stočić i stolicu i sedišta koja se kače na običnu stolicu.

Dete u hranilici sedi nekoliko puta dnevno, pa je bezbednost na prvom mestu. Pojas treba da ima pet tačaka vezivanja ili bar pregradu između nogu, da dete ne isklizne. Raširite hranilicu i gurnite je sa strane: mora da stoji stabilno i da se ne sklapa sama. Poslužavnik koji se skida jednom rukom i pere u sudoperi olakšava svaki obrok. Pogledajte navlaku sedišta, jer ispucala mušema skuplja ostatke hrane. Pitajte da li se naslon obara i da li se visina podešava. Ostalu opremu nudi rubrika [oprema za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe), nameštaj za dečju sobu rubrika [krevetci i dečiji kreveti](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), a za izlaske su praktična [kišobran kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica).', text_en = 'High chairs for babies from the first spoonful to the family lunch: classic high chairs with a tray, folding high chairs for small kitchens, wooden chairs that grow with the child, high chairs that convert into a small table and chair, and booster seats that strap onto an ordinary chair.

A child sits in a high chair several times a day, so safety comes first. The harness should have five anchor points or at least a crotch post so that the child cannot slide out. Open the high chair out and push it from the side: it must stand firm and not fold by itself. A tray that comes off with one hand and can be washed in the sink makes every meal easier. Look at the seat cover, because cracked wipe-clean fabric collects food. Ask whether the backrest reclines and whether the height adjusts. Other equipment is in [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe), furniture for the nursery in [cots and children''s beds](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), and an [umbrella stroller](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica) is practical for going out.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'baby-gear') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'high-chairs' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kišobran kolica su laka kolica koja se sklapaju jednim potezom i staju u svaki gepek, autobus ili avion. Namenjena su deci koja već samostalno sede, a služe kao druga kolica za putovanja, grad i vrtić, kada velika kolica postanu nezgrapna.

Podignite ih sklopljena: razlika između modela oseti se odmah, a nosićete ih često. Proverite da li se naslon obara dovoljno za spavanje, jer najjednostavniji modeli imaju samo sedeći položaj. Kočnica treba da blokira oba zadnja točka, a prednji točkovi da se okreću i zaključavaju. Pogledajte ram na spojevima i zakivcima, gde se labavi posle godina sklapanja, kao i platno sedišta i pojas. Tenda sa zaštitom od sunca i kišna navlaka dobri su dodaci. Pitajte do koje težine deteta se kolica koriste. Za novorođenče su potrebna [kolica 3u1 i 2u1](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1), za vožnju automobilom [auto sedišta za decu](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), a ostale tipove nudi rubrika [kolica za bebe](/oglasi/deca/kolica).', text_en = 'Umbrella strollers are light pushchairs that fold in one move and fit into any boot, bus or plane. They are meant for children who already sit up unaided and serve as a second pushchair for travel, the city and nursery, when a big pram becomes unwieldy.

Lift them folded: the difference between models is felt at once, and you will carry them often. Check that the backrest reclines enough for a nap, because the simplest models have a sitting position only. The brake should lock both rear wheels, and the front wheels should swivel and lock. Look at the frame at the joints and rivets, where it loosens after years of folding, and at the seat fabric and the harness. A canopy with sun protection and a rain cover are good extras. Ask up to what weight of child the stroller can be used. A newborn needs a [3-in-1 or 2-in-1 pram](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1), car journeys need [child car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), and other types are in [prams and pushchairs](/oglasi/deca/kolica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'strollers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'umbrella' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kolica 3u1 i 2u1 prate bebu od rođenja: duboka korpa za prve mesece, sportsko sedište za kasnije i, kod kompleta 3u1, auto-sedište koje se kači na isti ram. Kupuju se pre porođaja i koriste dve do tri godine, pa se polovni kompleti dobro drže.

Tražite da vidite sve delove sklopljene na ramu: korpu, sportski deo i auto-sedište sa adapterima. Proverite da li se smer sedišta menja, kako rade amortizeri i da li ram škripi kada ga pritisnete. Veliki točkovi na naduvavanje bolji su za loše trotoare i park, a mali puni točkovi za tržni centar i gepek. Auto-sedište iz kompleta ima rok upotrebe i ne sme da se koristi posle sudara, pa pitajte za godinu proizvodnje. Dušek korpe i navlake treba da se skidaju radi pranja. Kada dete poraste, zameniće ih [kišobran kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica). Veća sedišta za vožnju nudi rubrika [auto sedišta za decu](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), a krevetac rubrika [krevetci za bebe](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).', text_en = '3-in-1 and 2-in-1 prams go with a baby from birth: a carrycot for the first months, a pushchair seat for later and, in 3-in-1 sets, a car seat that clips onto the same chassis. They are bought before the birth and used for two to three years, so second-hand sets hold up well.

Ask to see all the parts assembled on the chassis: the carrycot, the pushchair seat and the car seat with its adapters. Check whether the seat can face both ways, how the suspension works and whether the chassis creaks when you press on it. Big air-filled wheels are better for bad pavements and the park, and small solid wheels for the shopping centre and the car boot. The car seat in the set has a service life and must not be used after a crash, so ask for the year of manufacture. The carrycot mattress and the covers should come off for washing. When the child grows, an [umbrella stroller](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica) will replace them. Bigger seats for travelling are in [child car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), and a cot in [cots](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'strollers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'travel-systems' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'LEGO kocke za decu i odrasle graditelje: kompleti u kutiji, već sklopljeni modeli, kocke na kilogram, figurice, veće kocke za najmlađe i stari kompleti koji se više ne proizvode. Kocke su gotovo neuništive, pa polovne služe jednako dobro kao nove.

Kod kompleta pitajte da li su svi delovi na broju, da li postoje uputstvo i kutija i da li su figurice originalne, jer one često čine dobar deo vrednosti. Kompleti koji su povučeni iz prodaje vremenom poskupljuju, naročito neotvoreni. Kocke na kilogram su najjeftiniji način da se dopuni kolekcija, ali proverite da nisu pomešane sa kockama drugih proizvođača: originalne imaju natpis marke na svakom čepu. Bele i sive kocke koje su stajale na suncu požute. Polovne kocke operite u mlakoj vodi sa malo deterdženta. Ostale igračke nudi rubrika [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke), igre sa ekranom stranica [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), a police i stolove za slaganje rubrika [dečiji nameštaj](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).', text_en = 'LEGO bricks for children and grown-up builders: boxed sets, models already built, bricks by the kilogram, minifigures, bigger bricks for the youngest and old sets that are no longer made. The bricks are almost indestructible, so used ones serve just as well as new.

With a set, ask whether all the pieces are there, whether the instructions and the box exist and whether the minifigures are original, because they often make up a good part of the value. Sets withdrawn from sale become more expensive over time, especially unopened ones. Bricks by the kilogram are the cheapest way to add to a collection, but check that they are not mixed with bricks from other makers: genuine ones have the brand name on every stud. White and grey bricks left in the sun turn yellow. Wash used bricks in lukewarm water with a little detergent. Other toys are in [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke), games with a screen on the page [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), and shelves and tables for building in [children''s furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'toys') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'lego' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ljuljaške i tobogani za dvorište: metalne i drvene ljuljaške, ljuljaške gnezdo, tobogani raznih dužina, penjalice, kućice za igru, peščanici, trambuline sa zaštitnom mrežom i dečji bazeni. Deca ih prerastu za nekoliko sezona, pa se prodaju očuvane i povoljno.

Kod polovne opreme pregledajte sve što nosi težinu deteta: kuke, lance, užad i mesta gde se ram spaja. Rđa na metalu, napukla plastika koja je izbledela na suncu i trulo drvo pri zemlji razlog su za nižu cenu ili odustajanje. Pitajte za najveću dozvoljenu težinu i uzrast. Ljuljašku i penjalicu treba ankerisati u zemlju ili beton, a oko njih ostaviti slobodan prostor na mekoj podlozi. Kod trambuline proverite opruge, platno i mrežu, jer se oni menjaju posebno. Rastavljenu spravu preuzmite sa svim šrafovima i uputstvom. Mesto za roditelje nudi rubrika [baštenski nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj), vožnju po dvorištu [dečiji bicikli i trotineti](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), a ostalo rubrika [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke).', text_en = 'Swings and slides for the garden: metal and wooden swings, nest swings, slides of various lengths, climbing frames, playhouses, sandpits, trampolines with a safety net and paddling pools. Children outgrow them in a few seasons, so they are sold in good condition and cheaply.

With used equipment, inspect everything that carries the child''s weight: hooks, chains, ropes and the places where the frame joins. Rust on metal, cracked plastic faded by the sun and rotten wood near the ground are reasons for a lower price or for walking away. Ask about the maximum permitted weight and the age range. A swing and a climbing frame should be anchored in the ground or in concrete, with free space left around them on a soft surface. On a trampoline, check the springs, the mat and the net, because they are replaced separately. Collect dismantled equipment with all the bolts and the instructions. A place for parents is in [garden furniture](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj), riding around the yard is covered by [children''s bikes and scooters](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), and the rest is in [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'toys') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'outdoor' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Hrana za pse i mačke: suve granule u džakovima, konzerve i kesice, poslastice, hrana za štence i mačiće, za sterilisane i starije životinje i dijetalna hrana po preporuci veterinara. Oglašavaju se prodavnice, uvoznici i vlasnici kojima je ostao višak.

Rok trajanja i broj serije odštampani su na pakovanju, pa tražite da ih vidite na fotografiji. Otvoren džak kupujte samo ako znate kada je otvoren i kako je čuvan: granule na vlazi i toploti užegnu i gube ukus. Sastav čitajte od početka, jer su sastojci navedeni po količini. Novu hranu uvodite postepeno, mešajući je sa starom tokom nekoliko dana, da ljubimac ne dobije stomačne tegobe. Hranu po preporuci veterinara ne menjajte bez dogovora sa njim. Veće pakovanje je povoljnije po kilogramu, ako ga ljubimac potroši na vreme. Činije i ležaljke nudi stranica [ležaljke, ogrlice i povoci](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), a nove članove porodice rubrike [psi i štenci](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi) i [mačke i mačići](/oglasi/ljubimci/macke).', text_en = 'Food for dogs and cats: dry kibble in bags, tins and pouches, treats, food for puppies and kittens, for neutered and older animals and diet food recommended by a vet. Shops, importers and owners left with a surplus all advertise.

The best-before date and the batch number are printed on the packaging, so ask to see them in a photo. Buy an opened bag only if you know when it was opened and how it was kept: kibble goes rancid and loses its taste in damp and heat. Read the composition from the start, because the ingredients are listed by quantity. Introduce a new food gradually, mixing it with the old one over a few days, so that your pet does not get an upset stomach. Do not change food recommended by a vet without consulting them. A bigger pack is cheaper per kilogram, provided your pet finishes it in time. Bowls and beds are on the page [beds, collars and leads](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), and new family members in [dogs and puppies](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi) and [cats and kittens](/oglasi/ljubimci/macke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'pet-supplies') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'food' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Akvarijumi za ribice i oprema za njih: stakleni akvarijumi svih zapremina, kompleti sa poklopcem i rasvetom, postolja, filteri, grejači, pumpe za vazduh, dekoracija, podloga i biljke. Uređen akvarijum sa opremom često se prodaje u kompletu kada vlasnik odustane od hobija.

Polovan akvarijum pre unošenja u stan napunite vodom napolju ili u kupatilu i ostavite da prenoći: tako ćete videti da li spojevi cure. Pogledajte silikon u uglovima, koji ne sme da bude ispucao ni odlepljen, i staklo zbog dubokih ogrebotina. Veći akvarijum je stabilniji i lakši za održavanje od malog, ali pun teži mnogo, pa mu treba čvrsto i ravno postolje. Filter birajte prema zapremini. Ribe se ne useljavaju odmah: voda sa filterom treba prvo da sazri nekoliko nedelja. Stanovnike akvarijuma nudi rubrika [ribice, glodari i ostali ljubimci](/oglasi/ljubimci/ostali-ljubimci), terarijume i kaveze stranica [kavezi, transporteri i kućice](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), a ostalo rubrika [oprema za ljubimce](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce).', text_en = 'Aquariums for fish and equipment for them: glass tanks of every volume, sets with a lid and lighting, stands, filters, heaters, air pumps, decoration, substrate and plants. A set-up aquarium with equipment is often sold complete when the owner gives up the hobby.

Before bringing a used aquarium into the flat, fill it with water outdoors or in the bathroom and leave it overnight: that will show whether the seams leak. Look at the silicone in the corners, which must not be cracked or peeling, and at the glass for deep scratches. A bigger tank is more stable and easier to maintain than a small one, but it weighs a great deal when full, so it needs a firm, level stand. Choose the filter according to the volume. Fish are not moved in straight away: water with the filter running first has to mature for a few weeks. Inhabitants for the tank are in [fish, rodents and other pets](/oglasi/ljubimci/ostali-ljubimci), terrariums and cages on the page [cages, carriers and kennels](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), and the rest in [pet supplies](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'pet-supplies') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'aquariums' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Kavezi, transporteri i kućice za ljubimce: kavezi za papagaje i kanarince, kavezi za zečeve, hrčke i zamorce, transporteri za mačke i pse, sklopivi žičani boksevi, kućice za dvorište i ograde za štence. Veličina mora da odgovara životinji, ne slobodnom mestu u stanu.

Kod kaveza za ptice razmak između žica mora biti dovoljno mali da ptica ne provuče glavu, a žica bez rđe i oljuštene boje. Kavez za glodare treba da ima puno dno, jer žičani pod povređuje šape. U transporteru pas ili mačka treba da mogu da ustanu i okrenu se, a za putovanje avionom važe posebna pravila prevoznika, pa ih proverite pre kupovine. Kućica za dvorište treba da bude izdignuta od zemlje, sa izolovanim podom i krovom koji ne prokišnjava. Polovan kavez operite i dezinfikujte pre upotrebe. Stanare za kavez nudi rubrika [papagaji, golubovi i ptice](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice), pse rubrika [psi i štenci](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi), a čuvanje dok ste na putu rubrika [pansion za pse](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce).', text_en = 'Cages, carriers and kennels for pets: cages for parrots and canaries, cages for rabbits, hamsters and guinea pigs, carriers for cats and dogs, folding wire crates, kennels for the yard and puppy pens. The size must suit the animal, not the free space in the flat.

On a bird cage, the gap between the bars must be small enough that the bird cannot push its head through, and the wire free of rust and flaking paint. A cage for rodents should have a solid floor, because a wire floor injures paws. In a carrier a dog or cat should be able to stand up and turn round, and special airline rules apply to air travel, so check them before buying. A kennel for the yard should be raised off the ground, with an insulated floor and a roof that does not leak. Wash and disinfect a used cage before use. Tenants for the cage are in [parrots, pigeons and birds](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice), dogs in [dogs and puppies](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi), and care while you are away in [dog boarding](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'pet-supplies') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'cages' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ležaljke, ogrlice i povoci za pse i mačke: mekani kreveti i jastuci, ortopedske ležaljke za starije pse, ogrlice od kože i najlona, amovi, povoci na izvlačenje, korpe za zaštitu, činije, grebalice i penjalice za mačke i odeća za male rase.

Ogrlica dobro stoji ako ispod nje mogu da stanu dva prsta, a am ne sme da žulja ispod prednjih nogu. Za štene birajte podesive modele, jer brzo raste. Povodac na izvlačenje proverite celom dužinom: traka ne sme da bude zasečena, a kočnica mora da drži na trzaj. Ležaljku birajte prema dužini ispruženog psa, sa navlakom koja se skida i pere u mašini. Kod grebalice gledajte težinu postolja, da se ne prevrne kada mačka skoči na vrh. Polovnu opremu od tekstila operite na visokoj temperaturi pre upotrebe. Hranu birajte na stranici [hrana za pse i mačke](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), šišanje i dresuru u rubrici [usluge za ljubimce](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce), a boksove za prevoz na stranici [kavezi i transporteri](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri).', text_en = 'Beds, collars and leads for dogs and cats: soft beds and cushions, orthopaedic beds for older dogs, leather and nylon collars, harnesses, retractable leads, muzzles, bowls, scratching posts and cat trees, and clothes for small breeds.

A collar fits well if two fingers slide under it, and a harness must not rub under the front legs. For a puppy choose adjustable models, because it grows fast. Check a retractable lead along its whole length: the tape must not be nicked, and the brake must hold against a jerk. Choose a bed by the length of the dog stretched out, with a cover that comes off and goes in the washing machine. With a scratching post, look at the weight of the base so that it does not tip over when the cat jumps to the top. Wash used fabric items at a high temperature before use. Choose food on the page [food for dogs and cats](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), grooming and training in [pet services](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce), and travel crates on the page [cages and carriers](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'pet-supplies') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'beds-collars' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Električni bicikli pomažu pri okretanju pedala, pa uzbrdica i vetar više nisu prepreka: gradski modeli sa niskim ramom, brdski električni bicikli, sklopivi za stan i gepek i teretni bicikli za dostavu. Sve više ih koriste i oni koji na posao žele da stignu bez znoja.

Baterija je najskuplji deo, pa od nje počnite. Pitajte koliko je stara i koliko je ciklusa punjenja prošla, a domet proverite probnom vožnjom, ne na papiru. Motor u pogonskoj osovini daje prirodniji osećaj i bolji je za brda, a motor u točku je jednostavniji i jeftiniji. Poslušajte da li motor zuji ili krcka pod opterećenjem i proverite da li ekran prikazuje sve podatke. Kočnice i lanac troše se brže nego na običnom biciklu. Tražite originalni punjač, ključeve baterije i račun, zbog garancije i dokaza o poreklu. Klasične modele nudi rubrika [bicikli](/oglasi/sport/bicikli), a za kratke gradske relacije tu su [električni trotineti](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti).', text_en = 'Electric bikes help you turn the pedals, so hills and wind are no longer an obstacle: city models with a low frame, electric mountain bikes, folding ones for the flat and the car boot, and cargo bikes for deliveries. More and more people who want to get to work without sweating use them too.

The battery is the most expensive part, so start with it. Ask how old it is and how many charge cycles it has been through, and check the range on a test ride, not on paper. A mid-drive motor gives a more natural feel and is better for hills, while a hub motor is simpler and cheaper. Listen whether the motor hums or clicks under load and check that the display shows all the data. Brakes and chain wear faster than on an ordinary bike. Ask for the original charger, the battery keys and the receipt, for the warranty and as proof of origin. Classic models are in [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli), and for short city trips there are [electric scooters](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'bikes') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'e-bikes' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Trake za trčanje za hodanje i trening kod kuće: sklopive električne trake, tanke trake za hodanje koje staju pod krevet ili radni sto, mehaničke trake bez motora i jače trake sa promenom nagiba. Mnoge su kupljene sa velikim planovima, a korišćene tek nekoliko puta.

Širina i dužina gazne površine važnije su nego što izgleda: višim osobama i za trčanje treba duža traka, dok je za hodanje dovoljna kraća. Proverite najveću brzinu, nosivost i da li se nagib menja motorom ili ručno. Stanite na traku i pustite je da radi desetak minuta na raznim brzinama: platno ne sme da zastajkuje pod korakom, a motor da miriše na paljevinu. Pogledajte da li platno ide sredinom i kada je poslednji put podmazano. Sigurnosni ključ mora da zaustavi traku čim se izvuče. Zbog težine dogovorite prevoz unapred. Tiše sprave nudi stranica [sobni bicikli i orbitreci](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli), obuću rubrika [patike za trčanje](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), a ostalo rubrika [fitnes oprema](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).', text_en = 'Treadmills for walking and training at home: folding electric treadmills, slim walking pads that fit under a bed or a desk, manual treadmills without a motor and stronger ones with adjustable incline. Many were bought with big plans and used only a few times.

The width and length of the running surface matter more than it seems: taller people and running need a longer belt, while a shorter one is enough for walking. Check the top speed, the weight limit and whether the incline is changed by a motor or by hand. Stand on the treadmill and let it run for ten minutes or so at different speeds: the belt must not hesitate under your step, and the motor must not smell of burning. See whether the belt runs centrally and when it was last lubricated. The safety key must stop the belt as soon as it is pulled out. Because of the weight, arrange transport in advance. Quieter machines are on the page [exercise bikes and cross trainers](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli), footwear in [running shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), and the rest in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fitness') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'treadmills' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Tegovi i bučice za trening snage kod kuće: jednoručni tegovi fiksne težine, podesive bučice sa pločama, olimpijske i standardne šipke, ploče od livenog gvožđa i gumirane ploče, girje, klupe i stalci. Gvožđe ne zastareva, pa je polovno jednako dobro kao novo.

Najpre proverite prečnik otvora na pločama i debljinu šipke: standardne i olimpijske šipke nisu međusobno uklopive, pa dokupljujte isti sistem. Šipku zakotrljajte po ravnom podu da vidite da li je kriva, a kod olimpijske proverite da li se rukavci okreću. Površinska rđa se skida četkom i ne smeta, ali napukla ploča nije za upotrebu. Kod podesivih bučica pogledajte navoje i matice, koji moraju čvrsto da drže ploče. Klupa treba da stoji stabilno i da ima dovoljnu nosivost za vas i teret. Računajte cenu po kilogramu i uporedite više oglasa. Za zagrevanje poslužiće [sobni bicikl](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli), za trening su udobne [muške trenerke](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke), a ostale sprave nudi rubrika [fitnes oprema](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).', text_en = 'Weights and dumbbells for strength training at home: fixed-weight dumbbells, adjustable dumbbells with plates, Olympic and standard bars, cast-iron and rubber-coated plates, kettlebells, benches and racks. Iron does not go out of date, so second-hand is as good as new.

First check the diameter of the hole in the plates and the thickness of the bar: standard and Olympic bars are not interchangeable, so add to the same system. Roll a bar across a flat floor to see whether it is bent, and on an Olympic bar check that the sleeves spin. Surface rust comes off with a brush and does no harm, but a cracked plate is not fit for use. On adjustable dumbbells, look at the threads and the collars, which must hold the plates firmly. A bench should stand firm and have enough capacity for you and the load. Work out the price per kilogram and compare several ads. An [exercise bike](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli) will do for warming up, [men''s tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) are comfortable for training, and other machines are in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fitness') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'weights' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Sobni bicikli i orbitreci za kondiciju bez opterećenja zglobova: klasični sobni bicikli, bicikli sa teškim zamajcem za intenzivan trening, ležeći bicikli sa naslonom, orbitreci za celo telo i mali pedal trenažeri za rehabilitaciju. Rade tiho, pa mogu da stoje i u stanu.

Sedite i vozite nekoliko minuta na svakom stepenu otpora: okretanje treba da bude glatko, bez preskakanja, škripe i lupanja. Teži zamajac daje ravnomerniji osećaj vožnje. Magnetni otpor je tiši i ne traži održavanje, dok se filc kod mehaničkog otpora troši i menja. Proverite da li se sedište i upravljač podešavaju po visini i udaljenosti, da sprava odgovara svim ukućanima. Kod orbitreka probajte dužinu koraka, jer prekratak korak smeta višim osobama. Senzori pulsa na ručkama i računar treba da rade. Pogledajte nosivost i dimenzije. Za hodanje i trčanje tu su [trake za trčanje](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/trake-za-trcanje), za snagu [tegovi i bučice](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice), a za vožnju napolju [bicikli](/oglasi/sport/bicikli).', text_en = 'Exercise bikes and cross trainers for fitness without loading the joints: classic exercise bikes, bikes with a heavy flywheel for intensive training, recumbent bikes with a backrest, cross trainers for the whole body and small pedal exercisers for rehabilitation. They run quietly, so they can stand in a flat too.

Sit down and ride for a few minutes at every resistance level: the motion should be smooth, without skipping, squeaking or knocking. A heavier flywheel gives a more even ride. Magnetic resistance is quieter and needs no maintenance, whereas the felt pad of mechanical resistance wears and gets replaced. Check that the saddle and handlebar adjust for height and reach, so that the machine suits everyone in the household. On a cross trainer, try the stride length, because too short a stride bothers taller people. The pulse sensors on the grips and the computer should work. Look at the weight limit and the dimensions. For walking and running there are [treadmills](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/trake-za-trcanje), for strength [weights and dumbbells](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice), and for riding outdoors [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'fitness') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'exercise-bikes' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Ski odeća za stazu i sneg: ski jakne i pantalone, jednodelni kombinezoni, dečja ski odela, termo veš, rukavice, kape, podkape i čarape. Deca prerastu ski odelo za sezonu ili dve, pa je polovna odeća za njih najrazumniji izbor.

Na etiketi potražite oznake vodootpornosti i prozračnosti: veći brojevi znače da odeća duže ostaje suva i spolja i iznutra. Lepljeni šavovi, snežni pojas u jakni i ojačanja na dnu nogavica razlikuju pravu ski odeću od obične zimske. Proverite rajsferšluse, čičak na manžetnama i tregere. Membrana vremenom gubi svojstva ako je odeća prana običnim deterdžentom, pa pitajte kako je održavana. Veličinu birajte tako da ispod stane sloj termo veša i duks. Kod dečjih odela nogavice i rukavi često mogu da se produže za jednu sezonu. Opremu za vožnju nudi stranica [skije i pancerice](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), zabavu za najmlađe stranica [sanke i klizaljke](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke), a krov nad glavom rubrika [smeštaj na planinama](/oglasi/odmor/planine).', text_en = 'Ski wear for the piste and the snow: ski jackets and trousers, one-piece suits, children''s ski suits, thermal underwear, gloves, hats, balaclavas and socks. Children outgrow a ski suit in a season or two, so second-hand clothing is the most sensible choice for them.

Look on the label for the waterproof and breathability ratings: higher numbers mean the clothing stays dry for longer, outside and inside. Taped seams, a snow skirt in the jacket and reinforcements at the bottom of the legs distinguish real ski wear from ordinary winter clothing. Check the zips, the hook-and-loop on the cuffs and the braces. A membrane loses its properties over time if the clothing was washed with ordinary detergent, so ask how it was cared for. Choose a size that leaves room underneath for a thermal layer and a sweatshirt. On children''s suits the legs and sleeves can often be lengthened for one more season. Riding equipment is on the page [skis and ski boots](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), fun for the youngest on the page [sledges and ice skates](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke), and a roof over your head in [mountain accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/planine).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'winter-sports') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'ski-wear' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Skije i pancerice za sve nivoe znanja: skije za uređene staze, kraće slalomske i duže veleslalomske, široke skije za duboki sneg, dečje skije, skije za nordijsko trčanje, pancerice i štapovi. Polovan komplet je razuman početak za one koji skijaju jednom ili dva puta godišnje.

Skiju stavite na ravnu podlogu i pogledajte je sa strane: treba da ima luk po sredini, koji pod pritiskom ravnomerno nestaje. Ivice ne smeju da budu izlomljene ni istanjene od brušenja, a duboke brazde na kliznoj površini traže servis. Vezovi imaju vek trajanja i servis odbija da podešava veoma stare modele, pa proverite godište. Kod pancerica probajte spoljnu čizmu i uložak posebno: plastika stara dvadesetak godina može da pukne na hladnoći. Kopče i kaiš moraju da drže. Štap je dobre dužine ako je podlaktica vodoravna kada ga držite. Topla i suva [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca) podjednako je važna, a pred put pogledajte i [smeštaj na planinama](/oglasi/odmor/planine).', text_en = 'Skis and ski boots for every level of skill: piste skis, shorter slalom and longer giant-slalom skis, wide skis for deep snow, children''s skis, cross-country skis, boots and poles. A second-hand set is a sensible start for those who ski once or twice a year.

Put the ski on a flat surface and look at it from the side: it should have an arch in the middle that disappears evenly under pressure. The edges must not be chipped or thinned by grinding, and deep grooves in the base call for a service. Bindings have a service life and workshops refuse to adjust very old models, so check the year. With boots, try the shell and the liner separately: plastic that is twenty or so years old can crack in the cold. The buckles and the strap must hold. A pole is the right length if your forearm is level when you hold it. Warm, dry [ski wear](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca) is equally important, and before the trip see [mountain accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/planine) too.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'winter-sports') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'skis' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Sanke i klizaljke za zimsku radost: drvene sanke sa naslonom za najmlađe, plastične sanke i tanjiri, bob sanke sa volanom i kočnicom, klizaljke za rekreaciju, hokejaške i umetničke klizaljke i podesive dečje klizaljke, koje rastu sa stopalom.

Kod drvenih sanki pogledajte letvice sedišta i metalne klizače: rđa se skida, ali napuklo drvo i rasklimani spojevi nisu bezbedni na nizbrdici. Plastične sanke proverite na pukotine, naročito ako su stajale na suncu ili mrazu. Kod bob sanki probajte volan i kočnicu. Klizaljke moraju čvrsto da drže skočni zglob, pa pritisnite čizmu sa strane: omekšala ne pruža oslonac. Sečiva treba da budu bez rđe i dubokih zareza, a oštrenje u servisu vraća im ivicu. Podesive dečje klizaljke pokrivaju nekoliko brojeva i služe više sezona. Deci na ledu obavezno stavite kacigu i rukavice. Toplu odeću nudi stranica [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), letnju zamenu rubrika [roleri i skejtbord](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt), a ostalo rubrika [ski oprema](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi).', text_en = 'Sledges and ice skates for winter fun: wooden sledges with a backrest for the youngest, plastic sledges and saucers, bobsleighs with a steering wheel and brake, recreational skates, hockey and figure skates and adjustable children''s skates that grow with the foot.

On wooden sledges, look at the seat slats and the metal runners: rust comes off, but cracked wood and loose joints are not safe on a slope. Check plastic sledges for cracks, especially if they stood in the sun or frost. On a bobsleigh, try the steering wheel and the brake. Skates must hold the ankle firmly, so press the boot from the side: one that has softened gives no support. The blades should be free of rust and deep nicks, and sharpening at a workshop restores their edge. Adjustable children''s skates cover several sizes and last for several seasons. Always put a helmet and gloves on children on the ice. Warm clothing is on the page [ski wear](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), the summer substitute in [roller skates and skateboards](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt), and the rest in [ski equipment](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'winter-sports') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type = 'sledges' AND brand IS NULL AND city_id IS NULL AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
SQL;
